WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.074
Do you want subtitles for any video?
-=[ ai.OpenSubtitles.com ]=-

2
00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:26.270
[popping]

3
00:00:43.830 --> 00:00:45.960
[soft rustling]

4
00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:02.760
[KAGAYA]
Within the next five days.

5
00:01:02.810 --> 00:01:04.480
Muzan will come.

6
00:01:10.810 --> 00:01:13.610
I will be the bait you use.

7
00:01:14.320 --> 00:01:17.280
When he comes.
I need you to behead him.

8
00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:24.750
Master. what leads you
to believe he'll find you?

9
00:01:25.580 --> 00:01:27.710
[Kagaya chuckles weakly]

10
00:01:27.750 --> 00:01:30.460
My intuition. That's all.

11
00:01:31.210 --> 00:01:32.960
Nothing beyond that.

12
00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:36.510
But listen.
the others can't know.

13
00:01:37.050 --> 00:01:41.720
They would never agree
to using me as bait like this.

14
00:01:41.760 --> 00:01:44.100
They would sooner die
than do it.

15
00:01:44.890 --> 00:01:49.140
You're the only one
that I can ask. Gyomei.

16
00:01:51.440 --> 00:01:55.030
Even if you behead him.
he won't die.

17
00:01:56.990 --> 00:02:00.700
There's likely only one way
to destroy Muzan.

18
00:02:00.740 --> 00:02:04.330
Trapping him in place
until sunlight shines upon him.

19
00:02:05.120 --> 00:02:07.910
If beheading isn't enough
to kill him.

20
00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:10.000
there's only one option left.

21
00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:14.750
You all must endure a battle
until the sun rises.

22
00:02:15.920 --> 00:02:17.050
Yes. sir.

23
00:02:18.470 --> 00:02:21.340
If that is your wish.
then so be it. Master.

24
00:02:25.060 --> 00:02:26.600
[KAGAYA] Thank goodness.

25
00:02:32.440 --> 00:02:35.860
Gyomei. after I have perished.

26
00:02:36.480 --> 00:02:39.240
please do not let
any more of my children

27
00:02:39.280 --> 00:02:40.780
be sent to their graves.

28
00:02:41.530 --> 00:02:43.700
That is my wish.

29
00:02:58.840 --> 00:03:00.970
[♪ tense music playing]

30
00:03:01.010 --> 00:03:03.260
[MUZAN] You think
you've driven me into a corner

31
00:03:03.300 --> 00:03:04.680
with your little plan?

32
00:03:06.510 --> 00:03:10.060
But you are all about to be
going straight to hell!

33
00:03:10.100 --> 00:03:12.230
Mark my words. Demon Slayers.

34
00:03:12.270 --> 00:03:15.900
I'll massacre every one of you
before sunrise!

35
00:03:15.940 --> 00:03:17.190
[grunts angrily]

36
00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:18.780
[Nakime plucking biwa strings]

37
00:03:20.070 --> 00:03:22.740
You're the only one
going to hell!

38
00:03:22.780 --> 00:03:24.490
And you won't get away!

39
00:03:25.490 --> 00:03:27.580
Oh. is that so?

40
00:03:27.620 --> 00:03:29.700
Let's see you try.

41
00:03:30.080 --> 00:03:32.670
Tanjiro Kamado!

42
00:03:32.710 --> 00:03:34.330
[rumbling]

43
00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:36.750
I will defeat you!

44
00:03:38.250 --> 00:03:40.260
Muzan Kibutsuji!

45
00:03:40.300 --> 00:03:45.470
DEMON SLAYER: KIMETSU NO YAIBA
THE MOVIE: INFINITY CASTLE

46
00:03:46.680 --> 00:03:49.180
[♪ opening theme song playing]

47
00:03:52.520 --> 00:03:54.190
What is this place?

48
00:03:54.810 --> 00:03:56.810
Everything's upside down.

49
00:03:58.020 --> 00:03:59.020
KILL

50
00:03:59.480 --> 00:04:01.900
Was all of this made using
the enemy's Blood Demon Art?

51
00:04:04.490 --> 00:04:06.700
I don't understand
what's happening.

52
00:04:06.740 --> 00:04:09.740
except that Ms. Tamayo
was restraining Muzan.

53
00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:14.210
Even so. how long
can she keep that up?

54
00:04:14.250 --> 00:04:16.750
[screaming]

55
00:04:16.790 --> 00:04:18.500
[IGURO] Calm down. Kanroji.

56
00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:20.250
[gasps] Yes!

57
00:04:20.800 --> 00:04:22.260
[IGURO] Stay with me.

58
00:04:34.770 --> 00:04:35.770
[gasps]

59
00:04:38.980 --> 00:04:41.280
[Gyomei grunts]

60
00:04:55.540 --> 00:04:57.000
[effort grunts]

61
00:04:57.370 --> 00:04:58.670
[effort grunts]

62
00:05:17.190 --> 00:05:19.770
[TANJIRO] I need to reach Muzan
as soon as possible

63
00:05:19.810 --> 00:05:22.820
and defeat him
by whatever means!

64
00:05:26.610 --> 00:05:28.410
[grunts]

65
00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:31.330
[♪ Gregorian chanting]

66
00:05:31.370 --> 00:05:32.910
That's the bottom!

67
00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:34.790
I'll be killed at this speed!

68
00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:37.040
I'll use a move
to change directions.

69
00:05:37.080 --> 00:05:39.250
Then find something
to grab on to.

70
00:05:39.290 --> 00:05:40.500
DESTROY

71
00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:42.090
[♪ music intensifies]

72
00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:46.720
It didn't work. I can't
break away from this free fall.

73
00:05:49.930 --> 00:05:50.970
DESTROYER OF DEMONS

74
00:06:06.190 --> 00:06:08.360
[♪ low tense music playing]

75
00:06:19.750 --> 00:06:21.330
[♪ music fades]

76
00:06:28.510 --> 00:06:30.630
[Tanjiro panting]

77
00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:37.470
[GIYU] You all right?

78
00:06:38.890 --> 00:06:41.440
Yes. Thanks for your help.

79
00:06:41.890 --> 00:06:43.060
[sighs in relief]

80
00:06:43.480 --> 00:06:44.820
You really saved--

81
00:06:46.780 --> 00:06:49.490
Water Breathing. First Form:

82
00:06:49.530 --> 00:06:51.150
Water Surface Slash.

83
00:06:53.320 --> 00:06:54.450
[GIYU] Tanjiro!

84
00:06:57.040 --> 00:06:59.080
[♪ intense music playing]

85
00:07:00.790 --> 00:07:02.750
[hinges creaking]

86
00:07:04.750 --> 00:07:06.040
[snarling]

87
00:07:16.560 --> 00:07:18.060
[BOTH] Water Breathing.

88
00:07:18.520 --> 00:07:19.890
[TANJIRO] Sixth Form.

89
00:07:19.930 --> 00:07:21.350
[GIYU] Third Form.

90
00:07:22.940 --> 00:07:24.690
[TANJIRO] Whirlpool!

91
00:07:24.730 --> 00:07:26.310
[GIYU] Flowing Dance.

92
00:07:31.940 --> 00:07:33.200
[Tanjiro groans nervously]

93
00:07:34.070 --> 00:07:36.030
Mr. Giyu's amazing.

94
00:07:37.030 --> 00:07:39.490
He can tell exactly which move
I'm gonna use.

95
00:07:39.990 --> 00:07:41.200
Then he follows up with one

96
00:07:41.250 --> 00:07:43.710
that prevents
any kind of friendly fire.

97
00:07:44.370 --> 00:07:46.210
He's unbelievable.

98
00:07:47.250 --> 00:07:49.300
Just what's behind those eyes?

99
00:07:49.340 --> 00:07:51.470
[stifled whimpering]

100
00:07:52.010 --> 00:07:53.550
If I'm not mistaken...

101
00:07:53.970 --> 00:07:55.220
this is the place

102
00:07:55.260 --> 00:07:57.430
that Shinazugawa and Iguro
mentioned.

103
00:07:57.470 --> 00:07:59.510
[♪ Gregorian chanting]

104
00:08:00.890 --> 00:08:02.180
Which means

105
00:08:02.230 --> 00:08:05.310
Kibutsuji's plan
was to gather everyone here.

106
00:08:05.350 --> 00:08:07.940
then kill us all
in one fell swoop.

107
00:08:09.730 --> 00:08:13.360
From here on out. we'll need
to be even more vigilant.

108
00:08:14.240 --> 00:08:15.360
Right.

109
00:08:17.410 --> 00:08:18.910
-Let's go.
-Right!

110
00:08:18.950 --> 00:08:19.950
PITTER PATTER

111
00:08:19.990 --> 00:08:22.200
[♪ dramatic music playing]

112
00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:35.970
[demons snarling]

113
00:08:41.640 --> 00:08:44.600
[IGURO]
Serpent Breathing. Fifth Form:

114
00:08:51.570 --> 00:08:53.820
Slithering Serpent!

115
00:08:56.320 --> 00:09:00.120
You demon scum!
Stay away from Kanroji!

116
00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:01.870
[squealing]

117
00:09:01.910 --> 00:09:04.330
Mr. Iguro is so cool!

118
00:09:05.410 --> 00:09:07.330
-Are you hurt?
-No. not at all!

119
00:09:07.370 --> 00:09:09.290
-Then. let's go.
-Okay!

120
00:09:09.790 --> 00:09:12.250
[Kanroji squealing]

121
00:09:21.390 --> 00:09:22.640
[grunts]

122
00:09:30.150 --> 00:09:31.270
Tokito!

123
00:09:31.310 --> 00:09:33.820
[demons snarling]

124
00:09:38.280 --> 00:09:40.450
[MUICHIRO] There's a whole lot
of demons. huh?

125
00:09:40.490 --> 00:09:42.160
[GYOMEI] It would seem
they've been given

126
00:09:42.200 --> 00:09:44.080
the strength of the Lower Ranks.

127
00:09:44.120 --> 00:09:47.370
It's clear that they're being
used to try and exhaust us.

128
00:09:49.210 --> 00:09:51.170
[metallic rattling]

129
00:09:51.210 --> 00:09:52.380
[MUICHIRO] Hmm.

130
00:09:53.130 --> 00:09:54.550
What of the Master?

131
00:09:55.630 --> 00:09:58.510
[GYOMEI] He has departed
from this world.

132
00:09:59.050 --> 00:10:01.550
It was a truly noble end.

133
00:10:02.760 --> 00:10:03.970
Knowing him.

134
00:10:04.510 --> 00:10:07.680
he never would have allowed
himself to be caught unawares.

135
00:10:08.440 --> 00:10:10.560
Did he sacrifice himself?

136
00:10:11.230 --> 00:10:15.360
[GYOMEI] Indeed. The Master
did not have much time left.

137
00:10:22.370 --> 00:10:23.620
[MUICHIRO] Master.

138
00:10:30.370 --> 00:10:33.170
Back when I was mortally wounded
by a demon

139
00:10:33.210 --> 00:10:35.250
and found myself
teetering on the edge

140
00:10:35.300 --> 00:10:36.880
between life and death...

141
00:10:37.760 --> 00:10:39.630
...he stayed by my side.

142
00:10:42.340 --> 00:10:45.260
He did the same
for every Corps member

143
00:10:45.310 --> 00:10:47.060
who was on the brink of death.

144
00:10:49.270 --> 00:10:50.730
Like a father.

145
00:10:52.940 --> 00:10:54.730
[GYOMEI] Yes. I know.

146
00:10:55.360 --> 00:10:58.280
[MUICHIRO] Muzan not only
took my brother from me.

147
00:10:58.820 --> 00:11:00.400
but our father as well.

148
00:11:01.400 --> 00:11:02.950
That bastard.

149
00:11:02.990 --> 00:11:04.370
Damn him!

150
00:11:04.740 --> 00:11:06.950
I swear I'll make him suffer.

151
00:11:06.990 --> 00:11:09.080
I'll send him straight to hell!

152
00:11:10.290 --> 00:11:11.830
[GYOMEI] You're not alone.

153
00:11:16.090 --> 00:11:19.170
Trust me. we all feel the same.

154
00:11:23.930 --> 00:11:26.220
DESTROY

155
00:11:26.260 --> 00:11:28.470
[SHINAZUGAWA]
Forgive me. Master.

156
00:11:30.100 --> 00:11:32.270
I couldn't protect you.

157
00:11:35.730 --> 00:11:38.150
[distorted grunting]

158
00:11:39.780 --> 00:11:41.070
[blade rasps]

159
00:11:44.570 --> 00:11:46.240
[♪ upbeat music playing]

160
00:11:47.530 --> 00:11:51.040
There's no end
to you lowlifes. huh?

161
00:11:51.620 --> 00:11:53.830
[demon cackling]

162
00:11:53.870 --> 00:11:56.250
That's just fine by me.

163
00:11:56.290 --> 00:11:58.250
I'll kill all of you!

164
00:12:06.220 --> 00:12:07.680
[INOSUKE] Hyah!

165
00:12:08.220 --> 00:12:11.140
Make way! I'm coming through!

166
00:12:11.680 --> 00:12:13.390
[chuckles]

167
00:12:13.430 --> 00:12:16.270
Whole lotta falling
happening here!

168
00:12:17.110 --> 00:12:21.230
Hyah! Pretty rude to just
drop me in here out of nowhere!

169
00:12:21.280 --> 00:12:23.860
Though I've been itching to see
how my training's paying off.

170
00:12:23.900 --> 00:12:27.950
So with that in mind.
let's test it out on you chubs!

171
00:12:27.990 --> 00:12:29.280
[chuckles]

172
00:12:29.330 --> 00:12:31.580
Let's go!

173
00:12:31.620 --> 00:12:34.250
[grunting]

174
00:12:35.670 --> 00:12:37.920
[Genya panting]

175
00:12:38.460 --> 00:12:41.050
Where am I?
The Demon Headquarters?

176
00:12:41.090 --> 00:12:42.590
Where are the others?

177
00:12:43.220 --> 00:12:44.800
Big Brother.

178
00:12:45.840 --> 00:12:47.930
I hope you're safe. too.

179
00:12:52.560 --> 00:12:54.310
[ZENITSU] I just heard a sound.

180
00:12:54.810 --> 00:12:57.350
Could it be that
he's somewhere nearby?

181
00:12:57.980 --> 00:13:00.980
[demons snarling]

182
00:13:02.900 --> 00:13:04.440
You'll regret this.

183
00:13:06.150 --> 00:13:07.860
I won't forgive you.

184
00:13:07.910 --> 00:13:09.910
Not in a million years.

185
00:13:34.390 --> 00:13:35.850
[SHINOBU] I smell blood.

186
00:13:45.030 --> 00:13:46.650
What is this place?

187
00:13:54.410 --> 00:13:56.290
[chomping]

188
00:14:03.590 --> 00:14:04.710
[DEMON] Hmm?

189
00:14:06.010 --> 00:14:07.670
Oh. my. You're here.

190
00:14:08.380 --> 00:14:09.340
UPPER TWO

191
00:14:09.380 --> 00:14:11.340
Oh! And you're a girl. too!

192
00:14:12.100 --> 00:14:15.600
What a young and tasty morsel
we have. [chuckles]

193
00:14:16.310 --> 00:14:19.770
I'll have to properly thank
Nakime for this later.

194
00:14:22.110 --> 00:14:24.230
[Shinobu panting]

195
00:14:32.120 --> 00:14:34.240
[whimpers softly]

196
00:14:35.580 --> 00:14:37.000
[KANAE] Shinobu.

197
00:14:37.040 --> 00:14:40.210
You must leave
the Demon Slayer Corps.

198
00:14:42.040 --> 00:14:44.880
I know that
you've trained really hard

199
00:14:45.590 --> 00:14:47.880
and you're fighting
to make a difference.

200
00:14:48.380 --> 00:14:51.510
-[sobbing softly]
-But I don't think you'll...

201
00:14:52.180 --> 00:14:53.220
[sighs softly]

202
00:14:53.260 --> 00:14:54.930
[stifled sobbing]

203
00:14:57.180 --> 00:15:00.980
I want you to live the life
of a happy. normal girl.

204
00:15:01.640 --> 00:15:04.730
To be able to see
your own hair turn gray.

205
00:15:06.230 --> 00:15:07.190
DESTROYER OF DEMONS

206
00:15:07.230 --> 00:15:09.820
Really... you've done enough.

207
00:15:09.860 --> 00:15:12.280
[SHINOBU] No! [sobbing]
Can't stop now!

208
00:15:12.320 --> 00:15:15.450
I will avenge you
if it's the last thing I do!

209
00:15:15.490 --> 00:15:17.910
This demon! I need to know...

210
00:15:17.950 --> 00:15:19.950
I have to know
what it looked like!

211
00:15:20.500 --> 00:15:23.000
Please. Big Sister.
I'm begging you!

212
00:15:23.040 --> 00:15:24.330
Tell me!

213
00:15:24.880 --> 00:15:28.960
I could never live a normal life
knowing someone did this to you!

214
00:15:29.010 --> 00:15:30.760
[sobbing] Please!

215
00:15:32.090 --> 00:15:33.340
[sighs weakly]

216
00:15:35.430 --> 00:15:36.800
[KANAE] It was a demon

217
00:15:36.850 --> 00:15:39.770
with a blood-stained pattern
on his head.

218
00:15:41.680 --> 00:15:44.600
[DEMON] I must say. it's very
nice to meet you. miss.

219
00:15:44.650 --> 00:15:47.270
You may refer to me as Doma.

220
00:15:47.770 --> 00:15:50.940
Ah. what a wonderful night!

221
00:15:52.490 --> 00:15:55.570
[SHINOBU] Such a warm smile
and gentle voice.

222
00:15:56.070 --> 00:15:59.330
There's a soft.
benevolent presence to him.

223
00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:03.290
[woman weakly] Please. help me.

224
00:16:04.170 --> 00:16:05.670
Please help me!

225
00:16:05.710 --> 00:16:07.040
Shh.

226
00:16:07.540 --> 00:16:09.420
Can't you see that
we're talking?

227
00:16:13.170 --> 00:16:14.180
Hmm?

228
00:16:14.220 --> 00:16:15.680
[SHINOBU] Are you all right?

229
00:16:16.300 --> 00:16:17.680
[DOMA] Wow!

230
00:16:17.720 --> 00:16:20.720
That was fast.
Are you a Hashira?

231
00:16:20.770 --> 00:16:22.770
[labored breathing]

232
00:16:23.520 --> 00:16:24.980
[squelching]

233
00:16:25.730 --> 00:16:28.190
-[gasps]
-[♪ unsettling music playing]

234
00:16:29.320 --> 00:16:31.320
[DOMA]
Oh. don't worry about that.

235
00:16:31.360 --> 00:16:33.280
You can just leave her
right there.

236
00:16:33.320 --> 00:16:35.610
I'll make
a proper meal of her later.

237
00:16:36.070 --> 00:16:37.120
[exhales]

238
00:16:38.870 --> 00:16:40.410
And this demon...

239
00:16:40.910 --> 00:16:42.620
the weapon he used.

240
00:16:43.200 --> 00:16:45.830
it was a pair of sharp fans.

241
00:16:46.750 --> 00:16:48.290
[metallic scraping]

242
00:16:48.840 --> 00:16:51.880
As the founder
of the Eternal Paradise Faith.

243
00:16:51.920 --> 00:16:53.880
it is my sworn duty to see that

244
00:16:53.920 --> 00:16:56.430
all my followers
attain happiness.

245
00:16:56.930 --> 00:16:59.510
I'll be sure
to consume her completely.

246
00:17:01.430 --> 00:17:02.810
[SHINOBU] There's no doubt.

247
00:17:02.850 --> 00:17:05.390
This is the demon
who killed my sister.

248
00:17:06.850 --> 00:17:08.770
Attaining happiness?

249
00:17:08.810 --> 00:17:10.440
For who exactly?

250
00:17:10.940 --> 00:17:13.860
This girl was horrified.
crying out for help.

251
00:17:14.360 --> 00:17:16.200
-And that's why I saved her.
-[fans scraping]

252
00:17:16.860 --> 00:17:19.660
Her suffering
has come to an end.

253
00:17:19.990 --> 00:17:21.530
No more pain.

254
00:17:21.870 --> 00:17:23.200
No more fear.

255
00:17:24.200 --> 00:17:26.410
Everyone is afraid of death.

256
00:17:26.870 --> 00:17:29.420
So I help them
by consuming them.

257
00:17:30.080 --> 00:17:34.630
This way. they get to live on
within me for all eternity.

258
00:17:34.670 --> 00:17:37.430
I take in their entire being.

259
00:17:37.470 --> 00:17:39.680
Blood. Desires.

260
00:17:40.220 --> 00:17:41.930
Even the last bit of their sinew

261
00:17:42.430 --> 00:17:45.230
-and help their souls transcend.
-[♪ unsettling music playing]

262
00:17:45.270 --> 00:17:47.890
What you're spouting
is sheer nonsense.

263
00:17:48.480 --> 00:17:50.360
And to say it with such glee...

264
00:17:50.860 --> 00:17:52.770
You truly make me sick!

265
00:17:52.820 --> 00:17:54.780
Aw.

266
00:17:55.400 --> 00:17:59.070
I can't believe you'd say that
after we'd only just met.

267
00:17:59.110 --> 00:18:00.780
Oh. I see.

268
00:18:00.820 --> 00:18:03.080
Oh. you poor thing.

269
00:18:03.120 --> 00:18:05.790
Did something unfortunate
happen?

270
00:18:05.830 --> 00:18:07.370
Let's hear it.

271
00:18:07.410 --> 00:18:08.870
Go on. tell me.

272
00:18:10.210 --> 00:18:13.380
"Unfortunate" doesn't begin
to describe it!

273
00:18:13.420 --> 00:18:16.550
You are the one who killed
my big sister. weren't you?

274
00:18:16.590 --> 00:18:19.590
Does the haori I'm wearing
mean nothing to you?!

275
00:18:19.630 --> 00:18:20.890
Huh?

276
00:18:25.470 --> 00:18:27.060
[blade rasps]

277
00:18:31.270 --> 00:18:32.520
[flesh squelching]

278
00:18:33.060 --> 00:18:34.360
[DOMA] That's right.

279
00:18:34.440 --> 00:18:37.530
It belonged to the girl
who used Flower Breathing.

280
00:18:38.070 --> 00:18:40.410
Such a sweet. gentle child.

281
00:18:41.320 --> 00:18:43.950
The sun came up
and cut our time short.

282
00:18:43.990 --> 00:18:45.370
I remember.

283
00:18:45.410 --> 00:18:48.000
It's a shame I didn't get-- Her.

284
00:18:49.870 --> 00:18:51.080
[SHINOBU] Insect Breathing.

285
00:18:51.120 --> 00:18:53.880
Dance of the Bee Sting:
True Flutter.

286
00:18:55.250 --> 00:18:57.090
A marvelous thrust.

287
00:18:57.130 --> 00:18:59.050
I hardly even saw it.

288
00:19:01.010 --> 00:19:02.760
Blood Demon Art:

289
00:19:03.840 --> 00:19:06.010
Frozen Lotus.

290
00:19:07.180 --> 00:19:08.560
[Shinobu shivering] So cold.

291
00:19:08.600 --> 00:19:10.940
It feels like my lungs
are bursting.

292
00:19:11.850 --> 00:19:13.150
[DOMA] Hmm.

293
00:19:13.190 --> 00:19:15.360
Look at that. You are fast.

294
00:19:15.900 --> 00:19:17.980
Unfortunately for you.

295
00:19:18.030 --> 00:19:21.150
those thrusts aren't enough
to kill a demon.

296
00:19:21.200 --> 00:19:22.410
[slurps]

297
00:19:23.160 --> 00:19:24.280
[rattling]

298
00:19:24.320 --> 00:19:26.030
Aim for here.

299
00:19:26.530 --> 00:19:29.120
You need to chop off my head.

300
00:19:30.200 --> 00:19:31.160
DESTROY

301
00:19:31.210 --> 00:19:34.080
My thrusts alone
may not be enough.

302
00:19:34.130 --> 00:19:35.590
but what of this?

303
00:19:35.630 --> 00:19:37.710
-[clanks]
-[ratchets. clicks]

304
00:19:38.670 --> 00:19:39.670
[Doma groans]

305
00:19:40.090 --> 00:19:42.300
[SHINOBU] Time to see
whether this toxin

306
00:19:42.340 --> 00:19:44.090
works on an Upper Rank.

307
00:19:45.760 --> 00:19:50.430
Sister. lend me
your strength. please.

308
00:19:51.230 --> 00:19:52.480
[retches]

309
00:19:52.520 --> 00:19:54.400
[straining] This poison.

310
00:19:54.440 --> 00:19:57.610
It's clearly far stronger
than the strain you used

311
00:19:57.650 --> 00:20:00.440
up on Rui's mountain. [wheezing]

312
00:20:00.940 --> 00:20:03.200
[SHINOBU] So they did
exchange information.

313
00:20:03.660 --> 00:20:06.030
This is the drawback
to using poison.

314
00:20:06.070 --> 00:20:10.080
[DOMA] He told me that
you've been changing concoction

315
00:20:10.120 --> 00:20:13.410
for each demon you face.
[straining]

316
00:20:13.460 --> 00:20:15.790
-[coughs. retches]
-[blood splatters]

317
00:20:16.500 --> 00:20:18.250
[wheezing]

318
00:20:20.800 --> 00:20:22.420
Oh. my.

319
00:20:22.470 --> 00:20:26.890
It would seem that I've already
neutralized all of your poison.

320
00:20:26.930 --> 00:20:28.220
How rude of me.

321
00:20:28.260 --> 00:20:31.560
And after you'd made it
just for me.

322
00:20:32.060 --> 00:20:33.980
That sword of yours.

323
00:20:34.520 --> 00:20:37.770
it makes quite an interesting
sound when you sheathe it.

324
00:20:38.520 --> 00:20:41.860
Is that where you change
what poison you use?

325
00:20:41.900 --> 00:20:44.700
Yay! This is fun!

326
00:20:45.530 --> 00:20:48.410
Who knew being poisoned
was so invigorating?

327
00:20:48.450 --> 00:20:50.200
It's almost addictive.

328
00:20:50.240 --> 00:20:52.700
What will the next formula
be like? [chuckles]

329
00:20:52.740 --> 00:20:55.120
Come on. let's give it a try.

330
00:20:56.750 --> 00:20:58.750
-[swishing]
-[rattling]

331
00:21:01.300 --> 00:21:02.800
Very well then.

332
00:21:03.460 --> 00:21:04.920
I'll oblige.

333
00:21:04.970 --> 00:21:06.010
See...

334
00:21:09.720 --> 00:21:12.520
...I'd already anticipated
this would happen.

335
00:21:13.020 --> 00:21:15.980
[Doma chuckling]
Is your next batch set?

336
00:21:16.520 --> 00:21:18.350
I'm ready whenever you are.

337
00:21:22.650 --> 00:21:25.610
I know I just said
to give it a try...

338
00:21:27.150 --> 00:21:30.070
...but you could at least
change up your offense.

339
00:21:32.200 --> 00:21:34.120
-[metallic clanking]
-[Doma chuckles]

340
00:21:35.330 --> 00:21:37.580
-[continues chuckling]
-[grunts]

341
00:21:44.880 --> 00:21:46.510
What's this?

342
00:21:46.550 --> 00:21:49.010
You seem to be
slower than earlier.

343
00:21:49.050 --> 00:21:50.550
So sad.

344
00:21:50.600 --> 00:21:54.010
[SHINOBU] Insect Breathing.
Dance of the Horsefly:

345
00:21:54.060 --> 00:21:56.060
Enticing Slash!

346
00:22:03.520 --> 00:22:06.780
Oh. my.
You were able to land a hit.

347
00:22:06.820 --> 00:22:09.660
The way you got through
all my defenses.

348
00:22:09.700 --> 00:22:11.160
it's amazing!

349
00:22:11.200 --> 00:22:12.700
I'm truly impressed.

350
00:22:12.740 --> 00:22:15.750
It's almost enough
to bring a tear to my eye.

351
00:22:15.790 --> 00:22:18.000
Come on.
what are you waiting for?

352
00:22:18.040 --> 00:22:22.000
Hurry up and attack me again.
before I stop the poison.

353
00:22:22.040 --> 00:22:24.670
Please? You're doing so well.

354
00:22:24.710 --> 00:22:26.510
Maybe the next attack kills me.

355
00:22:26.550 --> 00:22:27.590
[disgruntled sigh]

356
00:22:31.430 --> 00:22:34.970
[laughs] Yes! That's the spirit!

357
00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:40.390
Ever since I was a child.

358
00:22:40.440 --> 00:22:42.440
I was kind and clever.

359
00:22:43.230 --> 00:22:45.480
I always helped those
who were in need

360
00:22:45.530 --> 00:22:47.990
and led them
to the path of happiness.

361
00:22:48.900 --> 00:22:50.820
It was my duty after all.

362
00:22:52.450 --> 00:22:55.280
[DOMA'S FATHER] His eyes
have the colors of a rainbow.

363
00:22:56.290 --> 00:22:59.410
And this gray hair
is proof of his innocence.

364
00:23:00.410 --> 00:23:02.380
This child is truly special.

365
00:23:02.870 --> 00:23:05.590
Surely he can hear
the voices of the gods.

366
00:23:05.630 --> 00:23:07.510
[♪ slow piano notes playing]

367
00:23:07.550 --> 00:23:11.260
[DOMA] My parents were
hopelessly naive simpletons.

368
00:23:11.840 --> 00:23:13.390
You'd have to be

369
00:23:13.430 --> 00:23:17.260
in order to found a religion
like the Eternal Paradise Faith.

370
00:23:18.220 --> 00:23:19.810
I pitied them.

371
00:23:19.850 --> 00:23:23.400
so I always played along
with their make-believe ideas.

372
00:23:24.520 --> 00:23:27.440
I never once heard
the voice of the gods.

373
00:23:28.360 --> 00:23:31.070
At first. I didn't know
how to deal

374
00:23:31.110 --> 00:23:34.660
with the hordes of people
worshiping and praying to me.

375
00:23:35.620 --> 00:23:38.660
Seeing these grown-ups
come crying to a child

376
00:23:38.700 --> 00:23:41.790
saying they were suffering.
pleading for help.

377
00:23:41.830 --> 00:23:45.210
made me worry
if they were sick in the head.

378
00:23:46.460 --> 00:23:50.170
After nearly putting me to sleep
with their personal stories.

379
00:23:50.210 --> 00:23:51.880
they would bow to me.

380
00:23:51.920 --> 00:23:54.550
asking to be guided to paradise.

381
00:23:55.050 --> 00:23:56.350
I cried.

382
00:23:57.560 --> 00:23:59.720
"You poor things." I thought.

383
00:24:00.220 --> 00:24:02.270
"Paradise doesn't even exist.

384
00:24:02.930 --> 00:24:07.060
It's just a fairy tale
concocted by deluded humans.

385
00:24:08.150 --> 00:24:10.650
There are no gods or Buddhas."

386
00:24:11.280 --> 00:24:13.780
These people
had lived for decades.

387
00:24:13.820 --> 00:24:16.990
yet they still couldn't grasp
that simple truth.

388
00:24:17.530 --> 00:24:20.660
When you die.
you return to nothingness.

389
00:24:20.700 --> 00:24:22.830
All feeling ceases.

390
00:24:23.580 --> 00:24:25.290
Your heart stops.

391
00:24:25.330 --> 00:24:27.080
Your brain stops.

392
00:24:27.130 --> 00:24:29.420
You rot and return to the earth.

393
00:24:29.920 --> 00:24:33.090
Such is the fate
of every living creature.

394
00:24:35.260 --> 00:24:38.510
To be too foolish
to accept reality.

395
00:24:39.140 --> 00:24:41.310
what a hard life that must be.

396
00:24:42.310 --> 00:24:45.520
I want to bring happiness
to these pitiful people.

397
00:24:46.020 --> 00:24:47.690
I want to save them.

398
00:24:48.560 --> 00:24:52.940
I truly believe
that is my purpose here.

399
00:24:56.950 --> 00:24:57.910
[squelches]

400
00:24:57.950 --> 00:24:59.070
[blade rasps]

401
00:24:59.120 --> 00:25:01.790
-Aw. Still nothing.
-[metallic rattling]

402
00:25:01.830 --> 00:25:03.500
And that was number five.

403
00:25:03.540 --> 00:25:05.040
What will you do?

404
00:25:05.580 --> 00:25:08.040
The toxin's
getting less effective.

405
00:25:08.540 --> 00:25:11.210
How many more times
do you think you can adapt it?

406
00:25:11.800 --> 00:25:14.130
-Oh! Are you out of breath now?
-[panting]

407
00:25:14.670 --> 00:25:16.300
Look at all that sweat.

408
00:25:16.340 --> 00:25:17.680
Are you all right?

409
00:25:18.300 --> 00:25:21.350
[SHINOBU] So. this is the power
of an Upper Rank.

410
00:25:22.060 --> 00:25:24.100
None of my poisons are working.

411
00:25:25.020 --> 00:25:28.190
He's adapting too fast
to keep up with.

412
00:25:30.360 --> 00:25:32.730
Your alveoli must be dead now.

413
00:25:32.780 --> 00:25:34.860
[crystals tinkling]

414
00:25:34.900 --> 00:25:36.280
Painful.

415
00:25:36.320 --> 00:25:39.660
You did breathe it in.
my Blood Demon Art.

416
00:25:41.830 --> 00:25:44.660
[SHINOBU] He turns
his frozen blood into mist

417
00:25:44.700 --> 00:25:47.040
and disperses it with his fans.

418
00:25:47.080 --> 00:25:50.170
Even breathing around him
is dangerous now.

419
00:25:55.920 --> 00:25:57.050
[clangs]

420
00:25:57.090 --> 00:25:58.130
[ratchets. clicks]

421
00:25:58.590 --> 00:26:02.180
This time. I'll increase
the dose with multiple strikes!

422
00:26:03.010 --> 00:26:06.230
Insect Breathing.
Dance of the Dragonfly:

423
00:26:13.060 --> 00:26:15.360
Compound Eye Hexagon!

424
00:26:17.900 --> 00:26:19.280
I can't believe it!

425
00:26:19.320 --> 00:26:21.280
Such blazing speed!

426
00:26:21.320 --> 00:26:24.830
You might be the fastest Hashira
I've ever met.

427
00:26:27.200 --> 00:26:28.620
-[blood squelches]
-[gasps]

428
00:26:29.120 --> 00:26:31.540
[SHINOBU] He... got me.

429
00:26:31.580 --> 00:26:32.840
[grunts]

430
00:26:32.880 --> 00:26:34.630
Forget the poison.

431
00:26:34.670 --> 00:26:36.840
Why not try to decapitate me?

432
00:26:37.380 --> 00:26:39.800
With your speed.
you might have won.

433
00:26:40.760 --> 00:26:42.970
[laughs sarcastically]
Maybe not.

434
00:26:43.010 --> 00:26:45.220
I mean. you are small.

435
00:26:45.720 --> 00:26:47.270
[gasps. breathing shakily]

436
00:26:49.060 --> 00:26:52.150
[SHINOBU] Why are my hands
so small? I wonder.

437
00:26:53.900 --> 00:26:57.070
How come I was never able
to grow taller?

438
00:26:58.990 --> 00:27:01.820
If my stature
were just a little bigger.

439
00:27:02.280 --> 00:27:05.700
could I have been able to behead
and defeat a demon?

440
00:27:06.540 --> 00:27:09.040
The longer
your arms and legs are.

441
00:27:09.080 --> 00:27:10.920
the more muscles you have.

442
00:27:10.960 --> 00:27:13.540
which means more strength
in your attacks.

443
00:27:15.000 --> 00:27:16.670
[♪ tender music playing]

444
00:27:16.710 --> 00:27:19.630
My sister
was also of small frame.

445
00:27:19.670 --> 00:27:21.550
but she was taller than I.

446
00:27:23.680 --> 00:27:26.310
How I envy Mr. Himejima.

447
00:27:26.890 --> 00:27:29.390
Seeing someone like him
come to the rescue

448
00:27:29.430 --> 00:27:31.230
would give anyone relief.

449
00:27:35.060 --> 00:27:38.190
I know what my sister
really wanted to say.

450
00:27:38.900 --> 00:27:40.990
but didn't have the heart to.

451
00:27:44.410 --> 00:27:45.910
[DOMA] Oh. no!

452
00:27:45.950 --> 00:27:47.990
Have our games come to an end?

453
00:27:48.370 --> 00:27:49.910
That's too bad.

454
00:27:50.870 --> 00:27:52.920
[metallic rattling]

455
00:27:53.500 --> 00:27:56.590
[SHINOBU] "I don't think
you'll win against that demon."

456
00:27:57.130 --> 00:27:59.380
[voice breaking] That's what
you were going to say.

457
00:27:59.420 --> 00:28:01.880
But you stopped yourself.
didn't you?

458
00:28:02.380 --> 00:28:04.180
[KANAE] Pull yourself together.

459
00:28:09.810 --> 00:28:11.770
This is no time for tears.

460
00:28:13.440 --> 00:28:14.480
[SHINOBU] Sister.

461
00:28:15.440 --> 00:28:16.650
[KANAE] Stand up.

462
00:28:16.690 --> 00:28:20.110
[SHINOBU] I can't.
I've lost so much blood.

463
00:28:20.150 --> 00:28:23.450
My left lung is punctured
and I can't even breathe.

464
00:28:23.990 --> 00:28:25.660
You can and you will.

465
00:28:26.240 --> 00:28:29.700
Stand up.
You are a Hashira. Shinobu.

466
00:28:30.120 --> 00:28:31.910
[grunting softly]

467
00:28:32.540 --> 00:28:35.500
If you've made up your mind
to defeat him. then do so.

468
00:28:35.540 --> 00:28:37.210
No excuses.

469
00:28:38.590 --> 00:28:41.050
Win by whatever means you can.

470
00:28:41.590 --> 00:28:43.670
Remember your promise.

471
00:28:43.720 --> 00:28:45.380
to me and Kanao.

472
00:28:47.890 --> 00:28:49.140
[SHINOBU] Kanao.

473
00:28:52.140 --> 00:28:54.020
[DOMA] Forgive me.

474
00:28:54.060 --> 00:28:56.480
You must be suffering right now.

475
00:28:56.520 --> 00:28:58.650
[whimpering softly]

476
00:29:00.230 --> 00:29:01.400
[gasps]

477
00:29:01.440 --> 00:29:03.530
I know that you have it in you.

478
00:29:03.900 --> 00:29:05.280
Do your best.

479
00:29:06.240 --> 00:29:08.160
-Huh?
-[metallic rattling]

480
00:29:09.320 --> 00:29:10.410
[quivers]

481
00:29:11.540 --> 00:29:16.210
Wait. Are you... standing up?
[exclaims in amazement]

482
00:29:16.250 --> 00:29:17.830
Scary.

483
00:29:17.880 --> 00:29:20.170
Are you actually a human?

484
00:29:20.210 --> 00:29:24.300
I slashed your collarbone.
your lungs. and your ribs.

485
00:29:25.420 --> 00:29:27.470
At your diminutive size

486
00:29:27.510 --> 00:29:29.800
and the amount of blood
you've lost.

487
00:29:29.850 --> 00:29:31.890
how are you not dead right now?

488
00:29:31.930 --> 00:29:32.970
[coughs]

489
00:29:33.020 --> 00:29:34.560
See? Right there.

490
00:29:34.600 --> 00:29:37.560
There clearly is blood
gurgling in your lungs.

491
00:29:37.600 --> 00:29:40.190
The pain must be unimaginable.

492
00:29:40.650 --> 00:29:43.400
Surrender and I'll put an end
to your suffering.

493
00:29:43.440 --> 00:29:44.740
It'll be quick.

494
00:29:45.650 --> 00:29:47.570
It's too late for you.

495
00:29:47.610 --> 00:29:49.360
So. just let go.

496
00:29:49.410 --> 00:29:52.120
[SHINOBU] I'll make a go
for his neck this time

497
00:29:52.160 --> 00:29:55.580
and put everything I have left
into this strike!

498
00:29:56.210 --> 00:30:00.000
Insect Breathing.
Dance of the Centipede.

499
00:30:00.500 --> 00:30:01.630
[DOMA] Hmm?

500
00:30:01.670 --> 00:30:03.670
[SHINOBU]
Hundred-Legged Zigzag.

501
00:30:04.500 --> 00:30:06.380
[♪ dramatic music playing]

502
00:30:08.470 --> 00:30:09.590
[groans]

503
00:30:26.610 --> 00:30:29.450
[DOMA] It feels like
she's everywhere at once.

504
00:30:30.280 --> 00:30:32.780
Just her movement
destroyed the bridge.

505
00:30:33.620 --> 00:30:35.410
[squeaking]

506
00:30:35.450 --> 00:30:37.750
So fast. I can't follow her.

507
00:30:38.620 --> 00:30:39.830
[impact grunts]

508
00:30:44.090 --> 00:30:45.130
From below?

509
00:30:45.170 --> 00:30:46.420
[gasps]

510
00:30:49.220 --> 00:30:50.720
[Shinobu grunts]

511
00:30:54.390 --> 00:30:57.470
-[glass shatters]
-[♪ music swells. fades]

512
00:30:59.100 --> 00:31:00.770
[SHINOBU]
Back when I was a child...

513
00:31:02.270 --> 00:31:04.270
...I thought of happiness
like a road.

514
00:31:04.320 --> 00:31:06.820
one that stretched on
into the distance

515
00:31:06.860 --> 00:31:08.940
with no end in sight.

516
00:31:08.990 --> 00:31:10.570
[laughter]

517
00:31:10.610 --> 00:31:11.950
[blood splatters]

518
00:31:12.610 --> 00:31:15.240
It wasn't until it was destroyed

519
00:31:15.280 --> 00:31:17.410
that I finally realized

520
00:31:17.450 --> 00:31:21.410
the road beneath my feet
was but a thin sheet of glass.

521
00:31:23.880 --> 00:31:28.460
However. some haven't had
the glass broken yet.

522
00:31:29.300 --> 00:31:33.800
All I wanted after being saved
was to become stronger...

523
00:31:34.800 --> 00:31:38.970
...so that some day.
I could protect those people.

524
00:31:40.390 --> 00:31:44.230
So... we made a promise.

525
00:31:46.440 --> 00:31:51.950
To vanquish the demons
as many as we could. together.

526
00:31:52.610 --> 00:31:54.200
[♪ poignant music playing]

527
00:31:55.070 --> 00:31:57.950
In hopes that the pain
we suffered

528
00:31:57.990 --> 00:32:00.580
would never be felt by another.

529
00:32:09.130 --> 00:32:10.960
Even if I'm weak...

530
00:32:14.590 --> 00:32:17.800
...even if I can't
decapitate demons.

531
00:32:17.850 --> 00:32:20.100
if I can take down just one.

532
00:32:20.140 --> 00:32:22.390
I can save dozens of lives.

533
00:32:22.430 --> 00:32:24.520
And if that demon's
an Upper Rank.

534
00:32:25.190 --> 00:32:27.440
it could mean saving hundreds.

535
00:32:29.020 --> 00:32:32.240
It's not a matter
of can or cannot.

536
00:32:32.820 --> 00:32:35.280
This is something I have to do.

537
00:32:40.490 --> 00:32:42.040
Are you angry?

538
00:32:44.000 --> 00:32:47.500
[SHINOBU] Yes.
I am angry. Tanjiro.

539
00:32:47.540 --> 00:32:48.920
I'm furious.

540
00:32:49.670 --> 00:32:50.840
In fact...

541
00:32:51.800 --> 00:32:54.170
...I'm always angry.

542
00:32:54.220 --> 00:32:56.050
How could I not be?

543
00:32:58.350 --> 00:33:00.350
My parents were killed.

544
00:33:01.770 --> 00:33:04.180
My older sister was killed.

545
00:33:05.190 --> 00:33:08.730
My Tsuguko. other than Kanao.
were killed.

546
00:33:09.730 --> 00:33:11.570
And those poor girls.

547
00:33:12.230 --> 00:33:13.900
If it weren't for the demons...

548
00:33:14.400 --> 00:33:17.320
If it weren't for the demons
that killed their loved ones.

549
00:33:17.990 --> 00:33:21.120
they'd be living happily
with their families.

550
00:33:22.620 --> 00:33:23.620
[♪ discordant music playing]

551
00:33:23.660 --> 00:33:26.830
It's all so infuriating!

552
00:33:26.870 --> 00:33:29.250
Stop messing with me. damn it!

553
00:33:30.040 --> 00:33:33.840
Why the hell isn't my poison
working on this prick?

554
00:33:34.630 --> 00:33:36.430
You bastard!

555
00:33:36.470 --> 00:33:37.840
[exhales]

556
00:33:37.880 --> 00:33:39.970
[ice crackling]

557
00:33:47.640 --> 00:33:50.270
I'm moved! You did your best!

558
00:33:50.310 --> 00:33:52.570
Even though you're so weak.

559
00:33:52.610 --> 00:33:54.730
You must have worked
so incredibly hard

560
00:33:54.780 --> 00:33:56.820
to get to this point. [sobbing]

561
00:33:56.860 --> 00:33:58.990
You're weaker than your sister.

562
00:33:59.030 --> 00:34:01.490
and yet. you somehow
outlived her.

563
00:34:01.990 --> 00:34:05.080
[sniffles] It's a miracle
you survived this long.

564
00:34:05.120 --> 00:34:06.250
[body cracking]

565
00:34:06.290 --> 00:34:07.710
[coughs]

566
00:34:07.750 --> 00:34:09.040
Even when hope is gone.

567
00:34:09.080 --> 00:34:11.540
humans always fight
to the bitter end.

568
00:34:12.090 --> 00:34:14.000
Humans are so foolish.

569
00:34:14.050 --> 00:34:16.670
But that's what makes them
so beautiful.

570
00:34:17.550 --> 00:34:20.180
I deem you worthy
of becoming part of me.

571
00:34:20.680 --> 00:34:23.760
[sobbing] You and I
shall share eternity!

572
00:34:27.100 --> 00:34:29.060
Do you have any last words?

573
00:34:29.640 --> 00:34:30.900
I'm listening.

574
00:34:35.690 --> 00:34:38.530
Rot in hell. you bastard!

575
00:34:42.530 --> 00:34:44.830
[exclaims in horror] Master!

576
00:34:47.830 --> 00:34:49.250
[bones crunching]

577
00:34:50.080 --> 00:34:53.040
[exclaims in anguish]

578
00:34:53.090 --> 00:34:55.210
[bones crunching]

579
00:35:00.840 --> 00:35:02.220
[clangs]

580
00:35:05.100 --> 00:35:06.680
[clatters]

581
00:35:07.390 --> 00:35:09.020
[quivering]

582
00:35:09.850 --> 00:35:12.810
[screaming in agony]

583
00:35:16.530 --> 00:35:19.240
[ZENITSU] I can't shake
the feeling he's here.

584
00:35:19.280 --> 00:35:20.650
He must be.

585
00:35:21.110 --> 00:35:23.700
He's got a score to settle
with me. too.

586
00:35:31.000 --> 00:35:32.370
The people we love.

587
00:35:32.420 --> 00:35:35.880
the people we hold dear
are so precious.

588
00:35:36.340 --> 00:35:38.920
We take for granted
that they'll always be there.

589
00:35:39.380 --> 00:35:43.340
However. that's just
a selfish delusion.

590
00:35:43.390 --> 00:35:45.300
Flower Breathing...

591
00:35:45.800 --> 00:35:47.930
[ZENITSU] Because the thought
of living without them

592
00:35:47.970 --> 00:35:49.890
is simply unbearable.

593
00:35:49.930 --> 00:35:51.180
...Fourth Form:

594
00:35:51.850 --> 00:35:54.060
Crimson Hanagoromo!

595
00:35:54.100 --> 00:35:55.900
[shatters]

596
00:35:57.070 --> 00:35:58.150
[grunts]

597
00:36:00.780 --> 00:36:03.820
[DOMA] Wow!
You nearly got me there.

598
00:36:07.370 --> 00:36:10.160
[ZENITSU] "They'll always be
alive and close by."

599
00:36:11.290 --> 00:36:13.960
It's a naive thought. I know.

600
00:36:14.540 --> 00:36:16.420
but we all wanna believe it.

601
00:36:19.630 --> 00:36:23.050
Would you mind holding off
your attacks for just a second?

602
00:36:23.090 --> 00:36:26.140
-I'm trying to absorb her.
-[flesh squelching]

603
00:36:28.930 --> 00:36:31.060
[seething]

604
00:36:33.560 --> 00:36:35.060
[DOMA] How strange.

605
00:36:35.100 --> 00:36:37.770
You're not taking the bait.
are you?

606
00:36:38.440 --> 00:36:40.480
What she did earlier.

607
00:36:40.530 --> 00:36:43.110
that motion she made
with her fingers.

608
00:36:43.570 --> 00:36:46.530
Was that her warning you
of my powers?

609
00:36:47.030 --> 00:36:49.870
I'm impressed she thought
to do that so quickly.

610
00:36:50.330 --> 00:36:52.080
Good job you did it.

611
00:36:52.620 --> 00:36:54.500
Too bad it doesn't matter.

612
00:36:55.000 --> 00:36:57.000
-[flesh squelching]
-[clatters]

613
00:36:57.040 --> 00:37:00.210
Well. in case
you were wondering.

614
00:37:00.750 --> 00:37:03.920
your master was tastier
than I imagined.

615
00:37:03.970 --> 00:37:05.220
[slurps]

616
00:37:05.760 --> 00:37:07.510
And now. you're here.

617
00:37:07.550 --> 00:37:10.970
It's just one feast
after another. it seems.

618
00:37:11.760 --> 00:37:14.890
Ah. this truly is...

619
00:37:15.480 --> 00:37:17.940
a wonderful night.

620
00:37:18.520 --> 00:37:21.690
[seething]

621
00:37:31.280 --> 00:37:32.620
You can't hide.

622
00:37:33.200 --> 00:37:34.540
Come out.

623
00:37:35.370 --> 00:37:37.750
Have some dignity and face me.

624
00:37:40.290 --> 00:37:43.170
[DEMON] Sounds like someone
ought to teach you some manners.

625
00:37:43.210 --> 00:37:45.470
Did you forget
that I'm your senior?

626
00:37:46.050 --> 00:37:49.510
You look a little stronger
than the last time I saw ya.

627
00:37:50.220 --> 00:37:54.180
It's too bad you still reek
of being a pathetic weakling.

628
00:37:56.810 --> 00:37:57.770
[clatters]

629
00:37:57.810 --> 00:37:59.150
UPPER SIX

630
00:37:59.190 --> 00:38:03.400
It's been a while.
hasn't it... Zenitsu?

631
00:38:03.440 --> 00:38:05.240
[chuckles]

632
00:38:06.190 --> 00:38:07.610
[ZENITSU] Kaigaku.

633
00:38:07.650 --> 00:38:10.030
You don't get my respect.

634
00:38:10.410 --> 00:38:11.950
You're a demon.

635
00:38:11.990 --> 00:38:13.870
You'll be treated as such.

636
00:38:21.630 --> 00:38:22.670
[Nakime plucking biwa strings]

637
00:38:22.710 --> 00:38:24.130
-[rumbles]
-[Tanjiro gasps]

638
00:38:24.170 --> 00:38:25.210
[grunts]

639
00:38:27.260 --> 00:38:29.760
Water Breathing. Ninth Form:

640
00:38:31.550 --> 00:38:33.930
Splashing Water Flow. Turbulent!

641
00:38:35.010 --> 00:38:36.350
[grunts]

642
00:38:36.390 --> 00:38:37.600
Stay focused!

643
00:38:37.640 --> 00:38:38.890
All right!

644
00:38:40.100 --> 00:38:42.190
This place is insane.

645
00:38:42.230 --> 00:38:44.820
The building keeps shifting
and rearranging itself

646
00:38:44.860 --> 00:38:46.530
as if it's alive.

647
00:38:46.570 --> 00:38:49.400
I can tell that
it's trying to separate us.

648
00:38:50.490 --> 00:38:53.160
We have to regroup
with the other Corps members

649
00:38:53.200 --> 00:38:55.580
and stay together
till we reach Muzan!

650
00:38:59.460 --> 00:39:01.370
[cawing]

651
00:39:01.790 --> 00:39:03.500
[cawing]

652
00:39:03.540 --> 00:39:05.170
Attention!

653
00:39:05.210 --> 00:39:07.420
Shinobu Kocho is dead!

654
00:39:08.090 --> 00:39:10.510
She fought valiantly
against Upper Two

655
00:39:10.550 --> 00:39:12.260
but was defeated!

656
00:39:19.480 --> 00:39:21.730
-[gasps]
-[muted silence]

657
00:39:25.150 --> 00:39:27.320
[♪ poignant music playing]

658
00:39:28.690 --> 00:39:30.820
[inaudible laughter]

659
00:39:43.960 --> 00:39:45.750
[seething]

660
00:39:49.340 --> 00:39:51.260
[cawing]

661
00:39:53.510 --> 00:39:54.800
[GIYU] Strange.

662
00:39:54.850 --> 00:39:57.390
There's a piece of paper
wrapped around its neck.

663
00:39:57.890 --> 00:39:59.730
How are the crows already here?

664
00:40:00.730 --> 00:40:03.520
[♪ epic dramatic music playing]

665
00:40:04.190 --> 00:40:05.980
Shinobu is dead.

666
00:40:06.020 --> 00:40:08.110
but we must push forward.

667
00:40:08.480 --> 00:40:11.070
Think only of what must be done
for victory.

668
00:40:11.570 --> 00:40:12.700
[KUINA. KANATA] Right.

669
00:40:14.990 --> 00:40:16.370
And what about the others?

670
00:40:16.410 --> 00:40:18.790
I need reports
on their whereabouts.

671
00:40:20.290 --> 00:40:22.000
[KANATA]
Center of the 40th vertical

672
00:40:22.040 --> 00:40:23.870
and 12th horizontal levels.

673
00:40:23.910 --> 00:40:25.540
[fight grunts]

674
00:40:25.580 --> 00:40:27.540
The Corps members
are fighting off

675
00:40:27.590 --> 00:40:30.510
what appears to be
at least ten demons.

676
00:40:32.300 --> 00:40:35.640
[fight grunts]

677
00:40:37.390 --> 00:40:40.390
However. more than 30 demons
are moving in their direction

678
00:40:40.430 --> 00:40:41.890
from behind the walls.

679
00:40:48.110 --> 00:40:50.150
[KIRIYA]
Using Mr. Yushiro's eyes.

680
00:40:50.190 --> 00:40:52.690
we're able to see
Blood Demon Arts.

681
00:40:52.740 --> 00:40:55.950
something that isn't possible
to do with the human eye.

682
00:40:56.870 --> 00:40:59.080
Each red light
is a Blood Demon Art.

683
00:40:59.120 --> 00:41:02.410
The more intense they glow.
the more potent their power.

684
00:41:03.290 --> 00:41:05.920
In this place. the entire area.

685
00:41:05.960 --> 00:41:09.250
buildings and all. must also be
a Blood Demon Art.

686
00:41:10.000 --> 00:41:13.010
There's seemingly
no end in sight to it.

687
00:41:15.430 --> 00:41:17.430
What incredible power!

688
00:41:18.760 --> 00:41:20.260
A demon labyrinth

689
00:41:20.310 --> 00:41:22.770
with the ability
to branch out endlessly.

690
00:41:26.060 --> 00:41:27.850
And here we lie at its center.

691
00:41:27.900 --> 00:41:30.770
trapped within the walls
of this infinite castle.

692
00:41:31.480 --> 00:41:33.070
[KAKUSHI 1] This one's finished.

693
00:41:34.950 --> 00:41:38.320
[KIRIYA] However. it's not as if
we've been caught off guard.

694
00:41:38.360 --> 00:41:39.320
KAKUSHI

695
00:41:39.620 --> 00:41:42.790
My father prepared
for this day meticulously.

696
00:41:43.540 --> 00:41:45.710
With Gyomei's cooperation.

697
00:41:45.750 --> 00:41:47.750
he had the Hashira
within arm's reach

698
00:41:47.790 --> 00:41:49.330
to mobilize at any time.

699
00:41:49.380 --> 00:41:52.340
To prevent the Corps members
from being isolated.

700
00:41:52.380 --> 00:41:55.130
he sent the Kasugai Crows
to gather them into groups

701
00:41:55.170 --> 00:41:56.130
and waited.

702
00:41:57.260 --> 00:42:00.850
He enlisted the aid
of Ms. Tamayo and Mr. Yushiro.

703
00:42:00.890 --> 00:42:02.100
And finally.

704
00:42:02.720 --> 00:42:05.020
to ensure that
their plan would succeed.

705
00:42:05.520 --> 00:42:08.100
my sisters and our parents

706
00:42:08.600 --> 00:42:10.770
readily sacrificed their lives.

707
00:42:14.110 --> 00:42:15.610
We cannot lose.

708
00:42:16.150 --> 00:42:17.570
no matter what!

709
00:42:20.780 --> 00:42:23.410
[♪ music intensifies]

710
00:42:24.080 --> 00:42:25.870
Amongst the Blood Demon Arts.

711
00:42:25.910 --> 00:42:29.170
there are five traces of power
that tower over the rest

712
00:42:29.210 --> 00:42:31.210
as if flaunting their strength.

713
00:42:31.840 --> 00:42:34.210
These must be Upper Ranks.

714
00:42:34.920 --> 00:42:36.460
One of them is at the same spot

715
00:42:36.510 --> 00:42:38.800
where Shinobu
was last seen fighting.

716
00:42:39.380 --> 00:42:40.800
Found another!

717
00:42:40.890 --> 00:42:43.850
Upper Six and Zenitsu have just
encountered each other!

718
00:42:43.890 --> 00:42:45.470
An Upper Rank!

719
00:42:45.520 --> 00:42:46.680
Is he alone?

720
00:42:46.730 --> 00:42:49.270
[KUINA] He is.
It looks to be a one-on-one!

721
00:42:49.310 --> 00:42:52.190
[KIRIYA] A Hinoe can't beat
an Upper Rank by themself.

722
00:42:52.230 --> 00:42:53.360
Send backup!

723
00:42:58.990 --> 00:43:00.240
[KAIGAKU] Hmm.

724
00:43:00.280 --> 00:43:02.370
What. you're frozen in fear?

725
00:43:02.410 --> 00:43:04.490
Guess some things never change.

726
00:43:04.530 --> 00:43:06.790
Once a coward. always a coward.

727
00:43:07.790 --> 00:43:09.830
Did you ever become a Hashira?

728
00:43:09.870 --> 00:43:11.920
[scoffs] Guess not.

729
00:43:11.960 --> 00:43:13.250
That's too bad.

730
00:43:13.750 --> 00:43:17.920
Got any new techniques?
Or still just First Form?

731
00:43:18.970 --> 00:43:20.590
For an Upper Rank bottom feeder

732
00:43:20.630 --> 00:43:22.760
who's nothing more
than a spare blade.

733
00:43:22.800 --> 00:43:25.060
you're sure acting
awfully proud.

734
00:43:25.930 --> 00:43:28.770
[Kaigaku sarcastically]
Wow! [laughs]

735
00:43:28.810 --> 00:43:31.940
Who taught you to talk
like that? New friends?

736
00:43:32.440 --> 00:43:34.770
[ZENITSU] Why the hell
did you become a demon?

737
00:43:35.270 --> 00:43:37.440
[laughs] You'd never understand.

738
00:43:37.480 --> 00:43:39.990
You were supposed to succeed
Thunder Breathing!

739
00:43:40.030 --> 00:43:41.490
But you tarnished it!

740
00:43:42.950 --> 00:43:44.070
Huh?

741
00:43:44.110 --> 00:43:46.370
[ZENITSU]
After you became a demon.

742
00:43:46.410 --> 00:43:47.620
he...

743
00:43:49.290 --> 00:43:51.000
He committed seppuku!

744
00:43:51.500 --> 00:43:52.750
[♪ poignant music playing]

745
00:43:52.790 --> 00:43:54.170
[voice breaking] Even worse.

746
00:43:54.710 --> 00:43:56.420
he did it by himself.

747
00:43:57.630 --> 00:43:59.670
He was all alone!

748
00:44:00.880 --> 00:44:02.590
Because of that.
no one was there

749
00:44:02.630 --> 00:44:04.260
to put him out of his misery.

750
00:44:04.300 --> 00:44:07.510
He bled out
and died a painful death.

751
00:44:07.560 --> 00:44:09.350
It's your fault!

752
00:44:09.390 --> 00:44:12.560
Gramps died the most
agonizing death possible

753
00:44:12.600 --> 00:44:14.730
all because
the Thunder Breathing rights

754
00:44:14.770 --> 00:44:15.940
produced a demon!

755
00:44:17.650 --> 00:44:19.820
Why the hell should I care?

756
00:44:20.280 --> 00:44:22.700
Gramps died? So what?

757
00:44:22.740 --> 00:44:24.150
Want me to cry?

758
00:44:24.200 --> 00:44:26.700
Did you expect me
to give it to him?

759
00:44:26.740 --> 00:44:27.990
Well. I don't.

760
00:44:28.280 --> 00:44:31.580
In fact. I don't care for anyone
who doesn't appreciate me.

761
00:44:31.620 --> 00:44:33.460
No matter what.

762
00:44:33.500 --> 00:44:35.330
this is who I am.

763
00:44:35.370 --> 00:44:38.460
Take the side
of whoever knows my worth.

764
00:44:38.500 --> 00:44:39.670
[laughs]

765
00:44:40.590 --> 00:44:42.880
If the old geezer
really did die in agony.

766
00:44:42.920 --> 00:44:44.630
then I couldn't be happier.

767
00:44:44.680 --> 00:44:47.850
I slaved away
for that ungrateful bastard.

768
00:44:47.890 --> 00:44:50.140
And what does he do to repay me?

769
00:44:50.180 --> 00:44:52.020
He makes you my co-successor

770
00:44:52.060 --> 00:44:54.060
instead of just letting me
carry the torch!

771
00:44:54.100 --> 00:44:55.650
I hope he rots!

772
00:44:56.190 --> 00:44:58.310
Former Hashira or not.

773
00:44:58.360 --> 00:45:01.780
I would never shed a tear
over some senile geezer.

774
00:45:01.820 --> 00:45:04.610
[laughs boorishly]

775
00:45:06.950 --> 00:45:09.620
[ZENITSU] Gramps knew
exactly what he was doing.

776
00:45:10.120 --> 00:45:13.330
We were made co-successors
because we're weak.

777
00:45:13.370 --> 00:45:15.710
I was only able to use
the First Form

778
00:45:15.750 --> 00:45:18.580
while you could use
everything but First Form.

779
00:45:19.210 --> 00:45:21.250
I can't help
but feel sorry for Gramps

780
00:45:21.300 --> 00:45:23.720
that he has two
useless successors!

781
00:45:23.760 --> 00:45:25.590
[KAIGAKU]
Don't lump us together!

782
00:45:25.630 --> 00:45:27.720
I'm nothing like you!

783
00:45:28.220 --> 00:45:32.520
Thunder Breathing. Fourth Form:
Distant Thunder!

784
00:45:32.560 --> 00:45:34.730
[♪ intense dramatic music
playing]

785
00:45:36.020 --> 00:45:37.400
[gasps]

786
00:45:40.230 --> 00:45:42.530
You're so slow. scum.

787
00:45:42.570 --> 00:45:44.150
-[groans]
-[blood splatters]

788
00:45:48.110 --> 00:45:50.830
[KAIGAKU]
What the hell? He got me.

789
00:45:50.870 --> 00:45:52.490
His speed is unreal.

790
00:45:52.540 --> 00:45:55.080
He never moved like that.

791
00:45:55.120 --> 00:45:56.830
He's changed.

792
00:45:58.370 --> 00:46:00.670
But he's not the only one.

793
00:46:04.590 --> 00:46:06.720
[wet squelching]

794
00:46:11.140 --> 00:46:14.390
There's no shame in kneeling
down before the powerful

795
00:46:14.430 --> 00:46:15.930
if it means surviving.

796
00:46:16.430 --> 00:46:18.310
As long as you're alive.

797
00:46:18.350 --> 00:46:20.150
you can still win.

798
00:46:21.520 --> 00:46:24.690
Only once you die have you lost.

799
00:46:25.190 --> 00:46:28.490
Even if you have to beg
on your hands and knees.

800
00:46:29.030 --> 00:46:32.320
Even if you're without a home
and have to drink from a puddle.

801
00:46:32.780 --> 00:46:36.290
Even if they condemn you
for stealing money.

802
00:46:37.290 --> 00:46:38.620
As long as you're alive.

803
00:46:38.660 --> 00:46:41.040
there's still a future
where you can win.

804
00:46:41.540 --> 00:46:45.170
Believing that
is all that's kept me going.

805
00:46:47.130 --> 00:46:49.550
[KOKUSHIBO]
Forfeit your humanity

806
00:46:49.590 --> 00:46:53.140
and limitless power
will be within reach.

807
00:46:53.640 --> 00:46:56.810
Should my Lord
choose to acknowledge you.

808
00:46:56.850 --> 00:47:00.270
demon blood
shall course through your veins.

809
00:47:02.060 --> 00:47:03.400
[Kaigaku quivers]

810
00:47:04.070 --> 00:47:05.940
The stronger the swordsman.

811
00:47:05.980 --> 00:47:09.280
the longer it takes for him
to become a demon.

812
00:47:10.070 --> 00:47:13.740
It took me three days
to fully transform.

813
00:47:14.240 --> 00:47:17.080
Turning a breathing technique
user into a demon

814
00:47:17.120 --> 00:47:18.830
is no small feat.

815
00:47:18.870 --> 00:47:20.670
Doing such a thing will require

816
00:47:20.710 --> 00:47:23.540
an exorbitant amount
of my Lord's blood.

817
00:47:24.290 --> 00:47:26.250
And though it is rare.

818
00:47:26.300 --> 00:47:28.170
some people.
for whatever reason.

819
00:47:28.210 --> 00:47:30.720
are physically incapable
of becoming demons.

820
00:47:30.760 --> 00:47:31.760
Huh?

821
00:47:32.380 --> 00:47:35.350
[KOKUSHIBO] I'm curious to see
how you will fare.

822
00:47:35.390 --> 00:47:37.060
UPPER ONE

823
00:47:37.560 --> 00:47:38.720
[quivers]

824
00:47:38.770 --> 00:47:41.440
You must appreciate this blood.

825
00:47:41.480 --> 00:47:46.570
Even holding it as you are now
is an honor you cannot fathom.

826
00:47:46.610 --> 00:47:48.940
Should you spill a single drop.

827
00:47:48.990 --> 00:47:51.990
I'll have you dismembered
in an instant

828
00:47:52.030 --> 00:47:54.240
before it touches the ground.

829
00:47:54.280 --> 00:47:55.660
[gasps in horror]

830
00:47:56.370 --> 00:47:57.990
[breathing shakily]

831
00:47:59.500 --> 00:48:03.790
[KAIGAKU] Even now.
I remember the terror I felt.

832
00:48:03.830 --> 00:48:07.880
Like every cell in my body
was screaming in anguish.

833
00:48:10.460 --> 00:48:12.720
Compared to what I felt then.

834
00:48:12.760 --> 00:48:14.300
this is nothing.

835
00:48:14.340 --> 00:48:16.850
-He's just a punk.
-[clatters]

836
00:48:16.890 --> 00:48:18.310
He might be stronger.

837
00:48:18.350 --> 00:48:20.430
but he's not on par
with an Upper Rank.

838
00:48:21.310 --> 00:48:25.560
Zenitsu Agatsuma
is and always will be trash.

839
00:48:25.600 --> 00:48:27.520
He's a despicable crybaby

840
00:48:27.570 --> 00:48:30.070
without a shred of dignity
or valor!

841
00:48:30.110 --> 00:48:32.110
Somebody. help!

842
00:48:32.150 --> 00:48:36.660
I fell in a pitfall
and twisted my ankle!

843
00:48:37.330 --> 00:48:39.120
[KAIGAKU] The disrespect!

844
00:48:39.160 --> 00:48:42.870
As if I'd be co-successor
with that sniveling loser!

845
00:48:43.410 --> 00:48:45.330
[JIGORO] Here you are. Kaigaku.

846
00:48:45.880 --> 00:48:48.420
-[ZENITSU] Hey. Gramps?
-[KAIGAKU] Hmm?

847
00:48:48.460 --> 00:48:51.710
It looks a little big on me.
don't you think?

848
00:48:51.760 --> 00:48:54.010
-Maybe I'll grow into it...
-[KAIGAKU] I'm supposed to be

849
00:48:54.050 --> 00:48:56.590
-that idiot's equal?
-[both laughing]

850
00:48:57.720 --> 00:49:00.270
That's gotta be
some kind of sick joke!

851
00:49:00.310 --> 00:49:01.600
[seething]

852
00:49:02.100 --> 00:49:04.560
The old bastard deserved to die!

853
00:49:04.600 --> 00:49:06.850
And if you miss him so dearly.

854
00:49:06.900 --> 00:49:09.360
then I'll see to it
you join him!

855
00:49:10.650 --> 00:49:13.610
[ZENITSU] I was only ever able
to learn the First Form.

856
00:49:13.650 --> 00:49:17.490
However. you were able to learn
everything but the First Form.

857
00:49:18.700 --> 00:49:20.120
[♪ tender music playing]

858
00:49:20.160 --> 00:49:21.410
Gramps knew that.

859
00:49:21.950 --> 00:49:25.000
His solution
was having us both succeed

860
00:49:25.040 --> 00:49:26.790
the Thunder Breathing technique.

861
00:49:29.380 --> 00:49:31.090
But you denied him that.

862
00:49:31.710 --> 00:49:34.050
You became a demon

863
00:49:34.090 --> 00:49:36.090
purely to reject him.

864
00:49:37.050 --> 00:49:39.300
-[crackling]
-It's coming!

865
00:49:39.350 --> 00:49:42.180
Thunder Breathing. Second Form:

866
00:49:42.770 --> 00:49:44.140
Rice Spirit!

867
00:49:44.180 --> 00:49:46.270
[♪ dramatic synth music playing]

868
00:49:46.310 --> 00:49:49.060
[ZENITSU] He attacked five times
in one breath.

869
00:49:49.690 --> 00:49:51.940
-[Kaigaku yells]
-[effort grunts. strains]

870
00:49:51.980 --> 00:49:53.900
How many people
have you devoured?

871
00:49:53.940 --> 00:49:57.030
You can't even tell right
from wrong anymore!

872
00:49:57.070 --> 00:50:00.070
I'm more aware of those
than I've ever been!

873
00:50:01.280 --> 00:50:02.620
What's the matter?

874
00:50:02.700 --> 00:50:05.910
Aren't you supposed to be
the old geezer's favorite?

875
00:50:06.410 --> 00:50:08.000
-[grunts]
-If you are.

876
00:50:08.040 --> 00:50:10.170
then show me
what he passed down to you!

877
00:50:10.210 --> 00:50:13.710
It's the only technique
you've got. so use it!

878
00:50:13.750 --> 00:50:14.920
[Zenitsu grunts]

879
00:50:16.300 --> 00:50:19.390
Go all out.
Use everything you got.

880
00:50:19.430 --> 00:50:21.300
-[groans angrily]
-And don't you dare hold back

881
00:50:21.350 --> 00:50:23.680
-for a second!
-[determined grunt]

882
00:50:28.480 --> 00:50:30.060
[ZENITSU] Thunder Breathing...

883
00:50:32.440 --> 00:50:33.860
...First Form...

884
00:50:34.230 --> 00:50:35.230
[scoffs]

885
00:50:35.820 --> 00:50:37.740
...Thunderclap and Flash.

886
00:50:40.610 --> 00:50:42.070
[effort grunts]

887
00:50:42.120 --> 00:50:43.700
[laughs boisterously]

888
00:50:43.740 --> 00:50:47.080
As if a basic attack
like charging me head-on

889
00:50:47.120 --> 00:50:48.830
would ever find its mark.

890
00:50:48.870 --> 00:50:50.620
Don't make me laugh!

891
00:50:52.420 --> 00:50:54.090
Thunder Breathing.

892
00:50:54.130 --> 00:50:57.470
Third Form: Thunder Swarm!

893
00:50:59.680 --> 00:51:01.720
[grunting]

894
00:51:02.970 --> 00:51:05.390
[ZENITSU] He's attacking me
from every angle at once.

895
00:51:05.430 --> 00:51:06.850
[KAIGAKU] What's the matter?

896
00:51:06.890 --> 00:51:09.100
Don't tell me
you're done already!

897
00:51:10.310 --> 00:51:12.100
[ZENITSU]
Thunder Breathing. First Form:

898
00:51:12.150 --> 00:51:14.770
Thunderclap and Flash:
Eight Fold!

899
00:51:19.240 --> 00:51:21.820
-That's not gonna work!
-[Zenitsu grunts]

900
00:51:22.320 --> 00:51:25.450
Thunder Breathing. Fifth Form:

901
00:51:27.830 --> 00:51:29.370
Heat Lightning!

902
00:51:29.870 --> 00:51:32.330
-Ah!
-Gotcha!

903
00:51:33.000 --> 00:51:36.500
How does the bite of my Blood
Demon Art-enhanced sword feel?

904
00:51:36.550 --> 00:51:39.340
-[electricity crackling]
-Each strike on contact

905
00:51:39.380 --> 00:51:42.010
leaves a wound
that burns your skin.

906
00:51:42.590 --> 00:51:46.220
This proves those who recognize
my talents and value are right!

907
00:51:46.760 --> 00:51:50.020
And those that dismiss
or condemn me are wrong!

908
00:51:50.560 --> 00:51:54.310
Do you get it now?
This is the power I have!

909
00:51:54.810 --> 00:51:56.980
My power as a demon that is!

910
00:51:57.440 --> 00:51:59.650
All you know how to do
is use First Form.

911
00:51:59.690 --> 00:52:02.740
yet that geezer chose
to make you his successor!

912
00:52:02.780 --> 00:52:05.490
And. boy.
what a mistake that was!

913
00:52:11.790 --> 00:52:13.120
So. that's it.

914
00:52:13.170 --> 00:52:15.880
This is the path
that you've chosen to take.

915
00:52:17.380 --> 00:52:18.920
[weakly] I already knew.

916
00:52:19.590 --> 00:52:21.090
I knew. but...

917
00:52:23.010 --> 00:52:24.680
[sword scraping]

918
00:52:26.260 --> 00:52:29.220
With this strike. I'll end this.

919
00:52:29.270 --> 00:52:30.720
You're finished!

920
00:52:30.770 --> 00:52:32.440
-[crackling]
-Thunder Breathing...

921
00:52:32.480 --> 00:52:35.480
-[rumbling]
-...Sixth Form:

922
00:52:39.320 --> 00:52:42.610
-[crackling]
-[♪ music intensifies]

923
00:52:43.650 --> 00:52:46.320
Rumble and Flash!

924
00:52:46.370 --> 00:52:50.290
That strike I landed will keep
crackling through your flesh!

925
00:52:50.330 --> 00:52:54.290
This is the power that I gained
by becoming a demon.

926
00:52:54.330 --> 00:52:55.870
Get it now?

927
00:52:55.920 --> 00:52:58.420
I've long surpassed
Thunder Breathing!

928
00:53:00.210 --> 00:53:02.380
[laughs boisterously]

929
00:53:02.420 --> 00:53:04.130
You and I aren't equals.

930
00:53:04.180 --> 00:53:05.550
And we never have been.

931
00:53:06.090 --> 00:53:07.850
I'm better than all of you.

932
00:53:08.850 --> 00:53:10.100
Guess the old bastard

933
00:53:10.140 --> 00:53:12.270
shouldn't have put
his trust in you after all.

934
00:53:12.310 --> 00:53:15.100
[laughs boisterously]

935
00:53:16.810 --> 00:53:19.320
[JIGORO] Come on.
be more like Kaigaku!

936
00:53:19.820 --> 00:53:23.400
He's your senior.
so follow his example. you hear?

937
00:53:23.440 --> 00:53:25.660
Hang on. Isn't the First Form

938
00:53:25.700 --> 00:53:28.280
pretty much the entire basis
of Thunder Breathing?

939
00:53:28.320 --> 00:53:30.910
Yeah. and it's the only one
he can't do.

940
00:53:30.950 --> 00:53:33.200
You know what that means.
don't ya?

941
00:53:33.250 --> 00:53:35.540
That even though
he's mastered other forms.

942
00:53:35.580 --> 00:53:37.080
he's still a weakling.

943
00:53:37.120 --> 00:53:38.500
Yep. exactly.

944
00:53:38.540 --> 00:53:41.170
The way he shows off. though?
He's got such an ego.

945
00:53:41.210 --> 00:53:43.760
[BOY 1] No way
he becomes a Hashira.

946
00:53:43.800 --> 00:53:45.880
[BOY 2] Yeah.
he'll die before then.

947
00:53:45.920 --> 00:53:47.010
[♪ gentle music playing]

948
00:53:47.050 --> 00:53:49.140
What did I do to deserve that?

949
00:53:50.600 --> 00:53:53.470
I heard you went and punched
someone from a higher rank.

950
00:53:53.930 --> 00:53:56.850
Don't go around making trouble.
you trash!

951
00:53:56.890 --> 00:54:00.440
It's embarrassing even being
seen in the same room as you.

952
00:54:02.980 --> 00:54:06.240
[ZENITSU] I was fully aware
that you hated me. Kaigaku.

953
00:54:06.280 --> 00:54:10.070
And to be perfectly honest.
I hated you. too.

954
00:54:11.200 --> 00:54:15.200
Even so. I couldn't help
but respect you as well.

955
00:54:15.710 --> 00:54:18.870
You never stopped
working towards your goals.

956
00:54:19.710 --> 00:54:21.750
Despite our differences.

957
00:54:21.790 --> 00:54:24.210
I looked up to you
as an example.

958
00:54:24.710 --> 00:54:27.130
You really were a special guy.

959
00:54:28.720 --> 00:54:30.430
It wasn't just me.

960
00:54:30.470 --> 00:54:32.970
Gramps thought
you were remarkable. too.

961
00:54:33.970 --> 00:54:37.520
But I guess you weren't
satisfied with that. were you?

962
00:54:38.230 --> 00:54:39.900
No matter the day.

963
00:54:39.940 --> 00:54:43.980
the only sound that came
from you was discontent.

964
00:54:44.020 --> 00:54:45.230
[soft tinkling]

965
00:54:45.280 --> 00:54:48.240
It was like the box
where you kept your joy

966
00:54:48.280 --> 00:54:49.700
had a hole in it.

967
00:54:51.320 --> 00:54:53.910
And that joy kept leaking out.

968
00:54:55.330 --> 00:54:57.330
If the hole isn't mended.

969
00:54:57.790 --> 00:55:00.420
happiness will always be
out of reach.

970
00:55:02.830 --> 00:55:06.000
Gramps.
I'm sorry we're fighting...

971
00:55:06.960 --> 00:55:08.380
...but he and I

972
00:55:09.010 --> 00:55:11.430
must walk separate paths.

973
00:55:17.560 --> 00:55:19.730
-[clangs]
-[crackling]

974
00:55:20.940 --> 00:55:22.100
[KAIGAKU] Huh?

975
00:55:22.650 --> 00:55:24.730
He's still holding on?

976
00:55:24.770 --> 00:55:25.860
[electricity crackling]

977
00:55:25.900 --> 00:55:28.570
[♪ synth music playing]

978
00:55:32.780 --> 00:55:33.990
[power surging]

979
00:55:34.030 --> 00:55:35.450
What the hell?

980
00:55:44.040 --> 00:55:45.210
[ZENITSU] Brother...

981
00:55:46.090 --> 00:55:48.300
-...I'm sorry.
-[gasps]

982
00:55:48.880 --> 00:55:51.050
[♪ music intensifies]

983
00:56:07.150 --> 00:56:10.860
Thunder Breathing. Seventh Form:

984
00:56:10.900 --> 00:56:12.530
[roaring]

985
00:56:13.780 --> 00:56:16.030
God of Fire Thunder.

986
00:56:23.210 --> 00:56:24.710
[KAIGAKU] That...

987
00:56:25.040 --> 00:56:26.790
was so fast.

988
00:56:27.290 --> 00:56:29.670
That move. What was it?

989
00:56:30.050 --> 00:56:31.670
Unbelievable.

990
00:56:31.720 --> 00:56:34.590
How come I've never seen
that technique until now?

991
00:56:35.510 --> 00:56:38.140
Damn you. Damn you!

992
00:56:38.180 --> 00:56:41.350
I always knew that stupid geezer
liked you more than me!

993
00:56:41.390 --> 00:56:44.350
Why else would he only
teach you that technique?!

994
00:56:44.400 --> 00:56:46.230
You're wrong.

995
00:56:46.270 --> 00:56:47.360
[gasps]

996
00:56:47.400 --> 00:56:48.400
[♪ gentle music playing]

997
00:56:48.690 --> 00:56:50.820
[ZENITSU] Gramps was never
that kind of person.

998
00:56:51.900 --> 00:56:54.530
This technique
is something I made.

999
00:56:55.160 --> 00:56:58.200
I created it all by myself.

1000
00:56:59.120 --> 00:57:00.410
My hope was...

1001
00:57:01.410 --> 00:57:06.460
...that one day. I'd be able
to use it to fight by your side.

1002
00:57:09.920 --> 00:57:12.630
[KAIGAKU]
How is this even possible?

1003
00:57:13.170 --> 00:57:15.840
Thunder Breathing
only has six techniques.

1004
00:57:15.890 --> 00:57:18.850
and yet he was able
to create a seventh?

1005
00:57:19.600 --> 00:57:23.350
Him? The one who can only
use the First Form?

1006
00:57:24.640 --> 00:57:27.650
He's inferior to me
in every way!

1007
00:57:27.690 --> 00:57:29.060
[groans angrily]

1008
00:57:29.110 --> 00:57:32.150
I can't accept it.
I won't accept it!

1009
00:57:32.190 --> 00:57:35.030
This must be
some kind of twisted joke!

1010
00:57:35.070 --> 00:57:38.700
Someone like me losing to him?

1011
00:57:39.620 --> 00:57:42.240
I must be going insane!

1012
00:57:43.870 --> 00:57:45.040
Wait!

1013
00:57:45.960 --> 00:57:47.880
With his strength depleted.

1014
00:57:47.920 --> 00:57:50.290
I can still have the last laugh.

1015
00:57:50.340 --> 00:57:53.130
This fall will kill him
and he can't stop it.

1016
00:57:53.840 --> 00:57:57.930
I'll be taking him to hell
with me. [laughs maliciously]

1017
00:57:57.970 --> 00:57:59.720
[YUSHIRO]
Those who never give to others

1018
00:57:59.760 --> 00:58:02.180
are never able to receive
in return.

1019
00:58:02.220 --> 00:58:03.350
Huh?

1020
00:58:04.060 --> 00:58:05.940
People who have
nothing but desire

1021
00:58:05.980 --> 00:58:08.520
are no different than those
who have nothing at all.

1022
00:58:09.020 --> 00:58:12.400
And one cannot create anything
out of nothing.

1023
00:58:13.360 --> 00:58:16.240
Dying alone is pathetic.
wouldn't you say?

1024
00:58:22.410 --> 00:58:24.120
[screaming in anguish]

1025
00:58:24.160 --> 00:58:25.910
[fizzles out]

1026
00:58:34.420 --> 00:58:35.800
[gasps]

1027
00:58:35.840 --> 00:58:37.880
-[birds chirping]
-[leaves rustling]

1028
00:58:38.550 --> 00:58:39.640
Where am I?

1029
00:58:39.680 --> 00:58:41.800
-[stream trickling]
-[birds chirping]

1030
00:58:46.850 --> 00:58:48.140
[gasps]

1031
00:58:48.190 --> 00:58:49.600
Gramps!

1032
00:58:50.190 --> 00:58:52.310
[♪ tender music playing]

1033
00:58:52.360 --> 00:58:53.520
I'm sorry!

1034
00:58:53.570 --> 00:58:56.190
I... I couldn't get along
with Kaigaku!

1035
00:58:56.230 --> 00:58:59.240
I even tried
writing him letters. but...

1036
00:58:59.280 --> 00:59:01.950
But he never wrote me back.
And... [sobs]

1037
00:59:01.990 --> 00:59:03.410
...if it weren't for me.

1038
00:59:03.450 --> 00:59:05.580
he might not have ended up
the way he did.

1039
00:59:06.040 --> 00:59:07.500
I'm really sorry!

1040
00:59:07.540 --> 00:59:08.790
Forgive me!

1041
00:59:08.830 --> 00:59:11.880
I wasn't able to pay you back
for everything!

1042
00:59:11.920 --> 00:59:14.960
I really wanted you
to see me as a Hashira.

1043
00:59:15.000 --> 00:59:16.800
to make you proud.

1044
00:59:16.840 --> 00:59:18.220
I'm sorry.

1045
00:59:18.260 --> 00:59:20.010
I failed you. Gramps!

1046
00:59:22.930 --> 00:59:25.970
[sobbing] I understand
if you hate me now.

1047
00:59:26.600 --> 00:59:29.270
Please. just say something.
Anything!

1048
00:59:29.310 --> 00:59:30.640
[effort grunting]

1049
00:59:31.190 --> 00:59:34.360
Damn it! What's this
grabbing my leg?

1050
00:59:35.610 --> 00:59:37.650
Gramps! I just...

1051
00:59:37.690 --> 00:59:40.030
I need-- [grunts]

1052
00:59:41.490 --> 00:59:42.660
Damn it!

1053
00:59:42.700 --> 00:59:44.740
[effort grunting]

1054
00:59:44.780 --> 00:59:46.280
[JIGORO] Zenitsu.

1055
00:59:46.330 --> 00:59:47.370
[Zenitsu gasps softly]

1056
00:59:53.880 --> 00:59:57.800
Listen to me. lad.
You are my pride and joy.

1057
01:00:16.270 --> 01:00:17.780
[♪ music fades]

1058
01:00:20.950 --> 01:00:23.360
[MURATA] Well? Can you save him?

1059
01:00:23.410 --> 01:00:25.160
He's someone that I know.

1060
01:00:25.200 --> 01:00:28.200
I can't watch him die.
Please tell me there's a way!

1061
01:00:28.240 --> 01:00:30.500
Keep your voice down.
You're not helping.

1062
01:00:30.540 --> 01:00:33.210
Just watch out
for enemy ambushes.

1063
01:00:33.250 --> 01:00:35.630
At least then you'll actually be
doing something useful.

1064
01:00:35.670 --> 01:00:37.040
[grunting angrily]

1065
01:00:37.090 --> 01:00:40.010
Excuse me? And just
who the hell are you. huh?

1066
01:00:40.050 --> 01:00:42.630
I better not find out
you're a lower rank than I am!

1067
01:00:42.670 --> 01:00:46.300
I'm a demon. I don't care
about your hierarchy.

1068
01:00:47.100 --> 01:00:49.350
This'll slow
the Blood Demon Art.

1069
01:00:49.390 --> 01:00:51.270
But if these cracks
keep spreading.

1070
01:00:51.310 --> 01:00:53.770
it'll travel all the way
to his eyes.

1071
01:00:54.480 --> 01:00:56.020
Hey. can you hear me?

1072
01:00:56.520 --> 01:00:57.730
[groans]

1073
01:00:58.440 --> 01:01:00.150
[all three exclaim]

1074
01:01:00.190 --> 01:01:02.950
Your bedside manner
really sucks. you know that?

1075
01:01:02.990 --> 01:01:04.700
I'm also using a hemostatic.

1076
01:01:04.740 --> 01:01:06.620
but I still can't get
the bleeding to stop.

1077
01:01:06.660 --> 01:01:07.620
What did I say?!

1078
01:01:07.830 --> 01:01:09.990
Don't listen to him.
You're gonna be fine.

1079
01:01:10.040 --> 01:01:11.450
I swear
you'll pull through this!

1080
01:01:11.500 --> 01:01:12.830
Yeah. you can do it!

1081
01:01:12.870 --> 01:01:14.870
Fight on! Fight on!

1082
01:01:14.920 --> 01:01:16.880
The only reason
you're alive right now

1083
01:01:16.920 --> 01:01:18.460
is because
the Upper Rank you fought

1084
01:01:18.500 --> 01:01:20.840
still hadn't mastered
his own techniques.

1085
01:01:21.340 --> 01:01:23.300
That was lucky for you.

1086
01:01:23.840 --> 01:01:25.470
If you'd fought him
a year from now.

1087
01:01:25.510 --> 01:01:27.340
you would have died instantly.

1088
01:01:28.010 --> 01:01:29.220
[Murata groaning]

1089
01:01:29.260 --> 01:01:31.100
Could you stop
with the doom and gloom?

1090
01:01:31.140 --> 01:01:33.220
Consider his feelings!

1091
01:01:33.270 --> 01:01:35.600
[breathing heavily]

1092
01:01:39.770 --> 01:01:42.940
Hey. don't pretend like
I'm the one in the wrong here.

1093
01:01:44.860 --> 01:01:46.570
What? What are you pointing at?

1094
01:01:46.610 --> 01:01:49.160
[YUSHIRO] Your screaming let
the demons know we're here.

1095
01:01:49.200 --> 01:01:51.120
[all screaming]

1096
01:01:51.160 --> 01:01:52.660
Don't say I didn't warn you.

1097
01:01:52.700 --> 01:01:54.120
[snarling]

1098
01:01:54.160 --> 01:01:58.040
Hey. it was Yushiro. right?
Take care of Agatsuma!

1099
01:01:58.580 --> 01:02:00.380
-Charge!
-[all grunting]

1100
01:02:02.170 --> 01:02:05.170
Murata. please take care of them
quickly. okay?

1101
01:02:05.210 --> 01:02:07.380
I'm gonna give you
such an earful later!

1102
01:02:07.430 --> 01:02:09.680
-Damn.
-[demon snarling]

1103
01:02:10.390 --> 01:02:12.760
Water Breathing. Second Form:

1104
01:02:12.810 --> 01:02:15.890
Water Wheel! [yells]

1105
01:02:17.270 --> 01:02:18.730
We're gonna head them off.

1106
01:02:18.770 --> 01:02:20.360
Follow my lead. everyone!

1107
01:02:20.400 --> 01:02:22.610
[all yelling]

1108
01:02:22.650 --> 01:02:24.280
-[footsteps receding]
-[grunts]

1109
01:02:30.370 --> 01:02:32.530
[♪ foreboding music playing]

1110
01:02:37.290 --> 01:02:38.710
This is bad.

1111
01:02:38.750 --> 01:02:40.460
They're gonna run into "him."

1112
01:02:43.670 --> 01:02:45.960
[TANJIRO] We haven't encountered
any Upper Ranks.

1113
01:02:46.420 --> 01:02:48.880
Are we still that far
from Muzan?

1114
01:02:48.930 --> 01:02:50.970
I hope the others are all right.

1115
01:02:54.180 --> 01:02:55.680
Miss Shinobu...

1116
01:02:56.520 --> 01:02:58.690
we're going to win this battle.

1117
01:02:58.730 --> 01:03:01.480
For you. For everyone!

1118
01:03:02.650 --> 01:03:04.230
-[loud crash]
-[gasps]

1119
01:03:04.270 --> 01:03:06.280
That jolt! What was that?

1120
01:03:06.780 --> 01:03:07.990
Mr. Giyu!

1121
01:03:08.030 --> 01:03:09.030
Stay there!

1122
01:03:09.450 --> 01:03:11.280
-Keep calm.
-[grunts]

1123
01:03:12.660 --> 01:03:14.620
[TANJIRO]
Is someone else fighting?

1124
01:03:14.660 --> 01:03:16.790
Are we about to lose
another comrade?

1125
01:03:16.830 --> 01:03:19.040
-[♪ intriguing music playing]
-[loud thuds]

1126
01:03:22.710 --> 01:03:25.670
No. it's something else.

1127
01:03:25.710 --> 01:03:27.260
And it's coming this way.

1128
01:03:28.260 --> 01:03:29.380
[sniffs]

1129
01:03:29.840 --> 01:03:32.260
This... This scent.

1130
01:03:40.890 --> 01:03:43.190
[GIYU] Above us!
Get back. Tanjiro!

1131
01:03:44.060 --> 01:03:45.190
[grunts]

1132
01:03:47.280 --> 01:03:49.280
[DEMON] Long time no see.

1133
01:03:50.900 --> 01:03:53.740
It's commendable
you got this far.

1134
01:03:54.320 --> 01:03:56.830
Especially for a puny insect.

1135
01:03:56.870 --> 01:03:57.950
UPPER THREE

1136
01:03:58.450 --> 01:04:01.330
Don't you agree. Tanjiro?!

1137
01:04:01.370 --> 01:04:02.620
[Tanjiro seething]

1138
01:04:03.750 --> 01:04:06.500
Akaza!

1139
01:04:08.510 --> 01:04:10.670
[♪ low tense music playing]

1140
01:04:14.180 --> 01:04:15.720
[heavy burbling]

1141
01:04:32.200 --> 01:04:34.320
[breathing heavily]

1142
01:04:39.080 --> 01:04:41.830
[TAMAYO] This place...
If I had to guess.

1143
01:04:41.870 --> 01:04:44.000
this fleshy cocoon
is breaking down

1144
01:04:44.040 --> 01:04:45.290
and disposing the drug

1145
01:04:45.330 --> 01:04:48.340
that's rescinding
his demon form.

1146
01:04:48.960 --> 01:04:50.800
Muzan Kibutsuji.

1147
01:04:50.840 --> 01:04:55.510
I had sworn to destroy you
by any means necessary.

1148
01:04:56.090 --> 01:05:00.350
Yet. at this moment.
I am powerless to do so.

1149
01:05:01.060 --> 01:05:02.390
[loud thump]

1150
01:05:02.430 --> 01:05:04.100
[grunting]

1151
01:05:07.610 --> 01:05:11.570
Soon enough.
I'll be absorbed as well.

1152
01:05:12.360 --> 01:05:15.070
Please. someone. Anyone!

1153
01:05:15.110 --> 01:05:16.780
Come quickly!

1154
01:05:17.490 --> 01:05:19.120
I beg you!

1155
01:05:22.120 --> 01:05:24.250
[fight grunts]

1156
01:05:26.040 --> 01:05:28.210
[♪ intense music playing]

1157
01:05:33.420 --> 01:05:36.510
[KIRIYA] According to Father.
if Muzan should die.

1158
01:05:36.550 --> 01:05:39.010
the other demons
will also perish.

1159
01:05:40.220 --> 01:05:44.180
By that logic. it's clear
that Muzan is still alive.

1160
01:05:45.480 --> 01:05:46.980
At this very moment.

1161
01:05:47.020 --> 01:05:49.940
Ms. Tamayo must be
suppressing his powers.

1162
01:05:50.860 --> 01:05:52.190
If she weren't.

1163
01:05:52.730 --> 01:05:55.650
he would surely be aware
of Yushiro's watchful gaze.

1164
01:05:56.700 --> 01:05:59.320
Before Muzan's powers
are fully restored.

1165
01:05:59.370 --> 01:06:02.740
we must do whatever it takes
to see that he's defeated.

1166
01:06:04.580 --> 01:06:06.000
I have to wonder. though.

1167
01:06:06.040 --> 01:06:09.460
inside of this
infinite castle...

1168
01:06:10.420 --> 01:06:12.800
...will we really
be able to find him

1169
01:06:12.840 --> 01:06:14.590
and put an end to it all?

1170
01:06:19.930 --> 01:06:21.930
No need to be nervous.

1171
01:06:22.510 --> 01:06:24.890
You're doing a fine job.
my child.

1172
01:06:26.850 --> 01:06:30.060
Muzan will surely reveal himself
once more.

1173
01:06:30.770 --> 01:06:33.280
just as he did when he found me.

1174
01:06:35.480 --> 01:06:40.200
When it comes to this man.
that's simply his nature.

1175
01:06:40.950 --> 01:06:42.280
[gasps]

1176
01:06:45.750 --> 01:06:47.540
[KIRIYA] I understand. Father.

1177
01:06:48.250 --> 01:06:50.920
I will see to it
our plan succeeds.

1178
01:06:52.340 --> 01:06:54.960
We must find him before
the Corps members' strength

1179
01:06:55.010 --> 01:06:56.170
is fully depleted.

1180
01:06:56.210 --> 01:06:58.590
and settle this
once and for all.

1181
01:06:58.970 --> 01:07:00.140
[Gyomei grunts]

1182
01:07:04.680 --> 01:07:05.810
[distorted grunting]

1183
01:07:08.980 --> 01:07:11.150
-[grunting]
-[KAKUSHI 1] Protect them!

1184
01:07:11.190 --> 01:07:12.650
[KAKUSHI 2] Everybody. group up!

1185
01:07:12.690 --> 01:07:14.070
We have to form a wall!

1186
01:07:14.110 --> 01:07:16.110
Get their attention
off the Hashira!

1187
01:07:16.150 --> 01:07:18.570
Please. sir!
Go on ahead without us!

1188
01:07:19.110 --> 01:07:21.160
You as well! We got this!

1189
01:07:21.200 --> 01:07:22.490
Are you certain?

1190
01:07:23.120 --> 01:07:25.490
-[both grunting]
-[groans]

1191
01:07:27.080 --> 01:07:28.370
[thuds]

1192
01:07:30.830 --> 01:07:33.540
We are!
Just defeat Kibutsuji!

1193
01:07:33.580 --> 01:07:34.920
Please. sir!

1194
01:07:35.500 --> 01:07:36.920
Very well. then.

1195
01:07:36.960 --> 01:07:39.760
I will put my faith
in your efforts here.

1196
01:07:39.800 --> 01:07:40.970
Tokito!

1197
01:07:42.640 --> 01:07:43.890
[KAKUSHI 1] All right!

1198
01:07:44.010 --> 01:07:46.890
Let's show them the fruits
of our Hashira training!

1199
01:07:46.930 --> 01:07:48.230
[ALL] Right!

1200
01:07:48.270 --> 01:07:50.390
[♪ epic cinematic music playing]

1201
01:07:51.850 --> 01:07:54.020
[fight grunts]

1202
01:07:55.360 --> 01:07:57.690
[KIRIYA] Everyone. thank you.

1203
01:07:58.190 --> 01:08:01.360
I know Father would be proud
to see you giving it your all.

1204
01:08:06.990 --> 01:08:09.160
[♪ melancholic music playing]

1205
01:08:11.830 --> 01:08:14.080
-[whimpering]
-[KIRIYA] Stop that!

1206
01:08:14.790 --> 01:08:16.710
You must keep your hands moving.

1207
01:08:17.300 --> 01:08:19.510
Right now. we need to focus.

1208
01:08:21.260 --> 01:08:22.380
[KANATA] Yes.

1209
01:08:25.640 --> 01:08:28.890
Master Kiriya
is quite impressive.

1210
01:08:30.020 --> 01:08:31.770
It's clear
he's still in mourning

1211
01:08:31.810 --> 01:08:33.600
over the loss of the Master.

1212
01:08:33.640 --> 01:08:35.860
yet his duty is unwavering.

1213
01:08:36.520 --> 01:08:39.900
He's led the Demon Slayer Corps
rather splendidly.

1214
01:08:41.360 --> 01:08:44.240
Wouldn't you agree. Mr. Rengoku?

1215
01:08:45.200 --> 01:08:46.820
I would. indeed.

1216
01:08:48.200 --> 01:08:50.950
These children
are still young in years.

1217
01:08:51.000 --> 01:08:54.120
but their resolve
is anything but childish.

1218
01:08:55.290 --> 01:08:57.340
I swear to protect them.

1219
01:08:57.880 --> 01:09:00.340
Just as Kyojuro did before me.

1220
01:09:00.840 --> 01:09:03.380
I will risk my own life
to do so.

1221
01:09:07.680 --> 01:09:10.060
[Nezuko whimpers in pain]

1222
01:09:16.690 --> 01:09:19.730
[SAKONJI] I didn't think
she would suffer this much.

1223
01:09:20.820 --> 01:09:24.280
The Master was working
with a demon named Tamayo

1224
01:09:24.320 --> 01:09:26.780
who delivered this antidote.

1225
01:09:26.820 --> 01:09:29.830
I've administered it
as she instructed.

1226
01:09:31.080 --> 01:09:32.580
Even so.

1227
01:09:32.620 --> 01:09:36.960
will Nezuko be able to turn
back into a human. I wonder?

1228
01:09:37.460 --> 01:09:40.670
If Nezuko
does become human again.

1229
01:09:40.710 --> 01:09:44.050
Muzan's grand scheme
will collapse.

1230
01:09:44.090 --> 01:09:45.550
His thousand-year quest

1231
01:09:45.590 --> 01:09:48.140
for a vessel
which can resist the sun

1232
01:09:48.180 --> 01:09:49.800
will be no more.

1233
01:09:50.310 --> 01:09:53.140
And all of the progress
he's made

1234
01:09:53.180 --> 01:09:55.810
will be wound back like a clock.

1235
01:09:57.350 --> 01:10:01.360
In the many years that we've had
to endure this nightmare.

1236
01:10:01.400 --> 01:10:03.440
Nezuko is the only demon

1237
01:10:03.490 --> 01:10:06.360
who has been able
to live in the sunlight.

1238
01:10:06.400 --> 01:10:08.570
[♪ melancholic music playing]

1239
01:10:11.660 --> 01:10:13.790
[heart beating]

1240
01:10:15.080 --> 01:10:16.580
[inhales deeply]

1241
01:10:17.830 --> 01:10:19.290
[sighs wearily]

1242
01:10:22.090 --> 01:10:24.130
"The final battle."

1243
01:10:24.170 --> 01:10:27.340
These words
echo in my mind.

1244
01:10:29.180 --> 01:10:30.470
[gulps. sighs]

1245
01:10:31.010 --> 01:10:32.760
And each time they do.

1246
01:10:32.810 --> 01:10:36.180
I can't help but tremble
as my heart beats louder.

1247
01:10:37.190 --> 01:10:41.570
This battle may finally
reach its conclusion tonight.

1248
01:10:42.440 --> 01:10:47.110
I never dreamed that I'd be
alive to witness it myself.

1249
01:10:48.320 --> 01:10:49.780
Tanjiro.

1250
01:10:49.820 --> 01:10:52.280
I sometimes
think back to the day

1251
01:10:52.330 --> 01:10:55.120
when you brought
your demon sister to me.

1252
01:10:55.540 --> 01:10:57.410
Ever since then.

1253
01:10:57.460 --> 01:11:01.880
it feels like a giant wheel
of fate has been slowly turning.

1254
01:11:02.960 --> 01:11:06.960
Perhaps it would be best to
compare the sum of our battles

1255
01:11:07.010 --> 01:11:09.800
to a giant dormant machine.

1256
01:11:09.840 --> 01:11:13.930
You and Nezuko are the small
cogs that have joined together

1257
01:11:13.970 --> 01:11:15.930
and awoken it from its slumber.

1258
01:11:16.520 --> 01:11:21.480
What was once frozen in place
has now been set into motion.

1259
01:11:21.520 --> 01:11:23.690
[♪ intriguing music playing]

1260
01:11:24.190 --> 01:11:27.490
-[moaning]
-Don't give up. Nezuko.

1261
01:11:28.990 --> 01:11:31.570
Keep up the fight. Tanjiro.

1262
01:11:32.280 --> 01:11:35.450
You both have to pull through.
no matter what!

1263
01:11:35.990 --> 01:11:37.660
[TANJIRO] Hinokami Kagura:

1264
01:11:38.200 --> 01:11:39.250
Fire Wheel!

1265
01:11:39.290 --> 01:11:41.420
[♪ epic dramatic music playing]

1266
01:11:41.960 --> 01:11:43.380
Go through!

1267
01:11:43.500 --> 01:11:46.300
If I can't even sever his arm.
I'll never sever his head!

1268
01:11:46.340 --> 01:11:48.550
[yelling]

1269
01:11:49.340 --> 01:11:50.590
[flesh squelches]

1270
01:11:51.050 --> 01:11:52.550
[blood splatters]

1271
01:11:52.590 --> 01:11:53.550
DESTROY

1272
01:11:53.600 --> 01:11:54.720
I got one.

1273
01:11:54.890 --> 01:11:56.810
I was able
to dodge his attack. too.

1274
01:11:56.850 --> 01:11:58.220
I can do this!

1275
01:11:58.730 --> 01:12:00.350
I couldn't aim for his head.

1276
01:12:00.390 --> 01:12:01.940
but this time. for sure!

1277
01:12:03.060 --> 01:12:05.570
Hinokami Kagura: Fake Rainbow!

1278
01:12:05.610 --> 01:12:06.650
[fizzles out]

1279
01:12:08.900 --> 01:12:10.740
[high-pitched ringing]

1280
01:12:12.860 --> 01:12:14.820
-[panting]
-[sword clatters]

1281
01:12:16.330 --> 01:12:18.290
[flesh squelching]

1282
01:12:18.330 --> 01:12:19.790
Huh?

1283
01:12:21.250 --> 01:12:22.460
[GIYU] Tanjiro.

1284
01:12:22.960 --> 01:12:25.460
You've really sharpened
your skills. haven't you?

1285
01:12:26.380 --> 01:12:28.130
It wouldn't be an exaggeration

1286
01:12:28.170 --> 01:12:30.880
to say he's at the level
of a Hashira now.

1287
01:12:32.090 --> 01:12:36.260
To think that he'd do this well
against Upper Three.

1288
01:12:36.300 --> 01:12:38.470
[♪ enchanting folk music
playing]

1289
01:12:41.560 --> 01:12:42.810
That day...

1290
01:12:43.770 --> 01:12:46.560
...I remember a boy
who felt completely helpless

1291
01:12:47.020 --> 01:12:49.280
as he collapsed
onto the cold snow.

1292
01:12:49.780 --> 01:12:52.570
begging through tears
for his sister's life.

1293
01:13:00.370 --> 01:13:02.500
But you are helpless no longer.

1294
01:13:03.000 --> 01:13:05.830
You have the strength
to fight not only for your life.

1295
01:13:06.330 --> 01:13:08.630
but also
for what's precious to you.

1296
01:13:10.300 --> 01:13:12.840
[AKAZA] "This boy is not weak.

1297
01:13:12.880 --> 01:13:14.630
Don't insult him."

1298
01:13:15.430 --> 01:13:18.930
I must admit that Kyojuro
was right when he said that.

1299
01:13:19.430 --> 01:13:22.350
You are certainly not weak.

1300
01:13:22.390 --> 01:13:25.100
In fact. I commend you.

1301
01:13:27.860 --> 01:13:30.270
Technique Development...

1302
01:13:30.320 --> 01:13:32.490
[♪ intense rock music playing]

1303
01:13:34.450 --> 01:13:37.780
Now. let's kick things off.
shall we?

1304
01:13:38.410 --> 01:13:40.540
It's time we had some fun.

1305
01:13:46.120 --> 01:13:48.170
-[rumbling]
-[heavy creaking]

1306
01:14:08.980 --> 01:14:10.230
[exhales sharply]

1307
01:14:16.570 --> 01:14:18.160
[grunts]

1308
01:14:26.920 --> 01:14:29.960
[GIYU]
Water Breathing. Third Form:

1309
01:14:30.000 --> 01:14:31.590
Flowing Dance!

1310
01:14:32.500 --> 01:14:34.460
You're a Water Hashira.

1311
01:14:34.510 --> 01:14:36.340
How lucky for me!

1312
01:14:36.380 --> 01:14:39.140
It's been 50 years
since I fought one.

1313
01:14:43.390 --> 01:14:45.020
[debris clattering]

1314
01:14:46.890 --> 01:14:50.560
Destructive Death: Disorder!

1315
01:14:52.360 --> 01:14:55.070
Water Breathing. Eleventh Form:

1316
01:14:55.820 --> 01:14:57.240
Dead Calm.

1317
01:15:02.160 --> 01:15:04.870
[AKAZA] I've never seen
that move before.

1318
01:15:05.410 --> 01:15:07.620
Perhaps the last
Water Hashira I killed

1319
01:15:07.660 --> 01:15:09.790
never had a chance to use it!

1320
01:15:09.830 --> 01:15:13.000
[TANJIRO] Hinokami Kagura:
Raging Sun!

1321
01:15:15.170 --> 01:15:16.460
He vanished!

1322
01:15:17.210 --> 01:15:18.420
Behind me!

1323
01:15:18.470 --> 01:15:20.010
Fake Rain Kagura!

1324
01:15:21.340 --> 01:15:25.680
[GIYU] Water Breathing.
Second Form: Water Wheel.

1325
01:15:29.140 --> 01:15:30.190
[yells]

1326
01:15:38.070 --> 01:15:40.110
[TANJIRO] Hinokami Kagura:

1327
01:15:41.240 --> 01:15:42.320
Flame Dance!

1328
01:15:42.700 --> 01:15:46.450
[AKAZA] Destructive Death.
Leg Type: Crown Splitter!

1329
01:15:47.120 --> 01:15:49.660
[TANJIRO]
I blocked it with my sword.

1330
01:15:53.960 --> 01:15:56.130
His move barely grazed me

1331
01:15:56.170 --> 01:15:58.420
and still did
this kind of damage?

1332
01:16:02.800 --> 01:16:04.640
[AKAZA] How marvelous!

1333
01:16:05.970 --> 01:16:09.730
That elegant sword skill
you're using is magnificent!

1334
01:16:09.770 --> 01:16:12.600
I must know now.
What is your name?

1335
01:16:12.650 --> 01:16:14.480
I want to remember you!

1336
01:16:16.570 --> 01:16:19.610
I don't have a name
to give to a demon like you.

1337
01:16:19.650 --> 01:16:22.530
I hate talking.
so don't speak to me!

1338
01:16:23.320 --> 01:16:24.700
Is that so?

1339
01:16:24.740 --> 01:16:27.450
You're not much
for small talk. are you?

1340
01:16:27.490 --> 01:16:31.710
Well. I happen to quite
enjoy it. so I'll ask you again.

1341
01:16:32.290 --> 01:16:33.790
What is your name?

1342
01:16:33.830 --> 01:16:35.960
[grunting]

1343
01:16:37.170 --> 01:16:39.260
-[impact grunts]
-[crumbles]

1344
01:16:40.090 --> 01:16:43.300
[AKAZA]
Destructive Death. Leg Type:

1345
01:16:43.340 --> 01:16:45.600
Explosive Flurry!

1346
01:16:49.350 --> 01:16:51.730
[yelling]

1347
01:16:57.270 --> 01:16:59.690
-[impact grunts]
-[TANJIRO] Mr. Giyu!

1348
01:17:01.240 --> 01:17:03.860
I see. That's his name.

1349
01:17:03.910 --> 01:17:05.740
Thank you for letting me know.

1350
01:17:09.240 --> 01:17:10.870
Hinokami Kagura!

1351
01:17:10.910 --> 01:17:14.000
Destructive Death:
Eight-Layered Demon Core!

1352
01:17:14.040 --> 01:17:16.330
Burning Bones. Summer Sun!

1353
01:17:22.880 --> 01:17:24.720
[panting]

1354
01:17:31.270 --> 01:17:33.140
[AKAZA] Excellent form!

1355
01:17:33.180 --> 01:17:37.110
To improve this much in such
a short time is impressive.

1356
01:17:37.150 --> 01:17:39.190
I'll give you my praise.

1357
01:17:39.230 --> 01:17:40.980
It seems obvious to me

1358
01:17:41.030 --> 01:17:43.950
that Kyojuro must have
really inspired you.

1359
01:17:43.990 --> 01:17:48.280
The night we met. you were
merely a weak. mournful child.

1360
01:17:48.320 --> 01:17:49.950
crumpled on the ground.

1361
01:17:49.990 --> 01:17:52.410
Not even worthy of being killed.

1362
01:17:52.450 --> 01:17:54.500
-But just look at you now!
-[cracking]

1363
01:17:54.540 --> 01:17:58.630
This leap in your abilities.
it's like you've been reborn!

1364
01:17:58.670 --> 01:18:00.960
My heart won't stop racing.

1365
01:18:01.000 --> 01:18:03.340
I'm truly overjoyed!

1366
01:18:03.380 --> 01:18:05.130
[snickers]

1367
01:18:05.880 --> 01:18:09.760
The night Kyojuro died.
I was glad that it happened.

1368
01:18:10.890 --> 01:18:11.850
[exclaims in disbelief]

1369
01:18:12.390 --> 01:18:13.850
How tragic would it have been

1370
01:18:13.890 --> 01:18:16.060
if he had never gotten
any stronger.

1371
01:18:16.730 --> 01:18:18.900
Such a stubborn man.
not letting go

1372
01:18:18.940 --> 01:18:22.030
of those worthless values
of staying human.

1373
01:18:23.280 --> 01:18:25.030
How dare you!

1374
01:18:32.160 --> 01:18:35.120
Shut up! Just shut up!

1375
01:18:38.920 --> 01:18:41.960
Don't you dare
even speak his name!

1376
01:18:43.050 --> 01:18:44.340
[AKAZA] What's the matter?

1377
01:18:44.380 --> 01:18:46.880
I'm only paying the man
a compliment.

1378
01:18:46.920 --> 01:18:48.720
I'm being sincere.

1379
01:18:48.760 --> 01:18:50.680
These are high words of praise.

1380
01:18:50.720 --> 01:18:51.850
[TANJIRO] You're wrong.

1381
01:18:51.890 --> 01:18:54.140
All you're doing
is insulting him!

1382
01:18:54.180 --> 01:18:56.730
You're just spitting
on his memory!

1383
01:18:56.770 --> 01:18:58.390
On all of us!

1384
01:18:59.400 --> 01:19:02.110
You couldn't be
more wrong. Tanjiro.

1385
01:19:02.150 --> 01:19:06.820
As you'll recall. the only thing
I despise is weak human beings.

1386
01:19:07.320 --> 01:19:10.240
Only a feeble weakling
is deserving of my scorn

1387
01:19:10.280 --> 01:19:11.570
and no one else.

1388
01:19:12.580 --> 01:19:14.240
That's right.

1389
01:19:14.280 --> 01:19:17.500
The mere sight of them
makes my skin crawl.

1390
01:19:17.540 --> 01:19:19.290
They make me retch!

1391
01:19:20.290 --> 01:19:22.540
Through the laws of nature.
they are weeded out

1392
01:19:22.590 --> 01:19:24.960
from this world
just as they should be.

1393
01:19:25.880 --> 01:19:29.010
Everything you just said
is wrong!

1394
01:19:30.010 --> 01:19:31.180
[AKAZA] Huh?

1395
01:19:32.430 --> 01:19:34.680
The fact
you're even alive right now.

1396
01:19:34.720 --> 01:19:36.430
isn't that proof enough?

1397
01:19:37.770 --> 01:19:40.900
As an infant.
we're all helpless.

1398
01:19:40.940 --> 01:19:43.440
We can't live
without someone else's help.

1399
01:19:43.940 --> 01:19:45.980
You're no different. Akaza.

1400
01:19:46.980 --> 01:19:48.950
Even if you don't remember.

1401
01:19:48.990 --> 01:19:50.860
there was a time
when you were protected

1402
01:19:50.910 --> 01:19:52.490
and cared for by someone.

1403
01:19:52.530 --> 01:19:53.700
I know it!

1404
01:19:54.240 --> 01:19:55.870
That's why you're alive.

1405
01:20:00.710 --> 01:20:03.460
The strong should aid
and protect the weak.

1406
01:20:03.960 --> 01:20:06.130
And in turn.
the weak become strong

1407
01:20:06.170 --> 01:20:09.340
and aid and protect
those weaker than themselves!

1408
01:20:09.880 --> 01:20:12.010
That is the law of nature.

1409
01:20:12.550 --> 01:20:16.260
Akaza. I can't tolerate
your way of thinking.

1410
01:20:16.720 --> 01:20:18.310
Here on out.

1411
01:20:18.350 --> 01:20:20.850
I won't let you
do as you please!

1412
01:20:25.860 --> 01:20:27.360
[AKAZA] I get it now.

1413
01:20:30.190 --> 01:20:34.530
I have a disgust for this boy
that's almost primal in nature.

1414
01:20:35.240 --> 01:20:39.000
Even if he's stronger.
that feeling hasn't faded.

1415
01:20:43.790 --> 01:20:45.880
[MAN] No matter who they are.

1416
01:20:45.920 --> 01:20:48.920
everyone begins life
as a newborn.

1417
01:20:48.960 --> 01:20:52.470
We learn by getting help
from those around us.

1418
01:20:53.130 --> 01:20:55.890
We are not competing
with others.

1419
01:20:55.930 --> 01:20:59.600
The only opponent
you have in life is yourself.

1420
01:21:00.220 --> 01:21:04.270
Just focus on becoming stronger
than you were yesterday.

1421
01:21:05.440 --> 01:21:09.070
If you can stay this path
for a decade or even two.

1422
01:21:09.110 --> 01:21:10.690
that would be commendable.

1423
01:21:11.190 --> 01:21:12.650
And before you know it.

1424
01:21:12.700 --> 01:21:15.530
you will be helping others
in turn.

1425
01:21:16.200 --> 01:21:18.200
[breathing shakily]

1426
01:21:21.700 --> 01:21:22.750
[gasps]

1427
01:21:23.540 --> 01:21:24.540
[TANJIRO] What was that?

1428
01:21:24.670 --> 01:21:26.420
He just swung his fist
at nothing.

1429
01:21:32.590 --> 01:21:34.380
Tanjiro.

1430
01:21:35.260 --> 01:21:37.850
You still repulse me to my core.

1431
01:21:37.890 --> 01:21:38.930
[♪ rock music playing]

1432
01:21:38.970 --> 01:21:41.600
Destructive Death.
Crushing Type:

1433
01:21:41.640 --> 01:21:44.020
Ten Thousand Leaves
Flashing Willow!

1434
01:21:47.150 --> 01:21:49.110
[TANJIRO]
This speed. it's blinding!

1435
01:21:49.150 --> 01:21:51.820
No. it's not just his speed.

1436
01:21:51.860 --> 01:21:55.150
It's his precision.
his aura. and also--

1437
01:21:57.950 --> 01:21:58.990
[grunts]

1438
01:22:00.080 --> 01:22:02.370
Destructive Death. Leg Type.

1439
01:22:02.410 --> 01:22:03.410
[TANJIRO] Below.

1440
01:22:05.580 --> 01:22:07.790
[AKAZA] Flying Planet
Thousand Wheels!

1441
01:22:13.710 --> 01:22:16.180
[TANJIRO] Even if I could
anticipate his strikes.

1442
01:22:16.220 --> 01:22:19.300
they're so powerful.
I can't completely deflect them.

1443
01:22:19.350 --> 01:22:21.470
His techniques are so precise.

1444
01:22:21.510 --> 01:22:24.810
they can pierce through any
opening. no matter how small.

1445
01:22:27.690 --> 01:22:30.150
It's like a magnet
is attracting his attacks

1446
01:22:30.190 --> 01:22:32.150
straight toward my weak points.

1447
01:22:32.190 --> 01:22:35.240
But how? What's happening?

1448
01:22:35.280 --> 01:22:37.650
What could be
causing this behavior?

1449
01:22:38.070 --> 01:22:40.200
Come on. Think.

1450
01:22:41.490 --> 01:22:43.160
What's the answer?!

1451
01:22:43.200 --> 01:22:46.580
There must be a clue
in what Akaza's said or done.

1452
01:22:46.620 --> 01:22:48.870
[Akaza grunts] Hyah!

1453
01:22:49.920 --> 01:22:53.380
[TANJIRO] Hinokami Kagura:
Solar Heat Haze!

1454
01:23:01.140 --> 01:23:02.600
[blood spurts]

1455
01:23:03.140 --> 01:23:05.890
[chuckles]
What an interesting move.

1456
01:23:05.930 --> 01:23:09.650
I dodged it at first. but then
the blade seemed to extend.

1457
01:23:09.690 --> 01:23:12.190
I don't know what kind of swing
you put behind it.

1458
01:23:12.230 --> 01:23:13.900
but the tip of your blade
wavered

1459
01:23:13.940 --> 01:23:17.190
like it was in a heat haze.
How fascinating!

1460
01:23:20.490 --> 01:23:22.490
-[grunts]
-[glass shattering]

1461
01:23:23.950 --> 01:23:26.080
[debris crumbling]

1462
01:23:27.870 --> 01:23:31.380
[TANJIRO]
Hinokami Kagura: Dance!

1463
01:23:32.170 --> 01:23:33.460
[clangs]

1464
01:23:33.500 --> 01:23:34.710
My sword!

1465
01:23:35.710 --> 01:23:37.090
He'll break it!

1466
01:23:38.260 --> 01:23:40.630
[effort grunts]

1467
01:23:41.930 --> 01:23:43.720
That was a strong headbutt.

1468
01:23:45.390 --> 01:23:47.560
[TANJIRO] Damn you!
Let go of me!

1469
01:23:48.890 --> 01:23:50.440
No good. [straining]

1470
01:23:50.480 --> 01:23:52.650
I can't get him
to loosen his grip.

1471
01:23:56.820 --> 01:23:58.490
[water splashing]

1472
01:24:03.490 --> 01:24:04.660
[grunts softly]

1473
01:24:04.700 --> 01:24:06.200
Mr. Giyu!

1474
01:24:06.700 --> 01:24:08.580
[Giyu sighs]

1475
01:24:09.960 --> 01:24:12.540
You're starting
to get on my nerves.

1476
01:24:12.580 --> 01:24:15.420
Thanks to you.
my back is killing me now.

1477
01:24:15.960 --> 01:24:19.130
I'm not fond of being hurled
like a rag doll.

1478
01:24:19.170 --> 01:24:21.050
I'm gonna make you pay.

1479
01:24:24.090 --> 01:24:28.100
Personally. I'd rather not draw
my sword if I can help it.

1480
01:24:28.600 --> 01:24:31.480
And I have a hard time
justifying using deadly force

1481
01:24:31.520 --> 01:24:32.900
if unnecessary.

1482
01:24:34.150 --> 01:24:35.980
But at this moment.

1483
01:24:36.020 --> 01:24:39.490
I'm against an opponent that
demands everything from me.

1484
01:24:39.530 --> 01:24:41.070
In the short time we fought.

1485
01:24:41.110 --> 01:24:43.700
my senses have been
pushed past their limits.

1486
01:24:44.740 --> 01:24:47.540
My dormant senses
have been rudely awakened

1487
01:24:47.580 --> 01:24:50.790
and are dragging me forward
towards the enemy.

1488
01:24:51.620 --> 01:24:55.250
I now know how much
it expands one's potential

1489
01:24:55.290 --> 01:24:57.340
to have one's back
against the wall

1490
01:24:57.380 --> 01:24:59.130
with their sword raised

1491
01:24:59.170 --> 01:25:00.920
in the face of death.

1492
01:25:04.180 --> 01:25:05.390
Mr. Giyu.

1493
01:25:11.270 --> 01:25:12.850
[♪ intense music playing]

1494
01:25:22.450 --> 01:25:25.320
[AKAZA] A mark appeared
and his movements have gotten...

1495
01:25:25.360 --> 01:25:26.740
Faster!

1496
01:25:31.290 --> 01:25:34.790
[GIYU] Water Breathing.
Fourth Form: Striking Tide!

1497
01:25:35.790 --> 01:25:37.670
[grunts softly. chuckles]

1498
01:25:42.630 --> 01:25:43.760
[grunts]

1499
01:25:49.140 --> 01:25:50.810
[TANJIRO] They're both so fast.

1500
01:25:50.850 --> 01:25:53.520
Mr. Giyu's speed increased
with the mark.

1501
01:25:53.560 --> 01:25:55.770
but Akaza adapted to it
instantly.

1502
01:25:58.230 --> 01:26:00.770
Don't tell me
that's all you're capable of!

1503
01:26:00.820 --> 01:26:02.900
[Giyu groans angrily]

1504
01:26:04.860 --> 01:26:07.240
[both grunting]

1505
01:26:09.830 --> 01:26:13.620
Show me more!
Don't you dare hold back!

1506
01:26:42.440 --> 01:26:46.070
[GIYU]
Tenth Form: Constant Flux!

1507
01:26:53.580 --> 01:26:55.160
[yelling]

1508
01:27:03.130 --> 01:27:06.510
Seventh Form:
Drop Ripple Thrust!

1509
01:27:06.550 --> 01:27:09.300
Destructive Death: Disorder!

1510
01:27:19.940 --> 01:27:22.650
[TANJIRO] Mr. Giyu! Akaza!

1511
01:27:24.860 --> 01:27:26.280
Calm down!

1512
01:27:27.070 --> 01:27:29.110
[weapons clanging]

1513
01:27:30.160 --> 01:27:32.450
Think. Don't panic.

1514
01:27:32.490 --> 01:27:34.910
Whatever you do.
don't lose focus.

1515
01:27:35.540 --> 01:27:36.790
[grunts]

1516
01:27:37.000 --> 01:27:40.250
Why is it that Akaza's attacks
are always so accurate?

1517
01:27:41.170 --> 01:27:45.210
How is he able to respond
to attacks from his blind spots?

1518
01:27:46.090 --> 01:27:47.300
Think!

1519
01:27:51.840 --> 01:27:53.930
[AKAZA] Your fighting spirit
has been tempered

1520
01:27:53.970 --> 01:27:55.640
like quality steel.

1521
01:27:55.680 --> 01:27:57.140
Your name?

1522
01:27:57.810 --> 01:27:59.020
[gasps]

1523
01:28:00.020 --> 01:28:02.190
[TANJIRO]
Back when he fought Mr. Rengoku.

1524
01:28:02.230 --> 01:28:05.900
I remember Akaza using the words
"fighting spirit."

1525
01:28:07.280 --> 01:28:09.190
What did he mean by that?

1526
01:28:09.240 --> 01:28:12.110
Is he able to sense things
through fighting spirit?

1527
01:28:12.660 --> 01:28:15.410
The same way I can sense things
through scent?

1528
01:28:29.510 --> 01:28:31.720
Wherever the enemy's aiming at.

1529
01:28:31.760 --> 01:28:33.930
I get this weird
tingling feeling.

1530
01:28:33.970 --> 01:28:37.510
So. that's how you knew Gyutaro
was attacking you from behind.

1531
01:28:37.560 --> 01:28:39.730
You sure are incredible.
Inosuke.

1532
01:28:39.770 --> 01:28:41.600
[laughs boisterously]

1533
01:28:41.640 --> 01:28:44.690
Well. my skin is tougher
than most people's.

1534
01:28:44.730 --> 01:28:46.570
And whether
it's from behind or not.

1535
01:28:46.610 --> 01:28:47.780
if someone's looking at me.

1536
01:28:47.820 --> 01:28:49.570
I know just
where they're lookin'.

1537
01:28:49.610 --> 01:28:51.150
Could you show me?

1538
01:28:51.190 --> 01:28:53.660
[laughs] Sure thing!

1539
01:28:54.410 --> 01:28:55.950
[determined grunt]

1540
01:28:58.490 --> 01:29:00.200
-It's my right shoulder.
-[gasps]

1541
01:29:00.250 --> 01:29:02.040
You really got it.
That's amazing!

1542
01:29:02.580 --> 01:29:05.000
It's even easier to know
someone's looking at me

1543
01:29:05.040 --> 01:29:06.590
if they had killing intent.

1544
01:29:06.630 --> 01:29:10.050
Since anyone who can harm me
is bad news.

1545
01:29:10.090 --> 01:29:12.800
killing intent kind of
feels like it's stabbing me

1546
01:29:12.840 --> 01:29:14.300
through the skin. you know?

1547
01:29:15.220 --> 01:29:16.470
[TANJIRO] That's right.

1548
01:29:16.510 --> 01:29:19.180
Inosuke was able
to sense the invisible

1549
01:29:19.220 --> 01:29:21.890
using only his honed
sense of touch.

1550
01:29:22.600 --> 01:29:25.940
Think back.
What else did we talk about...

1551
01:29:26.650 --> 01:29:27.820
that day?

1552
01:29:27.860 --> 01:29:29.820
Where things get real tricky

1553
01:29:29.860 --> 01:29:32.860
is when someone who doesn't have
killing intent or hostility

1554
01:29:32.900 --> 01:29:34.110
is looking at me.

1555
01:29:34.150 --> 01:29:36.450
-like that tiny hag!
-Huh?

1556
01:29:37.030 --> 01:29:38.120
[INOSUKE] That old hag

1557
01:29:38.160 --> 01:29:40.120
from the house
with the wisteria mark

1558
01:29:40.160 --> 01:29:41.450
was sneaky.

1559
01:29:41.500 --> 01:29:43.120
Before I knew it...

1560
01:29:43.160 --> 01:29:44.290
Huh?

1561
01:29:45.750 --> 01:29:49.130
...she'd be sitting right
behind me holding rice balls.

1562
01:29:49.840 --> 01:29:52.920
Calling her a "hag" isn't nice.
She's elderly.

1563
01:29:52.960 --> 01:29:55.050
-Elderly hag!
-Stop that!

1564
01:29:55.090 --> 01:29:57.050
Well. that got me thinkin'.

1565
01:29:57.090 --> 01:30:00.680
If I could hide my killing
intent. then I'd be a ninja.

1566
01:30:00.720 --> 01:30:03.020
I'd be able to sneak up
on anybody.

1567
01:30:03.060 --> 01:30:05.140
-[chuckles excitedly]
-Sure.

1568
01:30:05.190 --> 01:30:07.860
But. Inosuke.
she was only sneaky

1569
01:30:07.900 --> 01:30:10.570
'cause she didn't have
the intent of harming you.

1570
01:30:10.610 --> 01:30:13.320
And I think beheading a demon
without killing intent

1571
01:30:13.360 --> 01:30:14.700
would be impossible.

1572
01:30:15.320 --> 01:30:16.700
[INOSUKE] Hmm.

1573
01:30:17.240 --> 01:30:19.240
Yeah. you're probably right.

1574
01:30:19.280 --> 01:30:22.240
A half-hearted strike
without any killing intent

1575
01:30:22.290 --> 01:30:25.830
would never be strong enough
to cut through a demon's neck.

1576
01:30:26.750 --> 01:30:28.960
[TANJIRO]
It was a casual conversation

1577
01:30:29.000 --> 01:30:31.630
but I think Inosuke
was on to something.

1578
01:30:33.840 --> 01:30:36.760
What is it that
Akaza supposedly senses?

1579
01:30:36.800 --> 01:30:39.220
What does he mean
by "fighting spirit"?

1580
01:30:39.260 --> 01:30:41.050
Is it killing intent?

1581
01:30:41.100 --> 01:30:42.600
Is it the will to fight?

1582
01:30:42.640 --> 01:30:44.270
The time spent training?

1583
01:30:44.310 --> 01:30:45.850
Or maybe the amount?

1584
01:30:46.810 --> 01:30:47.980
Is it like the way

1585
01:30:48.060 --> 01:30:49.980
I can anticipate movements
through scent?

1586
01:30:51.310 --> 01:30:53.440
There must be something I can do

1587
01:30:53.940 --> 01:30:55.740
to disrupt his compass!

1588
01:30:58.820 --> 01:31:00.120
[♪ rock music playing]

1589
01:31:05.750 --> 01:31:08.080
Hinokami Kagura: Dance!

1590
01:31:10.210 --> 01:31:13.170
Just one problem
with your attack.

1591
01:31:13.210 --> 01:31:15.050
You're wide open!

1592
01:31:17.590 --> 01:31:19.090
[TANJIRO] His fist!

1593
01:31:24.850 --> 01:31:26.270
[grunts]

1594
01:31:30.690 --> 01:31:32.310
[panting]

1595
01:31:32.360 --> 01:31:33.610
Fighting spirit.

1596
01:31:33.650 --> 01:31:35.940
Instincts. Compass.

1597
01:31:35.980 --> 01:31:37.240
Perception.

1598
01:31:37.740 --> 01:31:41.360
Striking with killing intent.
Sensing the invisible.

1599
01:31:41.410 --> 01:31:43.530
Executing the impossible.

1600
01:31:43.990 --> 01:31:45.240
I see.

1601
01:31:46.950 --> 01:31:48.660
So. that's it.

1602
01:31:51.460 --> 01:31:53.630
-[birds chirping]
-[leaves rustling]

1603
01:31:56.550 --> 01:31:59.090
[laughter]

1604
01:32:05.810 --> 01:32:08.180
Um. Father?
What do you think about

1605
01:32:08.220 --> 01:32:10.640
when you dance
the Hinokami Kagura?

1606
01:32:11.230 --> 01:32:15.190
If it's too tiring for you.
I can take your place next year.

1607
01:32:15.730 --> 01:32:18.070
I don't want you
to overwork yourself.

1608
01:32:19.570 --> 01:32:21.400
Thank you. Tanjiro.

1609
01:32:22.110 --> 01:32:24.620
But to be honest.
I haven't found the Kagura

1610
01:32:24.660 --> 01:32:28.040
to be the least bit tiring
over the last few years.

1611
01:32:28.660 --> 01:32:30.410
I can't quite explain it.

1612
01:32:30.460 --> 01:32:33.920
but back when I learned it
from your grandfather years ago.

1613
01:32:33.960 --> 01:32:37.960
even though I was younger.
healthier and stronger than now.

1614
01:32:38.010 --> 01:32:41.050
I found it to be
far more tiring back then.

1615
01:32:43.300 --> 01:32:44.720
[♪ poignant music playing]

1616
01:32:44.760 --> 01:32:47.470
[TANJIRO] For generations.
the Kagura was performed

1617
01:32:47.510 --> 01:32:50.270
by the Kamado family
at the start of each year.

1618
01:32:50.770 --> 01:32:52.770
It was an exhausting performance

1619
01:32:52.810 --> 01:32:55.690
that would last
from sunset till dawn.

1620
01:32:56.900 --> 01:32:59.440
There are 12 different forms
that must be repeated

1621
01:32:59.480 --> 01:33:01.400
over and over again.

1622
01:33:01.440 --> 01:33:04.030
thousands of times
before daybreak.

1623
01:33:06.870 --> 01:33:08.370
I think my exhaustion

1624
01:33:08.410 --> 01:33:10.750
was the result
of unnecessary movement.

1625
01:33:11.250 --> 01:33:12.920
Using the correct movements

1626
01:33:12.960 --> 01:33:15.830
and breathing patterns
are vital to the dance.

1627
01:33:16.590 --> 01:33:19.460
It's what allows you
to produce maximum strength

1628
01:33:19.500 --> 01:33:21.260
while using minimal actions.

1629
01:33:21.300 --> 01:33:24.300
Once you've mastered
your breathing and movement.

1630
01:33:24.340 --> 01:33:27.010
your mind will become
transparent.

1631
01:33:27.720 --> 01:33:29.510
Transparent?

1632
01:33:30.470 --> 01:33:32.230
But before any of that.

1633
01:33:32.270 --> 01:33:34.600
you must memorize
the moves of the dance

1634
01:33:34.640 --> 01:33:37.940
and slowly ingrain them
into your muscle memory.

1635
01:33:37.980 --> 01:33:41.440
In doing so.
you'll open up your five senses

1636
01:33:41.480 --> 01:33:43.950
and become aware
of the shape of your own body.

1637
01:33:43.990 --> 01:33:45.780
vessel by vessel.

1638
01:33:47.370 --> 01:33:50.410
That was the truly
strenuous part.

1639
01:33:50.450 --> 01:33:53.790
All you can think is that
even if you go on struggling.

1640
01:33:53.830 --> 01:33:55.710
you'll never succeed.

1641
01:33:56.250 --> 01:33:58.130
After you've learned
all these things

1642
01:33:58.170 --> 01:33:59.710
and committed them to memory.

1643
01:33:59.750 --> 01:34:02.920
you'll understand how to remove
what you don't need.

1644
01:34:02.970 --> 01:34:06.800
only leaving behind in your body
what is required of you.

1645
01:34:06.840 --> 01:34:08.760
closing off the rest.

1646
01:34:09.350 --> 01:34:10.600
Closing?

1647
01:34:11.350 --> 01:34:13.600
You know how people
often close their eyes

1648
01:34:13.640 --> 01:34:15.600
when they're trying
to hear better?

1649
01:34:16.350 --> 01:34:18.190
In that same way.

1650
01:34:18.230 --> 01:34:20.320
you'll pick out the things
you need the most

1651
01:34:20.360 --> 01:34:22.990
in the movement
while eliminating the rest.

1652
01:34:23.570 --> 01:34:27.360
Eventually. you will be able
to open and close the vessels

1653
01:34:27.410 --> 01:34:30.780
and muscles in your body.
as if it were second nature.

1654
01:34:30.830 --> 01:34:33.910
The same way you blink
without a second thought.

1655
01:34:34.620 --> 01:34:36.370
When that happens.

1656
01:34:36.410 --> 01:34:39.880
a path illuminated
by a bright light will open.

1657
01:34:41.130 --> 01:34:45.050
If your mind is as clear
as possible. you'll begin to see

1658
01:34:45.090 --> 01:34:47.590
the Transparent World
before you.

1659
01:34:47.630 --> 01:34:50.010
But this domain
can only be reached

1660
01:34:50.050 --> 01:34:51.970
by pushing yourself
past your limits.

1661
01:34:52.010 --> 01:34:54.640
despite the suffering
that may be required.

1662
01:34:55.180 --> 01:34:56.890
Will I ever get to see it?

1663
01:34:57.890 --> 01:35:01.360
If you work tirelessly.
then that's for you to decide.

1664
01:35:02.070 --> 01:35:04.150
There. All done.

1665
01:35:04.190 --> 01:35:05.400
[TANJIRO] Thank you.

1666
01:35:09.070 --> 01:35:11.830
Ten days before my father died.

1667
01:35:11.870 --> 01:35:14.660
an incident where a bear
began attacking people

1668
01:35:14.700 --> 01:35:16.830
happened on
a neighboring mountain.

1669
01:35:17.330 --> 01:35:19.960
We lit bonfires around the house

1670
01:35:20.000 --> 01:35:22.840
and set up multiple ropes
lined with bells.

1671
01:35:34.390 --> 01:35:35.600
Hmm?

1672
01:35:41.440 --> 01:35:42.900
[TANJURO] Tanjiro.

1673
01:35:47.190 --> 01:35:48.860
[TANJIRO] Yes. Father?

1674
01:35:49.820 --> 01:35:51.160
[TANJURO] Come with me.

1675
01:35:52.200 --> 01:35:54.160
[Tanjiro grunting. panting]

1676
01:36:03.710 --> 01:36:05.050
[grunts]

1677
01:36:23.520 --> 01:36:25.650
[breathing unsteadily]

1678
01:36:26.480 --> 01:36:28.650
[♪ dramatic sting]

1679
01:36:32.910 --> 01:36:36.200
[loud growling]

1680
01:36:40.370 --> 01:36:43.420
[TANJURO] I understand
you must be very hungry.

1681
01:36:43.460 --> 01:36:46.670
But I'm afraid I can't allow you
to come any closer.

1682
01:36:47.840 --> 01:36:51.010
If anyone were to try
and cause harm to my family.

1683
01:36:51.050 --> 01:36:53.680
I would be forced
to show you no mercy.

1684
01:36:54.180 --> 01:36:56.510
If you disregard this warning...

1685
01:36:59.470 --> 01:37:02.390
...I'll have no choice
but to take your life.

1686
01:37:03.270 --> 01:37:04.850
-[roaring]
-[bells tinkling]

1687
01:37:05.310 --> 01:37:06.820
[thuds]

1688
01:37:06.860 --> 01:37:08.020
[gasps]

1689
01:37:11.650 --> 01:37:13.660
[bells tinkling]

1690
01:37:13.700 --> 01:37:17.490
[TANJIRO] The bear's head that
was as thick as a human torso

1691
01:37:17.530 --> 01:37:20.540
dropped to the ground
with the sound of the bells.

1692
01:37:22.460 --> 01:37:24.710
My eyes couldn't follow it.

1693
01:37:24.750 --> 01:37:26.460
But if I'm not mistaken.

1694
01:37:26.500 --> 01:37:29.840
my father slashed it twice
in the blink of an eye.

1695
01:37:31.460 --> 01:37:33.010
He must have.

1696
01:37:33.050 --> 01:37:36.180
His ax wouldn't have been
able to cut through otherwise.

1697
01:37:37.680 --> 01:37:41.220
All the while.
my father's scent never wavered.

1698
01:37:41.270 --> 01:37:43.730
Before and after
beheading the bear.

1699
01:37:43.770 --> 01:37:47.310
he emitted no fear.
no killing intent.

1700
01:37:54.570 --> 01:37:56.570
I hope that you were watching.

1701
01:37:57.620 --> 01:38:00.370
A day might come
where you have to do the same.

1702
01:38:00.410 --> 01:38:02.250
[wind blowing]

1703
01:38:03.370 --> 01:38:05.460
[TANJIRO] My father
wasn't the type of person

1704
01:38:05.500 --> 01:38:07.000
to flaunt his strength.

1705
01:38:07.710 --> 01:38:10.000
I realized later on.

1706
01:38:10.050 --> 01:38:14.050
that night. he wanted me
to see it in action.

1707
01:38:15.260 --> 01:38:17.800
The movements necessary
to be able to see

1708
01:38:17.840 --> 01:38:20.470
the Transparent World
he spoke of.

1709
01:38:22.560 --> 01:38:27.060
I'm sure my father. grandfather.
and great-grandfather

1710
01:38:27.560 --> 01:38:29.730
all learned the same way.

1711
01:38:31.360 --> 01:38:33.820
Whatever you do. never give up.

1712
01:38:33.860 --> 01:38:36.070
Always stay calm and focused.

1713
01:38:36.740 --> 01:38:39.660
Any wall you come up against
can be shattered

1714
01:38:40.200 --> 01:38:42.330
if you just work tirelessly.

1715
01:38:44.040 --> 01:38:45.910
[TANJIRO] I understand. Father.

1716
01:38:45.960 --> 01:38:47.500
In that moment...

1717
01:38:48.040 --> 01:38:49.380
that's why I was able to dodge

1718
01:38:49.420 --> 01:38:52.550
Akaza's inescapable blow
to my side.

1719
01:38:55.300 --> 01:38:57.090
If I hadn't moved in time.

1720
01:38:57.130 --> 01:38:59.590
I'm positive that strike
would have killed me.

1721
01:39:00.260 --> 01:39:02.890
When I was alternating moves
with Mr. Giyu.

1722
01:39:02.930 --> 01:39:05.470
weaving my attacks
in between each of his.

1723
01:39:05.980 --> 01:39:09.400
I was protected from being hit
by those lethal blows.

1724
01:39:09.900 --> 01:39:11.060
But in that instant.

1725
01:39:11.110 --> 01:39:13.780
even Mr. Giyu
couldn't make it in time.

1726
01:39:15.030 --> 01:39:20.030
However. for whatever reason.
I knew dodging was possible.

1727
01:39:20.530 --> 01:39:23.200
And for just a split second.

1728
01:39:23.240 --> 01:39:25.120
I was able to see it.

1729
01:39:26.870 --> 01:39:28.500
That world.

1730
01:39:30.290 --> 01:39:32.290
[♪ enchanting music playing]

1731
01:39:32.340 --> 01:39:34.840
The Transparent World.

1732
01:39:37.130 --> 01:39:40.340
Even his body
started to look transparent.

1733
01:39:41.430 --> 01:39:45.270
The same is when Hantengu
was hiding inside his own heart.

1734
01:39:45.770 --> 01:39:48.890
I don't know
if I saw him or smelled him.

1735
01:39:53.360 --> 01:39:54.770
Dodge.

1736
01:39:54.820 --> 01:39:58.030
I used only the senses
that would let me do that.

1737
01:39:58.570 --> 01:40:02.280
Without thinking. my body
moved faster than ever before.

1738
01:40:03.570 --> 01:40:07.040
When I'm inside the Transparent
World my father spoke of.

1739
01:40:07.080 --> 01:40:10.370
my battle instincts
improve drastically.

1740
01:40:12.380 --> 01:40:14.630
I can see my opponent's lungs

1741
01:40:14.670 --> 01:40:17.010
and the blood moving
throughout their body.

1742
01:40:17.500 --> 01:40:19.970
I can see
my own muscles contracting

1743
01:40:20.010 --> 01:40:22.800
faster and clearer than before.

1744
01:40:26.310 --> 01:40:28.560
If I close off
the fighting spirit

1745
01:40:28.600 --> 01:40:31.230
that Akaza
must be detecting me with.

1746
01:40:31.270 --> 01:40:33.060
I can go for his neck.

1747
01:40:33.520 --> 01:40:35.320
[screeches]

1748
01:40:46.030 --> 01:40:47.580
[TANJIRO] See it.

1749
01:40:47.620 --> 01:40:49.120
See it!

1750
01:40:49.160 --> 01:40:51.250
[exhales]

1751
01:40:51.290 --> 01:40:52.500
[♪ rock music playing]

1752
01:40:52.540 --> 01:40:54.000
It looks like
you've thrown about

1753
01:40:54.040 --> 01:40:56.130
every last Water Form at me.

1754
01:40:56.750 --> 01:40:59.300
Enough is enough.
wouldn't you say?

1755
01:40:59.880 --> 01:41:01.720
I'm putting an end to this.

1756
01:41:01.760 --> 01:41:04.890
But you have my respect
for lasting so long!

1757
01:41:06.390 --> 01:41:07.510
[GIYU] What?

1758
01:41:08.640 --> 01:41:10.640
In the middle of my downswing...

1759
01:41:12.100 --> 01:41:13.940
...he hit it from the side.

1760
01:41:15.560 --> 01:41:17.320
And snapped my sword!

1761
01:41:17.900 --> 01:41:20.190
-Goodbye. Giyu.
-[impact grunts]

1762
01:41:24.320 --> 01:41:26.120
[flesh squelching]

1763
01:41:27.080 --> 01:41:29.700
[muted silence]

1764
01:41:30.450 --> 01:41:31.500
[thuds]

1765
01:41:31.540 --> 01:41:33.660
[♪ intense dramatic music
playing]

1766
01:41:43.800 --> 01:41:46.800
-[exhales]
-[flame roaring]

1767
01:41:49.470 --> 01:41:52.680
[GIYU] He stopped the attack
by cutting off his fist.

1768
01:41:52.730 --> 01:41:54.810
His breathing is different.

1769
01:41:54.850 --> 01:41:56.480
And his appearance...

1770
01:41:57.770 --> 01:42:00.190
I've been saved by Tanjiro.

1771
01:42:01.570 --> 01:42:03.490
[AKAZA]
All of the cells in my body

1772
01:42:03.530 --> 01:42:05.110
down to the ones in my hair

1773
01:42:05.150 --> 01:42:08.370
are screaming at me to kill him
as soon as possible.

1774
01:42:10.080 --> 01:42:13.120
I don't know what kind of change
he underwent. but...

1775
01:42:14.370 --> 01:42:16.080
...he's dangerous.

1776
01:42:17.620 --> 01:42:19.790
[GIYU] His focus is on Tanjiro.

1777
01:42:20.880 --> 01:42:22.510
Now's my chance.

1778
01:42:26.880 --> 01:42:29.720
[AKAZA] Technique Development.
Final Form:

1779
01:42:30.260 --> 01:42:32.640
Blue Silver Chaotic Afterglow!

1780
01:42:35.850 --> 01:42:38.230
[GIYU] His attack speed
boosted again.

1781
01:42:38.270 --> 01:42:39.980
and the force is increased.

1782
01:42:40.440 --> 01:42:44.110
My only chance now
is with Dead Calm!

1783
01:43:05.840 --> 01:43:08.680
[TANJIRO] This must be
what Father was talking about.

1784
01:43:09.180 --> 01:43:13.010
This is it.
The Transparent World.

1785
01:43:20.810 --> 01:43:27.320
Strange. It feels like
time is passing by so slowly.

1786
01:43:29.030 --> 01:43:33.700
Or maybe... their movements
just look slower now.

1787
01:43:33.740 --> 01:43:35.910
[♪ intense music continues]

1788
01:43:36.950 --> 01:43:38.290
[groans]

1789
01:43:39.670 --> 01:43:41.630
[GIYU] It's no use.

1790
01:43:41.670 --> 01:43:44.750
A hundred strikes at once
is unavoidable.

1791
01:43:45.250 --> 01:43:46.880
Even with Dead Calm.

1792
01:43:46.920 --> 01:43:49.680
I still wasn't able
to block all of them.

1793
01:43:51.010 --> 01:43:52.850
[AKAZA] Stand proud. Giyu.

1794
01:43:52.890 --> 01:43:55.720
Most wouldn't have been
able to survive that.

1795
01:43:55.760 --> 01:43:58.690
You must have evaded
my fatal blows.

1796
01:43:59.480 --> 01:44:03.480
There's no need for you to die
like Kyojuro and Tanjiro did.

1797
01:44:03.520 --> 01:44:06.570
Give up your pride
and become a demon. Giyu.

1798
01:44:08.320 --> 01:44:11.780
[GIYU] Tanjiro's behind him
and he hasn't noticed?

1799
01:44:12.320 --> 01:44:14.870
-[Akaza speaking indistinctly]
-Is he masking his presence?

1800
01:44:14.910 --> 01:44:16.540
Now's our chance!

1801
01:44:17.370 --> 01:44:19.040
Tanjiro. do it!

1802
01:44:19.080 --> 01:44:21.500
If you have the strength.
behead him.

1803
01:44:22.000 --> 01:44:23.920
Before he notices you.

1804
01:44:23.960 --> 01:44:25.460
go for it!

1805
01:44:25.500 --> 01:44:29.380
Akaza!
Prepare to be decapitated!

1806
01:44:29.420 --> 01:44:30.680
[AKAZA] Huh?

1807
01:44:35.220 --> 01:44:37.760
[GIYU] He willingly
gave himself away!

1808
01:44:38.390 --> 01:44:40.180
[AKAZA] He's still alive?

1809
01:44:40.640 --> 01:44:42.600
I never would have thought
someone like him

1810
01:44:42.650 --> 01:44:44.860
could survive
an attack like that.

1811
01:44:45.400 --> 01:44:47.110
Well. it doesn't matter.

1812
01:44:47.150 --> 01:44:49.570
After all. my Destructive Death.
Compass Needle

1813
01:44:49.610 --> 01:44:51.200
can detect any attack!

1814
01:44:51.650 --> 01:44:54.990
The stronger my opponent's
fighting spirit is.

1815
01:44:55.030 --> 01:44:57.950
the greater
my Compass Needle's reaction.

1816
01:44:59.330 --> 01:45:00.540
[quivers]

1817
01:45:01.120 --> 01:45:02.830
What is this?

1818
01:45:03.290 --> 01:45:05.960
What is this odd presence
he's emitting?

1819
01:45:06.000 --> 01:45:07.960
It feels like
he's turned himself

1820
01:45:08.000 --> 01:45:09.800
into some other creature.

1821
01:45:09.840 --> 01:45:11.130
It's like...

1822
01:45:12.550 --> 01:45:15.090
...his fighting spirit is gone.

1823
01:45:15.140 --> 01:45:16.430
But how?

1824
01:45:16.470 --> 01:45:19.220
I have to calm down. Focus!

1825
01:45:19.680 --> 01:45:21.060
[grunts]

1826
01:45:21.810 --> 01:45:23.270
[flame roaring]

1827
01:45:25.560 --> 01:45:27.610
[TANJIRO] Hinokami Kagura:

1828
01:45:27.650 --> 01:45:30.230
Setting Sun Transformation.

1829
01:45:30.280 --> 01:45:32.450
[♪ intriguing music playing]

1830
01:45:33.280 --> 01:45:35.410
[tinkling]

1831
01:45:48.340 --> 01:45:49.460
[gasps]

1832
01:45:51.710 --> 01:45:54.430
[Akaza straining]
This can't be possible.

1833
01:45:57.010 --> 01:45:59.390
[Tanjiro exhales]

1834
01:46:01.430 --> 01:46:03.730
[AKAZA] In the last
several hundred years.

1835
01:46:03.770 --> 01:46:07.230
I've never once seen a human
without any fighting spirit.

1836
01:46:07.690 --> 01:46:10.690
Even newborn children
had traces of it.

1837
01:46:11.280 --> 01:46:13.780
And yet. in that instant.

1838
01:46:13.820 --> 01:46:15.740
his fighting spirit vanished

1839
01:46:15.780 --> 01:46:18.200
as if it were never there
to begin with.

1840
01:46:21.700 --> 01:46:24.000
It's as if
I was facing an anomaly

1841
01:46:24.040 --> 01:46:25.750
that shouldn't even exist.

1842
01:46:25.790 --> 01:46:28.500
So. my senses
were thrown into confusion.

1843
01:46:28.960 --> 01:46:32.000
My Compass Needle
detected nothing.

1844
01:46:32.550 --> 01:46:34.010
[tinkling]

1845
01:46:34.050 --> 01:46:37.090
But that's not the biggest issue
at hand here.

1846
01:46:37.130 --> 01:46:38.850
When on the battlefield.

1847
01:46:38.890 --> 01:46:41.510
there's no telling
what could come your way.

1848
01:46:41.560 --> 01:46:44.230
It's vital that you're able
to deal with the unexpected

1849
01:46:44.270 --> 01:46:45.770
at a moment's notice.

1850
01:46:46.270 --> 01:46:48.520
And I'm able to do that!

1851
01:46:49.150 --> 01:46:52.070
Or at least... I thought so.

1852
01:46:52.980 --> 01:46:55.700
But during that short battle.

1853
01:46:55.740 --> 01:47:00.200
he was able to grasp something
and use it to surpass my speed.

1854
01:47:00.700 --> 01:47:03.160
Whatever it was he learned
was able to shatter

1855
01:47:03.200 --> 01:47:05.500
centuries' worth
of martial arts techniques

1856
01:47:05.540 --> 01:47:07.540
with a single head-on attack.

1857
01:47:08.250 --> 01:47:12.380
Within those eyes of his.
there was no hatred. no rage.

1858
01:47:12.420 --> 01:47:15.510
no killing intent
or fighting spirit.

1859
01:47:16.170 --> 01:47:19.130
He must have somehow seen
what I'd been looking for:

1860
01:47:19.180 --> 01:47:23.560
the domain that lies
within the realm of the highest.

1861
01:47:25.270 --> 01:47:27.810
None other than
the selfless state.

1862
01:47:29.940 --> 01:47:32.610
For some time now.
I've had a vague sense

1863
01:47:32.650 --> 01:47:34.690
that this state of mind existed.

1864
01:47:35.150 --> 01:47:37.740
And yet. even after
all these centuries.

1865
01:47:37.780 --> 01:47:39.570
I've yet to attain it.

1866
01:47:47.080 --> 01:47:48.120
[gasps]

1867
01:47:48.710 --> 01:47:50.330
[AKAZA] Not yet!

1868
01:47:50.370 --> 01:47:52.080
I can still fight!

1869
01:47:52.130 --> 01:47:54.750
I will continue
to become stronger!

1870
01:48:01.010 --> 01:48:04.100
[TANJIRO] This is bad.
He's reattaching his head!

1871
01:48:04.560 --> 01:48:06.680
[effort grunting]

1872
01:48:08.350 --> 01:48:10.560
-[thuds]
-[gasps]

1873
01:48:13.230 --> 01:48:15.610
[AKAZA] I can't die here.

1874
01:48:16.980 --> 01:48:18.820
Not like this.

1875
01:48:21.820 --> 01:48:24.580
I have to become stronger.

1876
01:48:26.660 --> 01:48:30.000
Stronger than anyone else
in the whole world!

1877
01:48:30.040 --> 01:48:31.830
Stronger!

1878
01:48:32.290 --> 01:48:34.080
-[thuds]
-[fizzles out]

1879
01:48:34.130 --> 01:48:37.300
I have to find a way
to become stronger.

1880
01:48:39.380 --> 01:48:40.510
[clatters]

1881
01:48:44.430 --> 01:48:45.760
[body thuds]

1882
01:48:46.720 --> 01:48:49.640
[TANJIRO] That's it. It's over.

1883
01:48:51.350 --> 01:48:52.770
We won!

1884
01:48:53.730 --> 01:48:55.060
[sighs in relief]

1885
01:48:55.440 --> 01:48:57.360
[grunts in pain]

1886
01:48:57.730 --> 01:48:59.400
So lightheaded.

1887
01:49:01.240 --> 01:49:03.410
My muscles are cramping up.

1888
01:49:03.450 --> 01:49:05.570
My body's reached its limit.

1889
01:49:08.200 --> 01:49:11.000
Tanjiro. are you all ri--
[gasps]

1890
01:49:11.830 --> 01:49:14.540
His body
hasn't disintegrated yet.

1891
01:49:14.580 --> 01:49:17.210
Does... Does this mean...

1892
01:49:17.670 --> 01:49:18.710
Tan--

1893
01:49:19.380 --> 01:49:20.800
[♪ intense music playing]

1894
01:49:20.840 --> 01:49:22.170
[grunts]

1895
01:49:29.060 --> 01:49:32.850
[TANJIRO] He's moving!
His body is still intact!

1896
01:49:32.890 --> 01:49:35.150
The severed part is closing up!

1897
01:49:36.360 --> 01:49:38.230
[strained grunting]

1898
01:49:38.270 --> 01:49:40.150
I can't see straight.

1899
01:49:40.190 --> 01:49:41.780
I can't.

1900
01:49:45.110 --> 01:49:46.320
[impact grunts]

1901
01:49:51.370 --> 01:49:52.710
[strained gasping]

1902
01:49:52.750 --> 01:49:55.540
No. No way.

1903
01:49:55.580 --> 01:49:57.960
Slashing his neck
didn't kill him!

1904
01:49:58.000 --> 01:50:01.460
Is there some kind of condition
like with Gyutaro and Daki?

1905
01:50:01.920 --> 01:50:02.970
That can't be it.

1906
01:50:03.510 --> 01:50:07.010
His head disintegrated.
yet he hasn't given up!

1907
01:50:07.510 --> 01:50:10.850
It's like he's trying to evolve!

1908
01:50:12.680 --> 01:50:13.980
[impact grunts]

1909
01:50:17.150 --> 01:50:18.610
If we don't do something.

1910
01:50:18.650 --> 01:50:21.480
his head will stop
being his weak point like Muzan!

1911
01:50:22.150 --> 01:50:24.190
This battle isn't over yet.

1912
01:50:24.240 --> 01:50:26.150
I have to fight...

1913
01:50:26.910 --> 01:50:28.030
Tanjiro!

1914
01:50:28.070 --> 01:50:29.660
He's fainted.

1915
01:50:29.700 --> 01:50:31.240
Of course he has.

1916
01:50:31.290 --> 01:50:33.870
He's long since
passed his limit.

1917
01:50:38.710 --> 01:50:40.380
[grunts]

1918
01:50:43.510 --> 01:50:46.680
Water Breathing. Fourth Form:

1919
01:50:46.720 --> 01:50:49.180
[♪ epic music playing]

1920
01:50:49.220 --> 01:50:51.010
Striking Tide!

1921
01:50:55.980 --> 01:50:57.600
Ridiculous!

1922
01:50:57.650 --> 01:51:00.690
He lost his head and can still
regenerate that quickly?

1923
01:51:01.440 --> 01:51:03.570
[sword clanking]

1924
01:51:04.690 --> 01:51:06.820
[grunting]

1925
01:51:13.450 --> 01:51:16.370
[yelling]

1926
01:51:20.750 --> 01:51:22.710
-[coughs]
-[blood splatters]

1927
01:51:25.050 --> 01:51:27.420
I can't hear out of my left ear.

1928
01:51:27.470 --> 01:51:29.550
and my right hand has gone numb.

1929
01:51:30.970 --> 01:51:34.520
I can still grip my sword.
but who knows for how long.

1930
01:51:43.190 --> 01:51:44.270
Wait!

1931
01:51:45.360 --> 01:51:46.490
I...

1932
01:51:47.110 --> 01:51:50.200
I'm here. I'm still alive!

1933
01:51:50.700 --> 01:51:55.240
If you wanna kill Tanjiro.
you'll have to defeat me first!

1934
01:51:59.330 --> 01:52:01.580
[AKAZA] An indomitable spirit.

1935
01:52:01.630 --> 01:52:03.130
It will never bend.

1936
01:52:03.170 --> 01:52:06.210
no matter what crisis
it finds itself in.

1937
01:52:07.010 --> 01:52:09.680
We don't fight the way
samurai do.

1938
01:52:09.720 --> 01:52:11.760
We don't carry weapons.

1939
01:52:11.800 --> 01:52:14.930
though we carry our convictions
like swords.

1940
01:52:16.470 --> 01:52:19.770
[MAN] Though we carry
our convictions like swords.

1941
01:52:20.480 --> 01:52:24.520
our battles are waged
with our fists.

1942
01:52:25.940 --> 01:52:29.030
[AKAZA] You are such an eyesore!

1943
01:52:31.820 --> 01:52:33.200
[soft thump]

1944
01:52:39.540 --> 01:52:41.080
[GIRL] Please stop.

1945
01:52:47.300 --> 01:52:48.880
[AKAZA] Who is that?

1946
01:52:54.220 --> 01:52:56.180
Mr. Hakuji.

1947
01:52:56.220 --> 01:52:58.020
please. that's enough!

1948
01:52:58.060 --> 01:52:59.600
[♪ poignant music playing]

1949
01:53:01.140 --> 01:53:05.270
[AKAZA] Let go.
Let go of my hand.

1950
01:53:05.730 --> 01:53:07.270
Just who are you?

1951
01:53:09.070 --> 01:53:12.360
Stop. You don't
have to keep going. [sniffles]

1952
01:53:12.400 --> 01:53:14.950
Let's leave this place together.

1953
01:53:15.320 --> 01:53:17.240
[AKAZA] I can't.

1954
01:53:17.280 --> 01:53:20.620
I've still got unfinished
business with those two.

1955
01:53:22.000 --> 01:53:24.000
[GIRL]
What do you mean by that?

1956
01:53:24.580 --> 01:53:26.790
[AKAZA]
I've got to become stronger.

1957
01:53:26.840 --> 01:53:28.250
I've got to!

1958
01:53:28.750 --> 01:53:31.800
I'll kill anyone
who gets in my way.

1959
01:53:32.510 --> 01:53:35.220
Why do you want that? [sniffles]

1960
01:53:35.260 --> 01:53:38.300
For what reason
do you need to become stronger?

1961
01:53:39.850 --> 01:53:43.980
[AKAZA] Because...
unless I'm strong enough.

1962
01:53:44.020 --> 01:53:47.360
I won't be able to bring
any more back home to him.

1963
01:53:49.480 --> 01:53:51.780
He needs medicine.

1964
01:53:53.820 --> 01:53:56.660
I must become stronger.

1965
01:53:57.410 --> 01:53:58.700
[grunts angrily]

1966
01:53:59.030 --> 01:54:02.370
If I don't. I won't be able to
get away with the money I stole.

1967
01:54:03.710 --> 01:54:05.500
If I happen to be caught.

1968
01:54:05.540 --> 01:54:07.880
I won't be able
to defend myself.

1969
01:54:09.300 --> 01:54:11.050
If I'm not strong enough.

1970
01:54:11.090 --> 01:54:14.720
the magistrate will catch me
and have me beaten and lashed.

1971
01:54:15.180 --> 01:54:17.260
[whipping]

1972
01:54:18.140 --> 01:54:19.600
[MAGISTRATE]
We've already given you

1973
01:54:19.640 --> 01:54:22.520
three tattoos on each arm
for stealing.

1974
01:54:22.560 --> 01:54:25.100
Next time.
we'll chop off your hand.

1975
01:54:25.140 --> 01:54:26.690
[Hakuji chuckling]

1976
01:54:29.400 --> 01:54:31.400
[laughing]

1977
01:54:33.110 --> 01:54:35.150
[ATTENDANT]
Bow your head and repent!

1978
01:54:35.200 --> 01:54:37.530
If you're gonna chop it off.
then do it!

1979
01:54:37.570 --> 01:54:40.450
Go ahead and take both of them
if you're really serious.

1980
01:54:40.490 --> 01:54:42.660
I'll just use my feet to steal.

1981
01:54:42.700 --> 01:54:45.660
You're not gonna catch me again.
so make it count!

1982
01:54:48.130 --> 01:54:51.590
[MAGISTRATE] To hear this from
someone at such a young age.

1983
01:54:51.630 --> 01:54:54.260
This boy of 11 has already
taken on punishments

1984
01:54:54.300 --> 01:54:56.720
that would make
a grown man faint.

1985
01:54:57.970 --> 01:54:59.930
You are a demon child!

1986
01:54:59.970 --> 01:55:02.140
Go and call me
whatever names you want.

1987
01:55:02.180 --> 01:55:04.850
"Demon child" suits me
just damn fine!

1988
01:55:04.890 --> 01:55:07.140
They say I already had teeth
when I was born.

1989
01:55:07.190 --> 01:55:08.150
so I guess I am.

1990
01:55:08.190 --> 01:55:10.440
-Be quiet!
-Dirty little punk!

1991
01:55:10.480 --> 01:55:13.570
[HAKUJI] Don't you mean
"demon child." you bastard?

1992
01:55:13.610 --> 01:55:15.860
[grunts]

1993
01:55:17.320 --> 01:55:18.360
Hmph!

1994
01:55:18.400 --> 01:55:21.910
SOUTH TOWN MAGISTRATE'S OFFICE

1995
01:55:21.950 --> 01:55:23.040
[birds calling]

1996
01:55:23.080 --> 01:55:24.200
[MAN 1] Hakuji!

1997
01:55:24.250 --> 01:55:26.500
[MAN 2] Oh! [panting]
There you are!

1998
01:55:26.540 --> 01:55:29.000
[voice breaking] When you were
caught for stealing again.

1999
01:55:29.040 --> 01:55:32.250
word about it made its way
back to your father.

2000
01:55:32.790 --> 01:55:35.300
He hung himself. Hakuji!

2001
01:55:35.760 --> 01:55:36.800
Huh?

2002
01:55:40.010 --> 01:55:42.260
[Hakuji's father weakly]
"Dear Hakuji.

2003
01:55:43.390 --> 01:55:45.520
live an honest life.

2004
01:55:46.100 --> 01:55:48.310
You can still start over."

2005
01:55:49.100 --> 01:55:51.270
-[wind blowing]
-[leaves rustling]

2006
01:55:53.230 --> 01:55:54.280
[♪ poignant music continues]

2007
01:55:54.320 --> 01:55:55.530
[paper fluttering]

2008
01:55:55.570 --> 01:55:57.950
[HAKUJI]
What kind of world is this?

2009
01:55:57.990 --> 01:56:00.700
Are the poor
not even allowed to live?

2010
01:56:05.700 --> 01:56:06.870
[voice breaking] Dad.

2011
01:56:09.120 --> 01:56:11.250
To hell with this rotten world.

2012
01:56:11.290 --> 01:56:13.500
To all of it! [sobbing]

2013
01:56:16.000 --> 01:56:20.220
Every rotten human.
they can all burn in hell!

2014
01:56:20.260 --> 01:56:22.470
[grunts angrily]

2015
01:56:24.140 --> 01:56:27.560
Why do scumbags like them
get the privilege of living

2016
01:56:27.600 --> 01:56:30.850
when my father had to die
in such a horrible way?

2017
01:56:30.890 --> 01:56:33.480
He was never a burden to me.

2018
01:56:33.520 --> 01:56:35.610
So why would he feel that way?

2019
01:56:36.070 --> 01:56:39.400
You didn't do anything wrong.
Dad. You didn't!

2020
01:56:41.410 --> 01:56:43.700
I never cared
about getting beaten

2021
01:56:43.740 --> 01:56:45.620
after I was caught stealing.

2022
01:56:45.660 --> 01:56:49.460
Even if they beat me until every
bone in my body was broken.

2023
01:56:49.500 --> 01:56:51.540
I could take it all
for you. Dad.

2024
01:56:51.580 --> 01:56:52.960
For centuries even.

2025
01:56:53.000 --> 01:56:55.670
Learn your lesson!
Live an honest life!

2026
01:56:56.420 --> 01:56:59.420
[HAKUJI] Why don't you
shut the hell up. you scumbag?

2027
01:56:59.470 --> 01:57:01.430
Medicine's expensive.

2028
01:57:01.470 --> 01:57:04.140
The hell do you expect me
to do about that?

2029
01:57:05.600 --> 01:57:09.220
My dad's only getting thinner
and thinner by the day.

2030
01:57:10.310 --> 01:57:13.400
He's so malnourished.
you can see his bones.

2031
01:57:13.980 --> 01:57:17.360
I just want him to have
something better to eat.

2032
01:57:19.610 --> 01:57:22.320
I would have happily
given my life...

2033
01:57:24.240 --> 01:57:26.450
[voice breaking]
...if it meant saving his.

2034
01:57:32.580 --> 01:57:36.580
I'd have done anything...
for my father!

2035
01:57:39.460 --> 01:57:41.670
[breathing heavily]

2036
01:57:41.720 --> 01:57:44.590
-[clapping]
-Huh?

2037
01:57:44.630 --> 01:57:45.720
SORYU

2038
01:57:45.800 --> 01:57:47.850
[MAN] Well. well.
I am quite impressed.

2039
01:57:47.890 --> 01:57:50.470
I was called over
because someone said that

2040
01:57:50.520 --> 01:57:51.980
a child was about to be killed.

2041
01:57:52.020 --> 01:57:55.440
But you've laid out seven
grown-ups with your bare fists.

2042
01:57:55.480 --> 01:57:57.810
You've got some talent.
don't ya?

2043
01:57:57.860 --> 01:58:01.610
Not just anyone can take on
that many guys and still win.

2044
01:58:01.650 --> 01:58:04.280
[chuckling] That's the kind of
spunk I like to see.

2045
01:58:06.490 --> 01:58:08.620
[AKAZA] What's going on here?

2046
01:58:08.660 --> 01:58:10.660
Who is this man?

2047
01:58:11.660 --> 01:58:14.000
Could these be my memories?

2048
01:58:14.040 --> 01:58:16.040
How about you join my dojo?

2049
01:58:16.080 --> 01:58:18.290
I don't have any students
at the moment.

2050
01:58:18.750 --> 01:58:20.750
Stay out of my way.
you old fart!

2051
01:58:20.800 --> 01:58:22.260
You lookin' to die?

2052
01:58:22.300 --> 01:58:24.170
-Those tattoos.
-Uh?

2053
01:58:24.220 --> 01:58:25.840
You're a criminal from Edo.

2054
01:58:26.510 --> 01:58:28.390
I'm guessing
after being thrown out.

2055
01:58:28.430 --> 01:58:31.100
you eventually
found your way here.

2056
01:58:31.140 --> 01:58:33.140
I never asked for your opinion.

2057
01:58:33.180 --> 01:58:35.640
Now shut up
and get the hell out of my way!

2058
01:58:35.690 --> 01:58:39.270
[scoffs] All right.
Time to be reborn!

2059
01:58:40.150 --> 01:58:41.690
You ready?

2060
01:58:42.570 --> 01:58:46.910
That's it. Drop dead. old man!
[grunting]

2061
01:58:47.660 --> 01:58:48.910
[impact grunts]

2062
01:58:57.120 --> 01:58:59.590
[strained grunt. coughs. gasps]

2063
01:58:59.630 --> 01:59:00.960
[body thuds]

2064
01:59:04.630 --> 01:59:05.970
SORYU

2065
01:59:06.010 --> 01:59:07.970
[MAN] I'll give it to you.
You're tough.

2066
01:59:08.010 --> 01:59:08.970
DOJO

2067
01:59:09.010 --> 01:59:10.640
After that beating I gave you.

2068
01:59:10.680 --> 01:59:12.810
you came to
in less than an hour.

2069
01:59:13.850 --> 01:59:15.230
The name's Keizo.

2070
01:59:15.890 --> 01:59:17.810
I teach
the Soryu style of fighting

2071
01:59:17.850 --> 01:59:20.310
which uses only your bare hands.

2072
01:59:20.360 --> 01:59:23.480
Like I said. I don't have
any other students.

2073
01:59:23.980 --> 01:59:27.700
So I get by by doing whatever
odd jobs I can for people.

2074
01:59:30.280 --> 01:59:32.990
I have a daughter
who's in rather poor health.

2075
01:59:33.030 --> 01:59:35.410
I'd like you
to help look after her.

2076
01:59:35.910 --> 01:59:39.330
I'd be here if I could.
but I have to work.

2077
01:59:40.330 --> 01:59:42.790
My wife was pushed
to the edge of exhaustion

2078
01:59:42.840 --> 01:59:44.300
and drowned herself.

2079
01:59:45.300 --> 01:59:47.840
Life sure takes a bite
out of you. doesn't it?

2080
01:59:51.970 --> 01:59:53.930
If I were a more capable man.

2081
01:59:53.970 --> 01:59:56.720
my wife and daughter wouldn't
have suffered like this.

2082
01:59:59.730 --> 02:00:02.060
You said you knew
I was a criminal.

2083
02:00:02.110 --> 02:00:05.320
Are you really all right leaving
your daughter around me?

2084
02:00:06.690 --> 02:00:08.280
Why wouldn't I be?

2085
02:00:08.320 --> 02:00:11.070
I pummeled the criminal
out of you earlier. didn't I?

2086
02:00:11.110 --> 02:00:12.200
It's fine.

2087
02:00:13.070 --> 02:00:15.290
[♪ tender music playing]

2088
02:00:15.330 --> 02:00:17.450
[AKAZA] They are alike.

2089
02:00:25.090 --> 02:00:26.960
I get it now.

2090
02:00:28.260 --> 02:00:30.930
The reason
you disgusted me earlier.

2091
02:00:31.430 --> 02:00:32.640
It was because you would've

2092
02:00:32.680 --> 02:00:35.810
dredged up memories
of my worthless past.

2093
02:00:40.770 --> 02:00:43.310
[KEIZO]
This is my daughter. Koyuki.

2094
02:00:43.980 --> 02:00:45.360
[coughing]

2095
02:00:46.320 --> 02:00:48.780
[AKAZA] My worthless past.

2096
02:00:52.030 --> 02:00:53.450
Worthless.

2097
02:00:57.580 --> 02:01:00.410
[coughing]

2098
02:01:02.580 --> 02:01:06.000
Hakuji. I'm so sorry.

2099
02:01:06.880 --> 02:01:09.090
[chuckles] How are you feeling?

2100
02:01:09.130 --> 02:01:11.130
[coughing]

2101
02:01:11.170 --> 02:01:12.880
You okay being up?

2102
02:01:13.890 --> 02:01:14.930
[KOYUKI] Hmm.

2103
02:01:15.600 --> 02:01:18.890
Looks like you've got more color
in your cheeks this morning.

2104
02:01:18.930 --> 02:01:20.680
[chuckles] That's good.

2105
02:01:21.350 --> 02:01:22.440
Hmm.

2106
02:01:23.020 --> 02:01:26.270
-Huh?
-Oh. yeah. This boy.

2107
02:01:26.310 --> 02:01:28.360
His name is... [chuckles]

2108
02:01:28.400 --> 02:01:31.650
Well. I've asked him countless
times. and he won't say.

2109
02:01:31.700 --> 02:01:33.820
-Go on. get inside.
-[grunts]

2110
02:01:35.530 --> 02:01:36.740
Have a seat.

2111
02:01:38.540 --> 02:01:41.540
I wanna know his name
when I get back. Okay?

2112
02:01:53.130 --> 02:01:54.380
Um...

2113
02:01:54.840 --> 02:01:57.890
Your... Your face.

2114
02:01:58.470 --> 02:01:59.890
You're hurt.

2115
02:02:00.470 --> 02:02:02.020
Are you all right?

2116
02:02:05.270 --> 02:02:07.270
[AKAZA] "I'll make you better.

2117
02:02:07.310 --> 02:02:09.110
I'll save you.

2118
02:02:09.150 --> 02:02:10.530
Protect you."

2119
02:02:11.150 --> 02:02:15.700
In that past life. all I did
was spew a bunch of lies.

2120
02:02:16.160 --> 02:02:17.870
I was so pathetic.

2121
02:02:19.740 --> 02:02:22.200
[birds chirping]

2122
02:02:27.330 --> 02:02:29.750
[coughing]

2123
02:02:34.470 --> 02:02:36.130
Oh. thank you.

2124
02:02:37.640 --> 02:02:40.390
[HAKUJI] You don't have to
thank me every time. you know.

2125
02:02:40.430 --> 02:02:42.180
Just focus on resting.

2126
02:02:43.930 --> 02:02:47.810
I'm sorry for causing you
trouble like this.

2127
02:02:47.850 --> 02:02:49.980
It's fine. Really.

2128
02:02:51.820 --> 02:02:54.610
Koyuki. you want this closed?

2129
02:02:55.400 --> 02:02:58.820
Hmm. You can leave it open.

2130
02:03:00.740 --> 02:03:03.540
[HAKUJI] Koyuki was very
delicate and frail.

2131
02:03:04.950 --> 02:03:08.790
I would change out her towels
and nightgown and give her water

2132
02:03:08.830 --> 02:03:10.460
even throughout the night.

2133
02:03:11.040 --> 02:03:13.840
And whenever she needed
to use the lavatory.

2134
02:03:13.880 --> 02:03:16.220
obviously she was too weak
to be able to go

2135
02:03:16.260 --> 02:03:17.800
without needing assistance.

2136
02:03:21.760 --> 02:03:25.020
I was used to taking care
of the sick because of my dad.

2137
02:03:25.060 --> 02:03:28.770
and since I had an almost
inhuman physical endurance.

2138
02:03:28.810 --> 02:03:31.060
it really wasn't a big deal
for me.

2139
02:03:33.610 --> 02:03:36.030
[crows cawing]

2140
02:03:36.070 --> 02:03:38.530
Sorry to make you help me
all day.

2141
02:03:45.120 --> 02:03:47.960
[HAKUJI] Why do people
who are suffering from illness

2142
02:03:48.000 --> 02:03:50.420
always feel the need to say
they're sorry?

2143
02:03:51.290 --> 02:03:53.710
"Sorry to make you
do things for me."

2144
02:03:54.250 --> 02:03:56.840
"Sorry if my coughing's
bothering you."

2145
02:03:57.470 --> 02:04:00.590
"Sorry I can't put food
on the table like I should."

2146
02:04:02.680 --> 02:04:05.560
They didn't choose
to have to live this way.

2147
02:04:05.600 --> 02:04:07.810
Of course
they wanna breathe normally.

2148
02:04:07.850 --> 02:04:10.230
They can't help it
if they start coughing.

2149
02:04:11.480 --> 02:04:12.980
Out of everyone.

2150
02:04:13.020 --> 02:04:15.530
they're the ones
suffering the most.

2151
02:04:18.280 --> 02:04:20.740
Sorry again to make you do this.

2152
02:04:21.280 --> 02:04:23.120
Because of my sickness.

2153
02:04:23.160 --> 02:04:25.660
you're not able to do
your training.

2154
02:04:25.700 --> 02:04:28.040
or even go out and have fun.

2155
02:04:28.910 --> 02:04:30.920
[HAKUJI]
I don't care about having fun.

2156
02:04:30.960 --> 02:04:32.290
I never have.

2157
02:04:33.080 --> 02:04:36.250
As far as training goes.
I squeeze it in whenever I can.

2158
02:04:36.300 --> 02:04:37.800
so. it's fine.

2159
02:04:39.090 --> 02:04:40.170
Are you sure?

2160
02:04:40.840 --> 02:04:43.890
Even you need to take
a little break.

2161
02:04:44.720 --> 02:04:48.270
I hear there are fireworks
happening tonight.

2162
02:04:48.310 --> 02:04:49.980
You should go see them.

2163
02:04:51.310 --> 02:04:53.100
Fireworks. huh?

2164
02:04:53.150 --> 02:04:55.610
If you don't feel nauseous
at night.

2165
02:04:55.650 --> 02:04:59.150
I could carry you on my back
and go see them on the bridge.

2166
02:04:59.190 --> 02:05:00.400
Huh?

2167
02:05:03.950 --> 02:05:06.030
If you're not feeling up to it.

2168
02:05:06.080 --> 02:05:09.200
they'll do fireworks again
next year. and after that.

2169
02:05:09.250 --> 02:05:11.410
So. we can just go
when you're better.

2170
02:05:16.340 --> 02:05:18.250
[crying softly]

2171
02:05:20.010 --> 02:05:22.510
There was one thing
that was hard

2172
02:05:22.550 --> 02:05:24.010
about taking care of her.

2173
02:05:24.180 --> 02:05:27.100
And that was whenever she would
suddenly break out into tears

2174
02:05:27.140 --> 02:05:29.010
in the middle
of our conversations.

2175
02:05:29.680 --> 02:05:33.730
I can imagine how she felt.
bedridden and sick as she was.

2176
02:05:34.190 --> 02:05:36.610
but it still made me
uncomfortable.

2177
02:05:36.650 --> 02:05:37.940
[insects trilling]

2178
02:05:37.980 --> 02:05:40.530
SORYU

2179
02:05:48.240 --> 02:05:49.790
[impact grunts. wheezes]

2180
02:05:50.910 --> 02:05:53.750
[sighs] Ah. now I understand.

2181
02:05:54.290 --> 02:05:56.080
The symbol used for Hakuji.

2182
02:05:56.130 --> 02:05:57.670
it's the same as komainu.

2183
02:05:57.710 --> 02:05:59.800
[chuckles] That makes sense.

2184
02:05:59.840 --> 02:06:02.010
You and I really are the same.
after all.

2185
02:06:02.050 --> 02:06:05.260
We only thrive when we have
something to protect.

2186
02:06:05.300 --> 02:06:06.720
Just like the komainu

2187
02:06:06.760 --> 02:06:09.470
who protect the entrance
to the shrines. [chuckles]

2188
02:06:09.930 --> 02:06:12.060
[laughs heartily]

2189
02:06:12.640 --> 02:06:14.100
[♪ gentle music playing]

2190
02:06:14.310 --> 02:06:17.270
[HAKUJI] There was a story as to
how my master owned this land.

2191
02:06:17.310 --> 02:06:20.480
even though he wasn't a samurai
or anything like that.

2192
02:06:20.530 --> 02:06:23.990
He had rescued an elderly man
from a group of bandits.

2193
02:06:24.570 --> 02:06:26.780
The old man.
who had no living heirs.

2194
02:06:26.820 --> 02:06:29.070
was so impressed
by his Soryu technique

2195
02:06:29.120 --> 02:06:31.120
that he left him
not only his land.

2196
02:06:31.160 --> 02:06:33.080
but the dojo that lay upon it.

2197
02:06:36.250 --> 02:06:39.380
However. there were those
with envious eyes

2198
02:06:39.420 --> 02:06:42.420
who wished to have the land
and dojo all to themselves.

2199
02:06:43.090 --> 02:06:45.550
The Kenjutsu Dojo next door

2200
02:06:45.590 --> 02:06:48.340
started harassing
the Soryu Dojo.

2201
02:06:50.100 --> 02:06:53.180
Because of that.
the Soryu Dojo had a hard time

2202
02:06:53.220 --> 02:06:54.640
keeping any students.

2203
02:07:02.070 --> 02:07:06.950
But now. thanks to my training
here and caring for Koyuki...

2204
02:07:08.200 --> 02:07:11.370
...my heart has finally
found salvation.

2205
02:07:12.410 --> 02:07:14.580
[effort grunting]

2206
02:07:24.920 --> 02:07:26.970
[chuckles]

2207
02:07:30.510 --> 02:07:34.430
Three short years went by
and I turned 18.

2208
02:07:35.560 --> 02:07:37.180
Koyuki was 16.

2209
02:07:37.640 --> 02:07:40.350
She was almost never
bedridden anymore

2210
02:07:40.400 --> 02:07:42.900
and was now able
to live a normal life.

2211
02:07:44.070 --> 02:07:45.530
[chuckles]

2212
02:07:46.110 --> 02:07:47.360
[birds chirping]

2213
02:07:47.400 --> 02:07:49.360
Hakuji! Come here.

2214
02:07:50.120 --> 02:07:51.160
Yes. sir.

2215
02:07:51.620 --> 02:07:53.080
[insects trilling]

2216
02:07:53.120 --> 02:07:54.410
This dojo.

2217
02:07:54.540 --> 02:07:57.500
would you be willing
to take it over for me. Hakuji?

2218
02:07:58.210 --> 02:08:01.540
Koyuki's told me that
she's quite fond of you as well.

2219
02:08:02.500 --> 02:08:03.800
[exclaims in surprise]

2220
02:08:11.340 --> 02:08:14.470
[HAKUJI] As someone branded
with the tattoos of a criminal.

2221
02:08:14.510 --> 02:08:17.980
picturing any kind of future
for myself was hard enough.

2222
02:08:19.310 --> 02:08:23.650
But a future in which someone
could like a person like me?

2223
02:08:23.690 --> 02:08:25.730
I couldn't have even dreamed it.

2224
02:08:27.690 --> 02:08:30.320
My dad asked me
to lead an honest life.

2225
02:08:30.360 --> 02:08:32.450
something I never thought
was possible.

2226
02:08:32.950 --> 02:08:35.200
But perhaps it really is.

2227
02:08:36.660 --> 02:08:39.330
The faint hope
of being able to start over

2228
02:08:39.370 --> 02:08:41.580
began to swell within me

2229
02:08:41.620 --> 02:08:44.420
until it felt like
it was about to burst.

2230
02:08:49.510 --> 02:08:50.970
[♪ tender music playing]

2231
02:08:51.010 --> 02:08:53.640
But I could never have predicted
in that moment

2232
02:08:53.680 --> 02:08:55.640
that the two people
I wanted to protect

2233
02:08:55.680 --> 02:08:58.020
more than anything else
in this life...

2234
02:08:59.020 --> 02:09:01.560
...would end up
meeting the fate they did.

2235
02:09:06.480 --> 02:09:09.740
I had made a trip to Edo
to visit my dad's grave.

2236
02:09:10.530 --> 02:09:13.610
I wanted to let him know
that I was getting married.

2237
02:09:23.420 --> 02:09:27.250
I returned before even a full
day and night had passed.

2238
02:09:30.170 --> 02:09:33.050
Yet a sense of dread
came over me.

2239
02:09:34.050 --> 02:09:36.510
My chest started to feel tight

2240
02:09:36.550 --> 02:09:39.680
and a terrible feeling of nausea
overtook me.

2241
02:09:40.390 --> 02:09:41.730
[retches]

2242
02:09:42.190 --> 02:09:44.690
[MAN] Someone put poison
in the well!

2243
02:09:45.520 --> 02:09:47.070
[voice breaking]
The other school was so angry

2244
02:09:47.110 --> 02:09:49.030
they couldn't beat you
or Mr. Keizo.

2245
02:09:49.070 --> 02:09:51.280
they went and did this
out of spite!

2246
02:09:51.320 --> 02:09:53.860
It's atrocious. Unthinkable!

2247
02:09:53.910 --> 02:09:55.950
They even killed Koyuki!

2248
02:09:59.370 --> 02:10:00.790
[HAKUJI] Why?

2249
02:10:01.000 --> 02:10:04.460
Why is it whenever the ones I
care about are in mortal peril.

2250
02:10:04.500 --> 02:10:06.750
I'm never there for them?

2251
02:10:12.130 --> 02:10:13.470
[fireworks bursting in distance]

2252
02:10:14.090 --> 02:10:15.590
[crickets chirping]

2253
02:10:15.640 --> 02:10:18.720
I had even gone
and made a promise to her.

2254
02:10:20.810 --> 02:10:23.430
Are you sure
that I'm the one for you?

2255
02:10:25.520 --> 02:10:27.110
When we were children.

2256
02:10:27.560 --> 02:10:30.070
do you remember
when you talked to me

2257
02:10:30.110 --> 02:10:32.070
about seeing the fireworks?

2258
02:10:32.690 --> 02:10:37.030
-Huh? Uh... no. not really.
-[giggles softly]

2259
02:10:38.280 --> 02:10:40.990
Because of those little talks
we used to have.

2260
02:10:41.040 --> 02:10:43.700
there were a lot of things
which I took with me

2261
02:10:43.750 --> 02:10:45.830
that gave me hope
for the future.

2262
02:10:47.040 --> 02:10:50.500
You said even if we couldn't see
the fireworks that year.

2263
02:10:50.540 --> 02:10:54.010
we could go to the one
happening next year.

2264
02:10:54.050 --> 02:10:55.760
or the year after that.

2265
02:10:56.470 --> 02:10:59.720
The truth is.
I could never imagine a future

2266
02:10:59.760 --> 02:11:02.140
where I'd still be alive
a year later.

2267
02:11:02.180 --> 02:11:04.980
and certainly not
any longer than that.

2268
02:11:06.140 --> 02:11:08.310
My mother couldn't either.

2269
02:11:08.350 --> 02:11:11.480
I think that's why she ended up
taking her own life.

2270
02:11:11.980 --> 02:11:14.440
'cause she didn't
want to see me die.

2271
02:11:14.490 --> 02:11:16.280
Not just her.

2272
02:11:16.320 --> 02:11:19.160
I could tell my father
had given up hope. too.

2273
02:11:19.200 --> 02:11:20.950
deep down inside.

2274
02:11:22.080 --> 02:11:24.410
Because I was just so weak.

2275
02:11:25.750 --> 02:11:28.330
But you never treated me
that way.

2276
02:11:28.370 --> 02:11:31.040
You were able to see
a future for me.

2277
02:11:31.880 --> 02:11:35.380
You talked to me about
doing things as if...

2278
02:11:35.420 --> 02:11:38.510
As if it were obvious
that I'd still be here.

2279
02:11:38.550 --> 02:11:41.800
[crying softly]
That made me so very happy.

2280
02:11:53.150 --> 02:11:56.240
So. yes. I am sure
you're the one for me.

2281
02:11:58.280 --> 02:11:59.660
Would you...

2282
02:12:00.200 --> 02:12:02.330
Would you be my husband?

2283
02:12:02.740 --> 02:12:04.040
[distant explosion]

2284
02:12:09.330 --> 02:12:10.420
[fireworks bursting]

2285
02:12:10.460 --> 02:12:11.540
Yes.

2286
02:12:12.170 --> 02:12:14.800
I promise to become stronger
than anyone.

2287
02:12:15.420 --> 02:12:17.970
and protect you
for the rest of my life.

2288
02:12:19.340 --> 02:12:20.590
[exclaims]

2289
02:12:22.430 --> 02:12:25.770
[HAKUJI]
In the end. I was all talk.

2290
02:12:26.270 --> 02:12:29.390
I wasn't able to fulfill
any of my promises.

2291
02:12:29.940 --> 02:12:31.310
[chuckles]

2292
02:12:36.980 --> 02:12:39.150
[♪ foreboding music playing]

2293
02:12:41.950 --> 02:12:44.620
What do you want? [gasps]

2294
02:12:45.160 --> 02:12:46.870
You've got some nerve.

2295
02:12:46.910 --> 02:12:49.710
Wait. You're from the Soryu--

2296
02:12:50.580 --> 02:12:52.380
[screaming]

2297
02:12:52.420 --> 02:12:54.040
[♪ somber music playing]

2298
02:12:58.010 --> 02:12:59.340
[man grunts]

2299
02:13:02.890 --> 02:13:05.850
[Hakuji grunts. yells]

2300
02:13:05.890 --> 02:13:07.890
[groans angrily]

2301
02:13:13.060 --> 02:13:16.150
The family. the Soryu Dojo.
were recently poisoned.

2302
02:13:16.190 --> 02:13:18.480
And we believe
that a student of theirs

2303
02:13:18.530 --> 02:13:21.240
retaliated against
the Kenjutsu Dojo.

2304
02:13:21.280 --> 02:13:24.070
Sixty-seven people
were murdered inside.

2305
02:13:24.120 --> 02:13:26.780
He shattered their skulls
and crushed their organs.

2306
02:13:26.830 --> 02:13:28.240
all barehanded.

2307
02:13:28.790 --> 02:13:30.250
Not only were most of the bodies

2308
02:13:30.290 --> 02:13:32.790
mangled and mutilated
beyond recognition.

2309
02:13:32.830 --> 02:13:36.090
most had limbs missing
that we couldn't even locate.

2310
02:13:36.130 --> 02:13:38.460
Organs. limbs. brain matter.

2311
02:13:38.500 --> 02:13:40.550
even jaws and eyeballs
were found

2312
02:13:40.590 --> 02:13:43.720
strewn across the walls
and the ceiling of the premises.

2313
02:13:44.510 --> 02:13:47.550
This killer
was no ordinary human.

2314
02:13:48.930 --> 02:13:51.230
[wet squelching]

2315
02:13:52.600 --> 02:13:55.730
[breathing shakily]

2316
02:14:10.790 --> 02:14:12.910
[MUZAN] I heard
there was some commotion

2317
02:14:12.960 --> 02:14:14.830
about a demon sighting here.

2318
02:14:14.870 --> 02:14:17.380
even though I know
I never sent one.

2319
02:14:17.920 --> 02:14:20.800
So. I decided to come
see for myself.

2320
02:14:20.840 --> 02:14:23.010
Yet all I find is a human.

2321
02:14:23.590 --> 02:14:25.800
How utterly disappointing.

2322
02:14:26.890 --> 02:14:30.010
[HAKUJI] Move. or I'll kill you!

2323
02:14:31.180 --> 02:14:33.520
-[thuds]
-[splatters]

2324
02:14:34.940 --> 02:14:36.270
It just so happens

2325
02:14:36.310 --> 02:14:39.940
I was contemplating
creating 12 powerful demons.

2326
02:14:40.530 --> 02:14:42.780
I wonder if you'll be
able to withstand

2327
02:14:42.820 --> 02:14:45.320
the amount of blood
I'm about to give you.

2328
02:14:47.320 --> 02:14:49.530
You... [grunts]

2329
02:14:50.910 --> 02:14:54.540
...do whatever you want.

2330
02:14:55.420 --> 02:14:58.170
None of it matters.

2331
02:15:04.050 --> 02:15:06.090
[thunder rumbling]

2332
02:15:06.130 --> 02:15:08.260
[♪ somber music playing]

2333
02:15:09.050 --> 02:15:11.180
[grunting]

2334
02:15:12.720 --> 02:15:15.770
[AKAZA] After becoming a demon.
I lost my memories...

2335
02:15:16.350 --> 02:15:19.440
and once again.
started to seek out power.

2336
02:15:19.900 --> 02:15:21.230
-[thuds]
-[grunts]

2337
02:15:21.270 --> 02:15:22.610
-[flesh squelches]
-[grunts]

2338
02:15:29.490 --> 02:15:30.950
[clangs]

2339
02:15:31.830 --> 02:15:33.580
-[wet squelching]
-[sword clatters]

2340
02:15:34.700 --> 02:15:36.370
It's not enough!

2341
02:15:36.410 --> 02:15:38.250
It will never be enough!

2342
02:15:38.290 --> 02:15:40.170
[thunderclap]

2343
02:15:42.250 --> 02:15:45.510
Even though I had nothing
left to my name.

2344
02:15:45.550 --> 02:15:48.800
Even though I had nothing
worth fighting for anymore.

2345
02:15:51.050 --> 02:15:54.180
Even though my family
was no longer around

2346
02:15:54.220 --> 02:15:58.140
and I had no desire
to live in a world without them.

2347
02:16:00.690 --> 02:16:04.110
For over a century.
I committed senseless massacres

2348
02:16:04.150 --> 02:16:05.990
over and over again.

2349
02:16:06.900 --> 02:16:10.110
Thinking about it now.
it's pathetic.

2350
02:16:10.160 --> 02:16:11.820
It's absurd.

2351
02:16:12.700 --> 02:16:15.450
All those deaths
were meaningless.

2352
02:16:20.870 --> 02:16:22.960
Even if I died now.

2353
02:16:23.000 --> 02:16:26.510
I couldn't go where the other
three were waiting for me.

2354
02:16:27.670 --> 02:16:32.600
Damn you for dredging up
these memories. You bastard!

2355
02:16:34.470 --> 02:16:36.390
Pathetic humans.

2356
02:16:36.430 --> 02:16:39.770
clinging on to life
with their fragile bodies!

2357
02:16:40.890 --> 02:16:44.650
Even their strongest
eventually die

2358
02:16:44.690 --> 02:16:47.030
and vanish into thin air!

2359
02:16:47.650 --> 02:16:49.740
[flesh squelching]

2360
02:16:50.360 --> 02:16:52.200
[GIYU] He's still not dead?

2361
02:16:52.240 --> 02:16:54.070
You can't be serious.

2362
02:16:55.240 --> 02:16:57.950
I have to kill him
before it's too late.

2363
02:16:58.950 --> 02:17:03.130
If we let him regenerate.
there will be no stopping him.

2364
02:17:04.840 --> 02:17:06.250
-[loud thump]
-[gasps]

2365
02:17:08.210 --> 02:17:10.420
[grunts] I must have passed out.

2366
02:17:10.470 --> 02:17:11.930
What's going on?

2367
02:17:13.640 --> 02:17:17.600
His head's back!
But how is that even possible?!

2368
02:17:18.770 --> 02:17:20.850
I decapitated him!

2369
02:17:21.520 --> 02:17:23.690
[♪ intense music playing]

2370
02:17:26.980 --> 02:17:29.900
Destructive Death:
Annihilation Type.

2371
02:17:30.610 --> 02:17:32.780
Stop it!

2372
02:17:32.820 --> 02:17:35.530
[AKAZA] Seriously?
He can still move?

2373
02:17:35.580 --> 02:17:38.240
[TANJIRO] Mr. Giyu and I
are going to win!

2374
02:17:38.290 --> 02:17:42.210
Akaza. I'll behead you
as many times as it takes!

2375
02:17:45.080 --> 02:17:46.590
My sword!

2376
02:17:47.880 --> 02:17:50.300
[GIYU] It slipped
out of his hands.

2377
02:17:51.300 --> 02:17:52.930
[TANJIRO] I lost my grip.

2378
02:17:55.220 --> 02:17:56.470
[effort grunts]

2379
02:18:02.060 --> 02:18:03.890
[KEIZO] All right. young man.

2380
02:18:04.650 --> 02:18:06.360
Time to be reborn.

2381
02:18:08.480 --> 02:18:11.320
[AKAZA] I despise
those who are weak.

2382
02:18:13.400 --> 02:18:17.530
Weaklings... Instead of
fighting you fair and square.

2383
02:18:17.580 --> 02:18:20.120
they always resort
to cheap tricks.

2384
02:18:20.910 --> 02:18:22.710
They're atrocious.

2385
02:18:23.210 --> 02:18:25.330
They have no patience.

2386
02:18:25.370 --> 02:18:27.630
And they quickly grow desperate.

2387
02:18:27.670 --> 02:18:30.250
Just thinking about them
makes me sick.

2388
02:18:32.300 --> 02:18:35.970
I killed people
with my fists for protection.

2389
02:18:36.510 --> 02:18:40.220
I desecrated my master's
beloved Soryu with blood.

2390
02:18:41.520 --> 02:18:44.640
And I couldn't follow
my father's last wishes!

2391
02:18:47.060 --> 02:18:48.610
That's right.

2392
02:18:49.150 --> 02:18:51.570
The one I wanted to kill...

2393
02:18:53.280 --> 02:18:54.780
[clatters]

2394
02:18:57.030 --> 02:18:59.740
[TANJIRO] This couldn't be
worse. I dropped my sword!

2395
02:18:59.780 --> 02:19:01.580
[♪ foreboding music playing]

2396
02:19:01.620 --> 02:19:04.160
My fists aren't enough
to stop him!

2397
02:19:14.590 --> 02:19:17.090
He's about to unleash
the Annihilation Type move

2398
02:19:17.130 --> 02:19:18.970
he used on Mr. Rengoku!

2399
02:19:22.140 --> 02:19:25.350
I've got to take Mr. Giyu
with me out of the attack range!

2400
02:19:29.560 --> 02:19:32.190
[GIYU] Leave me! Save yourself!

2401
02:19:37.780 --> 02:19:39.820
[AKAZA] I've got to kill...

2402
02:19:42.280 --> 02:19:43.910
...that weakling

2403
02:19:44.370 --> 02:19:46.540
I've come to hate!

2404
02:20:05.220 --> 02:20:07.390
[♪ dramatic music playing]

2405
02:20:12.860 --> 02:20:14.480
[thudding]

2406
02:20:17.400 --> 02:20:19.530
[grunts. gasps]

2407
02:20:20.110 --> 02:20:22.240
[flesh squelching]

2408
02:20:26.370 --> 02:20:27.410
[blood spurts]

2409
02:20:29.460 --> 02:20:31.880
[TANJIRO]
He just attacked himself.

2410
02:20:34.630 --> 02:20:36.960
Why would he turn on himself
like that?

2411
02:20:37.880 --> 02:20:39.050
Why?

2412
02:20:40.630 --> 02:20:42.470
[♪ melancholic music playing]

2413
02:20:42.510 --> 02:20:43.890
For a second.

2414
02:20:43.930 --> 02:20:47.020
I could pick up the scent
of gratitude from him.

2415
02:20:48.270 --> 02:20:50.480
Why did he smile at me?

2416
02:20:54.270 --> 02:20:56.900
[AKAZA] That's enough! Stop it!

2417
02:20:56.940 --> 02:20:59.360
I don't want to regenerate!

2418
02:20:59.940 --> 02:21:01.780
Don't you get it?

2419
02:21:01.820 --> 02:21:03.660
The battle is over!

2420
02:21:05.620 --> 02:21:08.910
In that decisive moment. I lost.

2421
02:21:08.950 --> 02:21:11.250
That technique
he beheaded me with

2422
02:21:11.290 --> 02:21:13.460
was nothing short of perfection.

2423
02:21:14.710 --> 02:21:19.130
He anticipated my movements
and pivoted at the last second.

2424
02:21:19.170 --> 02:21:22.680
then struck me down before
I could unleash my attack.

2425
02:21:23.590 --> 02:21:25.430
It's over now.

2426
02:21:26.140 --> 02:21:30.730
Let me accept my fate
and go to hell.

2427
02:21:33.900 --> 02:21:35.860
[TANJIRO]
Where's he trying to go?

2428
02:21:42.070 --> 02:21:45.070
[gasps softly]
He stopped in his tracks.

2429
02:21:47.990 --> 02:21:49.290
[HAKUJI] Dad.

2430
02:21:51.160 --> 02:21:53.080
Are you feeling better now?

2431
02:21:53.620 --> 02:21:55.630
Are you in pain anymore?

2432
02:21:56.880 --> 02:21:59.510
No need to worry. son. I'm fine.

2433
02:22:00.300 --> 02:22:02.340
Thank you. Hakuji.

2434
02:22:08.760 --> 02:22:10.520
I'm sorry. Father.

2435
02:22:11.020 --> 02:22:14.390
I'm sorry I couldn't start over
like you wanted.

2436
02:22:14.440 --> 02:22:16.150
I failed you.

2437
02:22:19.190 --> 02:22:21.150
[KEIZO] Do not despair.

2438
02:22:21.740 --> 02:22:23.990
Regardless of
who you grow up to be.

2439
02:22:24.030 --> 02:22:27.570
you're still my son
and still my student.

2440
02:22:27.620 --> 02:22:29.830
Heaven may not accept you...

2441
02:22:31.160 --> 02:22:32.790
...but you needn't worry.

2442
02:22:32.830 --> 02:22:34.920
Our hearts will be with you.

2443
02:22:37.210 --> 02:22:38.710
Master.

2444
02:22:39.920 --> 02:22:41.050
[gasps]

2445
02:22:41.590 --> 02:22:45.220
Didn't you say you were seeking
to become stronger than anyone?

2446
02:22:45.260 --> 02:22:50.220
Don't tell me you intend
to let it end like this. Akaza.

2447
02:22:52.180 --> 02:22:55.560
[AKAZA] That's right.
I can't die here.

2448
02:22:55.600 --> 02:22:57.650
I have to get stronger!

2449
02:22:58.940 --> 02:23:00.820
So what if I got beheaded?

2450
02:23:00.860 --> 02:23:03.570
Who cares
if I win or lose the fight?

2451
02:23:04.280 --> 02:23:06.910
If I kill those
who stand in my way...

2452
02:23:07.700 --> 02:23:10.660
then there's still hope
for me to get stronger!

2453
02:23:13.120 --> 02:23:14.580
I made a promise!

2454
02:23:14.620 --> 02:23:16.620
I'm not about to break it!

2455
02:23:22.500 --> 02:23:24.840
[breathing shakily]

2456
02:23:25.880 --> 02:23:27.010
[♪ tender music playing]

2457
02:23:27.050 --> 02:23:28.760
Mr. Hakuji.

2458
02:23:29.470 --> 02:23:31.300
thank you so much.

2459
02:23:31.810 --> 02:23:33.720
You've done more than enough.

2460
02:23:38.060 --> 02:23:39.480
It's okay.

2461
02:23:39.980 --> 02:23:41.690
We're all right now.

2462
02:23:41.730 --> 02:23:43.320
Akaza!

2463
02:23:43.360 --> 02:23:45.490
[♪ epic cinematic music playing]

2464
02:23:49.110 --> 02:23:51.990
[wailing]

2465
02:23:53.330 --> 02:23:54.700
Sorry!

2466
02:23:54.750 --> 02:23:57.460
I'm sorry
I couldn't protect you!

2467
02:23:58.080 --> 02:24:01.420
I wasn't there
when you needed me to be!

2468
02:24:02.040 --> 02:24:05.210
I couldn't keep
a single promise I made.

2469
02:24:05.260 --> 02:24:09.130
I'm sorry. [sobbing] Please
try to forgive me. Koyuki.

2470
02:24:09.180 --> 02:24:12.510
I'm so sorry.
[continues sobbing]

2471
02:24:15.430 --> 02:24:17.890
I'm so happy you remembered us.

2472
02:24:17.940 --> 02:24:20.650
I can't tell you
how happy that makes me.

2473
02:24:21.310 --> 02:24:24.570
And to see you now
as the man that I once knew.

2474
02:24:24.610 --> 02:24:26.400
I'm so grateful.

2475
02:24:34.660 --> 02:24:37.620
Welcome home. Hakuji.

2476
02:24:41.960 --> 02:24:43.750
Hey. Hakuji.

2477
02:24:44.130 --> 02:24:45.500
Welcome home.

2478
02:24:54.220 --> 02:24:55.850
[HAKUJI] I'm back now.

2479
02:24:56.390 --> 02:24:58.640
I'm finally back home.

2480
02:25:01.940 --> 02:25:03.690
Welcome back home...

2481
02:25:04.690 --> 02:25:06.190
...my darling.

2482
02:25:10.490 --> 02:25:11.610
[gasps softly]

2483
02:25:12.820 --> 02:25:14.990
[♪ gentle music playing]

2484
02:25:33.840 --> 02:25:35.550
[Tanjiro breathing shakily]

2485
02:25:35.600 --> 02:25:37.140
He vanished.

2486
02:25:40.100 --> 02:25:41.430
[gasps]

2487
02:25:42.640 --> 02:25:44.190
[inhales deeply]

2488
02:25:45.150 --> 02:25:46.650
[exhales sharply]

2489
02:25:48.530 --> 02:25:50.740
It's over. Right?

2490
02:25:54.870 --> 02:25:56.240
Gotta hurry...

2491
02:25:57.240 --> 02:26:00.700
...and get to where
Ms. Tamayo is.

2492
02:26:01.660 --> 02:26:02.870
And then...

2493
02:26:09.840 --> 02:26:11.880
[grunts weakly] Tanjiro.

2494
02:26:17.850 --> 02:26:18.970
[exhales]

2495
02:26:21.230 --> 02:26:24.140
[Kasugai Crow cawing]

2496
02:26:24.980 --> 02:26:29.820
Tanjiro! Giyu!
Have defeated Upper Three!

2497
02:26:29.860 --> 02:26:33.820
They are unable to stay
conscious due to exhaustion!

2498
02:26:33.860 --> 02:26:35.450
They've passed out!

2499
02:26:40.830 --> 02:26:46.750
Tanjiro! Giyu!
Have defeated Upper Three!

2500
02:26:46.790 --> 02:26:48.590
Upper Three!

2501
02:26:53.260 --> 02:26:54.670
[♪ haunting
choral music playing]

2502
02:26:54.720 --> 02:26:56.680
[KOKUSHIBO] Akaza!

2503
02:26:56.720 --> 02:26:59.550
His presence has vanished.

2504
02:27:01.470 --> 02:27:04.230
What a baffling conclusion.

2505
02:27:07.190 --> 02:27:08.650
Akaza...

2506
02:27:10.020 --> 02:27:14.190
...what happened to your burning
ambition to defeat me?

2507
02:27:16.110 --> 02:27:20.530
To think you'd abandoned
everything you stood for...

2508
02:27:21.660 --> 02:27:25.460
...and turned your back
on the path to greatness.

2509
02:27:26.290 --> 02:27:28.080
[♪ music intensifies]

2510
02:27:32.170 --> 02:27:35.220
Your weakness appalls me.

2511
02:27:40.340 --> 02:27:41.470
Huh?

2512
02:27:42.470 --> 02:27:43.680
[exclaims]

2513
02:27:44.060 --> 02:27:45.230
This feeling.

2514
02:27:45.770 --> 02:27:48.310
Could Lord Akaza be dead?

2515
02:27:49.770 --> 02:27:51.110
Very strange.

2516
02:27:51.150 --> 02:27:54.690
Surely my imagination
must be running wild. right?

2517
02:27:55.190 --> 02:28:00.030
It almost felt like Lord Akaza
had turned into some creature.

2518
02:28:02.530 --> 02:28:05.290
But now that he's dead.
I guess it doesn't matter.

2519
02:28:05.330 --> 02:28:07.460
-[laughs]
-[rattling]

2520
02:28:08.500 --> 02:28:10.290
Let's see.

2521
02:28:10.330 --> 02:28:11.710
where was I?

2522
02:28:12.290 --> 02:28:14.460
Oh. I remember.

2523
02:28:14.920 --> 02:28:17.670
I had just asked for your name.
hadn't I?

2524
02:28:18.800 --> 02:28:20.590
[Kanao breathing shakily]

2525
02:28:30.560 --> 02:28:33.020
[KASUGAI CROW] Tanjiro! Giyu!

2526
02:28:33.070 --> 02:28:35.480
Have defeated Upper Three!

2527
02:28:35.530 --> 02:28:37.030
Upper Three!

2528
02:28:37.690 --> 02:28:38.950
Did you hear that?

2529
02:28:38.990 --> 02:28:42.410
Yes. Excellent work. Tomioka.

2530
02:28:42.950 --> 02:28:45.080
Excellent work. Kamado.

2531
02:28:45.790 --> 02:28:48.000
[♪ closing theme song playing]

2532
02:28:50.170 --> 02:28:53.670
Mr. Tomioka and Tanjiro.
They did it!

2533
02:28:53.710 --> 02:28:56.420
[IGURO] Now it's our turn
to follow their lead.

2534
02:28:56.960 --> 02:28:58.300
Right!

2535
02:29:05.680 --> 02:29:06.930
[demon snarling]

2536
02:29:12.730 --> 02:29:15.110
Hang in there. Agatsuma!

2537
02:29:19.110 --> 02:29:20.490
[cawing]

2538
02:29:20.530 --> 02:29:22.530
[INOSUKE] Start flapping
those wings faster.

2539
02:29:22.570 --> 02:29:24.120
or I'm gonna keep poking!

2540
02:29:24.660 --> 02:29:26.080
You're gonna use those wings

2541
02:29:26.120 --> 02:29:28.040
to show me where
the strongest demon is!

2542
02:29:28.080 --> 02:29:29.370
You hear me?

2543
02:29:29.870 --> 02:29:32.080
I'm coming through!

2544
02:29:32.580 --> 02:29:33.750
Hyah!

2545
02:29:33.790 --> 02:29:35.250
Now we're talkin'!

2546
02:29:35.290 --> 02:29:38.050
I'm sensing a powerful
demon over here.

2547
02:29:38.090 --> 02:29:39.670
[cawing]

2548
02:29:44.930 --> 02:29:46.890
Where is Big Brother?

2549
02:29:56.980 --> 02:29:58.980
Where are all the Upper Ranks?

2550
02:29:59.030 --> 02:30:01.240
Tell me! Come on!

2551
02:30:01.740 --> 02:30:04.450
I'm gonna bury you all!

2552
02:30:12.290 --> 02:30:14.170
[KANATA] The passageway
leading north

2553
02:30:14.210 --> 02:30:16.080
on the 88th level is clear.

2554
02:30:16.130 --> 02:30:17.790
No sign of Muzan.

2555
02:30:18.460 --> 02:30:20.300
[KUINA]
The 100th and 27th levels

2556
02:30:20.340 --> 02:30:22.970
in the southeast are clear.
No sign of Muzan.

2557
02:30:23.970 --> 02:30:25.640
He's in here.

2558
02:30:25.680 --> 02:30:27.010
He has to be.

2559
02:30:27.050 --> 02:30:28.260
But where is he?

2560
02:30:29.180 --> 02:30:31.430
[KANATA] There's no sign
of Muzan on any of the levels

2561
02:30:31.480 --> 02:30:33.890
from 90 to 100. either.

2562
02:30:35.650 --> 02:30:38.650
[KUINA] Covering the entire
100th and 33rd levels.

2563
02:30:38.690 --> 02:30:40.230
No sign of Muzan.

2564
02:30:41.730 --> 02:30:43.950
Our crows will find you.

2565
02:30:43.990 --> 02:30:46.740
You can only hide from us
for so long.

2566
02:30:47.280 --> 02:30:50.530
We'll search every inch
of this Infinity Castle.

2567
02:30:50.580 --> 02:30:54.660
Even if you try to run from us.
we will hunt you down.

2568
02:30:55.120 --> 02:30:56.750
[plucking]

2569
02:30:58.750 --> 02:31:00.170
FOUR

2570
02:31:00.750 --> 02:31:02.920
[continues plucking
biwa strings]

2571
02:31:09.260 --> 02:31:12.350
Multi-layered structures
are headed northeast.

2572
02:31:12.850 --> 02:31:16.480
Attention! The castle's
expanding in every direction.

2573
02:31:16.520 --> 02:31:18.270
Folding over themselves!

2574
02:31:18.310 --> 02:31:21.570
[Nakime plucking
biwa strings faster]

2575
02:31:22.320 --> 02:31:24.070
[BOTH] And becoming one!

2576
02:31:29.820 --> 02:31:32.410
[gasps] You can't be serious.

2577
02:31:33.540 --> 02:31:34.950
No.

2578
02:31:35.000 --> 02:31:36.160
It's fine.

2579
02:31:36.210 --> 02:31:38.210
We've come too far to lose.

2580
02:31:38.960 --> 02:31:40.960
Crows. push forward.

2581
02:31:41.000 --> 02:31:42.960
and find Muzan!

2582
02:31:47.720 --> 02:31:50.850
[MUZAN] Try all you want.
Demon Slayers!

2583
02:31:50.890 --> 02:31:53.010
But each one of you
will meet your end

2584
02:31:53.060 --> 02:31:54.640
before ever reaching me!

2585
02:31:55.180 --> 02:31:58.980
You may be feeling smug after
beheading one of my Upper Ranks.

2586
02:31:59.020 --> 02:32:03.070
but unless you could kill me.
your triumph is meaningless!

2587
02:32:03.900 --> 02:32:07.030
[laughs maliciously]

2588
02:32:07.070 --> 02:32:09.780
You're all going to die
the most pointless deaths

2589
02:32:09.820 --> 02:32:12.740
all the while
never seeing my face!

2590
02:32:12.780 --> 02:32:17.040
I can't think of a more fitting
end for the Demon Slayer Corps.

2591
02:32:17.540 --> 02:32:20.000
Mark my words.
When I'm done here.

2592
02:32:20.040 --> 02:32:22.840
I'm going to make you regret
the day you were born!

2593
02:32:23.920 --> 02:32:25.210
Just wait.

2594
02:32:25.260 --> 02:32:28.430
You're each going to squirm
and writhe in pain.

2595
02:32:28.470 --> 02:32:30.340
Draw your final breaths

2596
02:32:30.390 --> 02:32:33.470
because for every one
of you Demon Slayers.

2597
02:32:33.510 --> 02:32:37.060
there is no tomorrow!

2598
02:32:47.150 --> 02:32:48.690
[KASUGAI CROW 1] Please. Giyu.

2599
02:32:52.200 --> 02:32:54.160
Don't die!

2600
02:33:01.120 --> 02:33:04.960
[KASUGAI CROW 2] We can't
have you dying on us. Tanjiro.

2601
02:33:17.350 --> 02:33:19.600
[music ends]

2602
02:33:19.640 --> 02:33:21.810
[♪ closing theme song playing]

2602
02:33:22.305 --> 02:34:22.322
